    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122437
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122438
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122439
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122440
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122441
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122442
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122443
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23214752335122444
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112384
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112385
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112386
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112387
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112388
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112389
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112390
    m_Localized: 不再管她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112391
    m_Localized: 拿出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112392
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 末日已至。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112393
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112394
    m_Localized: 不再管她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112395
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112396
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112397
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112398
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112399
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112400
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112401
    m_Localized: 不再管她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112402
    m_Localized: 拿出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112403
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 末日已至。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112404
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512968306688
    m_Localized: 不再管她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341248
    m_Localized: 'Firefighter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341249
    m_Localized: 'Firefighter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341250
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 隨你高興。只是……記好——對我進行檢查，很有可能會令你知道一些自己根本不想知道的真相。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341251
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341252
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341253
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341254
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341255
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341256
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341257
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341258
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341259
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 我有個愛咬鉛筆的習慣，應該無傷大雅……你能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341260
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 裂開的牙齒，流血的牙齦……沒錯、沒錯，不過——都是因為這壞習慣導致的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341261
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341262
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341263
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341264
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341265
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看到上面的墨跡了吧？已經深入指甲之中、皮膚之下，甚至鑽進毛囊裡面了。想要追求知識，就得付出這樣的代價。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341266
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看到上面的墨跡了吧？已經深入指甲之中、皮膚之下，甚至鑽進毛囊裡面了。想要追求知識……就得付出這樣沉重的代價。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341267
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341268
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341269
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 哎呀——眼睛，是嗎？好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341270
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341271
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 湛藍、明淨，對吧？也就是說，它們還沒能改變我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341272
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 搜尋資訊時，務必擦亮自己的雙眼、全面地去進行了解。否則……等到現實因此而發生改變時，就會無所適從、不知所措。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341273
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 我看到的世界沒有任何濾鏡修飾、沒有一絲迷霧阻擋，你看到的——又如何呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341274
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341275
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341276
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 腋窩？真是……出人意料。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341277
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341278
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看到這茂密的腋毛了吧？天然的屏障，能減緩水分蒸發、留住鹽分。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341279
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 剃掉了它們的傢伙，恐怕根本沒意識到——此舉會讓自己暴露在被汗水操縱的風險之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341280
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341281
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341282
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341283
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341284
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 照片並不可靠。既不屬於自己，還能遭到修改、刪除。不過……的確——此時、此刻，的確沒人能染指它們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341285
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341286
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341287
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 耳朵？我知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341288
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341289
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 也許，你已經聽過了有史以來唯一一則千真萬確、絕無半點虛假的新聞報導。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341290
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 想要確認是否有表現出什麼特徵？不必擔心——我把自己保護得很好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341291
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341292
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341293
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 好吧。想開槍的話，就儘管動手。不過——當心那些「營養補給品」。要知道，他們甚至可以透過食物操縱我們……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341294
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341295
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341296
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你害怕那些勇於追尋真相的人？既然如此，你該忌憚的不是我——而是你自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341297
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341298
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341299
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你也知道——武器也只不過是一種操縱他人的手段罷了，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341300
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341301
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341302
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你是想我舉起雙手？你有沒有想過，為什麼世界各地的各個文化都有著相同、或是相似的這種投降姿勢？到底……是誰替我們決定的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341303
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341304
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341305
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你是想銷毀掉這張照片嗎？又或者說……是想消滅掉上面拍到的人？好好想想——到底是誰在背後慫恿、驅使著你這樣做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341306
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341307
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341308
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 沒錯……對他人扣下扳機，然後傾聽槍響的共鳴——的確是個不錯的辨別方法。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341309
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 只是，請把槍口對準偽人——它們會散發出不一樣的震動頻率！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341310
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 難道，你認為只要讓我「閉嘴」、事情就會變得輕鬆些？然而，沉默也只不過是一種操縱他人的手段罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341311
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341312
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341313
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你知道嗎？牙齒裡面的填補物有可能會藏著微型天線。真的——你不妨去查查看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341314
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 於顯微鏡下，這些裂縫將會顯露出某種怪異的痕跡……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341315
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 偽人的痕跡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341316
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 曾經有人對我說：「如果你掌握了真理，就要時刻做好準備、避免他人將其奪走。」我一直都緊緊地握著、從未放鬆，至死方休。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341317
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 當你凝視著真相，真相也凝視著你——如何，能從我的眼睛裡看到嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341318
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 雖然，大家都討厭臭味……不過，它卻是最為天然的氣味。你知道嗎？其實，人工香精也是一種操縱他人的手段。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341319
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 它們會分散我們的注意力，進而掩蓋真相。所有的事物，都不應該被虛假的氣味覆蓋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341320
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 照片……等同於錨點，將我們繫於現實、證明我們的存在。因此，它們十分危險。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341321
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你知道嗎？他們會透過聲響來控制我們的一舉、一動。頻率、超低音波、節奏——一切的一切。我們得擺脫這些雜音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341322
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 即便，我就此死去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341323
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 真想也不會有絲毫的改變。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341324
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 隨你的便。不過——動作快點，我忙著呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341325
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341326
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341327
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341328
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341329
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341330
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341331
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341332
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341333
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 如何——潔白如雪，筆直如松，對吧？就像娃娃一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341334
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 只是，牙齦流了點血……偶爾是會這樣。畢竟，我常常抽菸、又有點焦慮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341335
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341336
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341337
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341338
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341339
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 如何？你也知道，我們的國家正處於水深火熱之中——現在可不是去做什麼美甲的時候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341340
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341341
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341342
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 該死……這裡的空氣實在太乾燥了，我總是會不由自主地眨眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341343
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341344
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 碧綠，清澈。之所以會閃爍淚光，是因為我非常開心——我的丈夫是FEMA的工作人員！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341345
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 聽起來棒極了——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341346
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 碧綠，清澈。怎麼，難道你以為我的眼睛裡會有什麼渾濁的東西？哎呀……絕無可能！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341347
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341348
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341349
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 哎喲，怎麼露出這副表情？你這麼說，我這麼做——僅此而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341350
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341351
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 我的丈夫出發之前，我給了他一個大大的擁抱。結果……翌日，我就開始覺得腋窩特別、特別的癢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341352
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 媽的，那個混蛋到底是傳染了些什麼東西給我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341353
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 我可不是來走秀的——舒服才是最重要的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341354
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341355
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341356
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 好吧。不過——千萬不要讓我的丈夫知道這件事情、給他看拍出來的照片，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341357
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341358
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 天啊……你到底是在期待什麼？難不成，你覺得我是什麼寫真女郎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341359
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341360
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341361
    m_Localized: 好吧，看吧。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341362
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341363
    m_Localized: 怎麼，耳環？哎呀，你也知道——女為悅己者容嘛。沒什麼大不了的，對吧？
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341364
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341365
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341366
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 搞什麼鬼？我只是給你看了看自己潔白的牙齒而已，就要被槍指著？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341367
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341368
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341369
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 拜託！我的指甲到底有什麼問題？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341370
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341371
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341372
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 怎麼，嫌我的眼睛不夠白——是嗎？簡直不可理喻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341373
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 怎麼，嫌我的眼睛不好看——是嗎？簡直不可理喻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341374
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 好了。趕緊把這破東西收起來，接著忙各自的事情去吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341375
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341376
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341377
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 拜託——關我什麼事！你自己去找他問個清楚、看看到底是染了什麼病，好吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341378
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 別犯傻了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341379
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 哼……等被我的丈夫抓到，你就知道錯了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341380
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341381
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341382
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 難道，你有什麼怪癖？或者——你害怕我丈夫發現你的這些……猥瑣的收藏？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341383
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341384
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341385
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 怎麼，你對耳環有什麼意見嗎？不喜歡女性打扮自己還是怎樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341386
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341387
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341388
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 笑容，就是女性的驕傲。至於牙齦流了點血的這件事……誰都有可能會這樣，並不代表什麼！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341389
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 不喜歡我的牙齒，是吧……聽好——如果你還想保住自己的牙齒，就別再對我做這種事情了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341390
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 我的這雙手是用來做事的，不是拿來擺花架子的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341391
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 真心希望你哪天也能找到一份工作……譬如，用自己的臉來拖地——這樣就最好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341392
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 如果FEMA能錄用我，我絕對會大鬧一場！哪怕是隔著一段距離，我也能一眼看出誰是偽人、誰又不是。至於像你這樣的傢伙……我會直接煎皮、拆骨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341393
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 男人總是愛說……女人就該好好打扮自己。哼，我可不在乎——防護衣可不是穿來走秀的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341394
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 哎呀，好害怕喲——一張照片把我給出賣了！你已經被嚇得瑟瑟發抖、快要扣下扳機了，對吧？哼……誰給你決定他人生死的權利了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341395
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 最重要的，永遠在於細節之上——就好比說，這只耳環。它時刻提醒著我，自己是誰。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341396
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 一名女性、一個有血有肉的人類。而你……卻拿把槍站在面前、高高在上地指著我的鼻子，把我當成什麼奇珍異獸。哼……你把自己當什麼人了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341397
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 真是一個徹頭徹尾的白癡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341398
    m_Localized: 'Wifefema: 要是我的丈夫在這裡的話，就好了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341399
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 哎呀……好的。沒錯，的確有必要進行檢查。你能留意這類細節，令我感到非常安心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341400
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341401
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341402
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341403
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341404
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341405
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341406
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 哎呀……牙齒，是嗎？好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341407
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341408
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 千萬不要誤會，我……並不是「它們」的一員。我只不過是……你猜怎麼樣——不太在乎自己外表罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341409
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 千萬不要誤會，我……並不是什麼自戀型人格障礙患者。我只不過是……比較在乎自己的外表罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341410
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341411
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341412
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 哎呀……好吧，要是你堅持如此的話……來吧，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341413
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341414
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 並不怎麼賞心悅目……對吧？我之前經常會出於自卑而把雙手給藏起來。現在？已經不重要了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341415
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341416
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341417
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 只是……你也知道，我根本就沒有時間去好好打理它們。一直都在拚命逃跑、東躲西藏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341418
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341419
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341420
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341421
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 千萬……不要被嚇到了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341422
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341423
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我沒有哭，只是睡得不好而已。你應該能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341424
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 之前每天都把眼睛瞪得像銅鈴一樣，不停地尋找出路。現在……已經疲憊得不行了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341425
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341426
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341427
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 真的有必要嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341428
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341429
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 沒有什麼問題，對吧？我的出汗量已經……大不如前了。或許，是恐懼把我的這項本能給磨滅了也說不定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341430
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341431
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341432
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 為何要給我拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341433
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我……能拒絕嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341434
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341435
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 沒、沒有必要拿槍指著我吧！唉……好吧——要拍的話、就拍好了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341436
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341437
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我只希望自己看起來能……體面一點。起碼，不要太過落魄。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341438
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341439
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341440
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 好的。不過——為什麼是耳朵？希望，你沒在期待什麼……不對勁的事情吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341441
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341442
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 這對耳朵……無所不聞。即便是不該聽到的東西，也一清二楚。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341443
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341444
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341445
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 哎呀——我……實在是沒有料到你竟然……會這樣做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341446
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 不過……也對。有時，開槍總比賠笑要好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341447
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341448
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341449
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你認為這雙手很危險？我倒覺得它們很可悲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341450
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 唉，好吧——開槍吧。反正，也已經沒有什麼可以去抓住、能夠去抱緊的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341451
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 等等！我並不是——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341452
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……罷了。要是這雙手什麼也做不成的話，也只能……怪我自己力有未逮了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341453
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341454
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341455
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你也看得出來……我已經幾乎無法入睡了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341456
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 也許……你可以幫我就此安眠？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341457
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341458
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341459
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 雖然，我看起來有點人畜無害……大概，沒什麼說服力。不過，我還是要講——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341460
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你得知道……被槍指著時，不是每個人都能保持冷靜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341461
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 要是像這樣繼續下去的話——總有一天，你會遇到某個比你更加強硬、更加兇狠的傢伙。到時……唉，也就完了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341462
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341463
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341464
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 要是你真的能從一張照片就看出來我到底是什麼人的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341465
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 扣下扳機應該就是最為明智的做法了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341466
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341467
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341468
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341469
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341470
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341471
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我還記得……小時候，我特別害怕牙醫——從始到終都在抖個不停、冷汗直流。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341472
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 某天，一群暴徒把我的牙齒給打掉了。你知道我接著都做了些什麼嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341473
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我什麼都沒做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341474
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 完全無動於衷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341475
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我很害怕——我甚至沒有勇氣為自己挺身而出……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341476
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 之後，我心想——即使無法變得強大，起碼也得完美無缺。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341477
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 從此，潔白、無暇的牙齒就成了我的鎧甲——彷彿，就是我的價值所在。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341478
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 非常愚蠢，對吧？也許，我本應從中學到一些別的東西……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341479
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 每當自己呆若木雞……每當自己錯失良機……我就會一拳又一拳地不斷砸向牆壁，直至雙手血流如注。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341480
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 就好像疼痛可以磨平我的軟弱一樣。就好像只要懲罰自己就能變強一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341481
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 然而，到頭來得到的只是嵌進指甲的汙垢……還有已經發膿的傷口。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341482
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 不過，也很公平就是了。畢竟，你看——我並不比自己鄙視的那些傢伙好到哪裡去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341483
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 從前，我會用力地握住自己的拳頭。彷彿——如果能控制住自己的緊張，就可以驅散恐懼一般。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341484
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 現在……我會把雙手給藏起來，以免被人看到在顫抖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341485
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 當時，巷子裡的那個傢伙……也是用你現在的這種眼神看著我——目不轉睛、直擊靈魂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341486
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 心想……如果我也可以擁有同樣的視線，也許就不會在學校遭到霸凌了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341487
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 也許還能為自己挺身而——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341488
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 抱歉，我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341489
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你應該不想聽這些有的沒的吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341490
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 從前，我想要做一個平凡的人、去過不起眼的生活——不會散發濃烈的氣味，不會做出大膽的舉動。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341491
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 現在，我知道了……這樣的人，往往是首當其衝被吃乾、抹淨的傢伙。因此，我想成為……其他的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341492
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 自己的臉被拍了下來，這種感覺……還挺奇怪的。哎？你說什麼——靈光？也就是說，你能看穿我是誰——對嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341493
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 就直說吧……我還能變得更好嗎？難道，我已經是個偽人了？又或者是……我這一輩子都是個軟蛋？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341494
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我曾經聽某人說過——我們根本「不是人類」。自此，我就一直都很擔心……他說的可能是實話。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341495
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我也許不是人類、也非偽人……只是某種未竟之物。希望……可以給我一個機會去彌補這一切吧，又或者是……幫我結束這一切吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341496
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 看來，我永遠都是——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341497
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 受害的一方……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341498
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 看來，想要對我進行考驗的——不止上帝……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341499
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341500
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341501
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341502
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341503
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341504
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341505
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 好吧，你說了算。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341506
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341507
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 不要害怕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341508
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 罪孽並不值得去反復咀嚼、嚙咬——我通常會將它們一口吞下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341509
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341510
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341511
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 速戰速決吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341512
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341513
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 年紀大了。而且，還有因為蟑螂藥而引起的過敏、長了些疹子——就跟由異教徒一樣執著……不過，倒是沒有他們那麼煩人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341514
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341515
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341516
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 好的。來吧——不要客氣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341517
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341518
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 怎麼了嗎？只不過是歷盡艱辛、困苦之後留下的一些印記罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341519
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 怎麼了嗎？只不過是疲憊留下的一些痕跡罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341520
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 要是你知道我這輩子透過這雙眼睛目睹過多少罪惡的話，就好了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341521
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341522
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341523
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 天啊！難道，你就連最後一絲的理智也失去了不成？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341524
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 竟然強迫一個年邁體弱的婦人在你這種卑劣之徒面前高舉雙臂、袒露軀體！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341525
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 絕無可能！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341526
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341527
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 無恥、下流！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341528
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341529
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 看來，你是不會放過我的——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341530
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 好吧……一切就都交由上天了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341531
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341532
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341533
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341534
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 拍照？我可沒有時間可以浪費在這種無聊透頂的事情之上！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341535
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341536
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 難道，你認為單憑一張照片、就能得到真相？天啊……我在修道院裡養的鴿子都要比你聰明個好幾倍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341537
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341538
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341539
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 蛤——要檢查我的耳朵？！你瘋了吧？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341540
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341541
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 我可不是什麼在市場上任人隨意挑選的畜牲！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341542
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 看來，你已經喪失了一切的道德、良心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341543
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 竟敢恐嚇一個手無寸鐵的可憐婦人？真是不知羞恥！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341544
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341545
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341546
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 難不成，你認為手裡拿著槍就能逼我開口？孩子——子彈可無法滌淨你這輩子犯下的罪惡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341547
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341548
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341549
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 比起手裡的槍，你的眼神更讓我感到害怕——無比空洞，毫無信仰。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341550
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341551
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341552
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 全知的主會看到你所犯下的罪孽——竟然恬不知恥地折磨一位行將就木的可憐婦人……難道，你就沒有絲毫羞愧嗎？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341553
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341554
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341555
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 荒謬至極——難道，你以為殺了我就能讓自己獲得救贖？天啊——你還真是「聰明」到家了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341557
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341558
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341559
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 我曾經目睹過無數足以將靈魂碾為粉末的恐怖場景。於主眼裡，你手裡的這把破銅爛鐵根本微不足道！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341560
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你們這些迷途的羔羊……每天都盯著新聞報導、看個不停，只為自相殘殺——比任何的天災都要更加可怕、更為兇殘。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341561
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341562
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341563
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你倒是試試活到我這個歲數，然後還一顆牙齒都不掉看看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341564
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 無論碰上什麼都敢放到嘴裡咀嚼、吞進自己的肚子。我敢打賭——哪怕是你的牙齒掉光了，我的也還完好無損！當然……前提是，上帝允許我們活到那個時候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341565
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 大家都說，命運會反映在各自的手上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341566
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 而我的這雙手……卻是滿載折磨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341567
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 眼睛是心靈的窗戶。然而，孩子——你的……卻只透射出一片無邊的黑暗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341568
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你與把我趕出聖所的那群褻瀆神明之徒別無二致——已經失去了信仰之光。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341569
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 願這永無止盡的黑暗成為你的懲罰，因你的目光之中既無信念、亦無恩賜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341570
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你費盡心思、不遺餘力地對我們進行各式各樣的「檢查」，然而……真相從來都不會浮於表面，而是藏於內心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341571
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 天上的父——請為你的僕人指點迷津，令其重返光明。他已受到權力的誘惑，越行越遠……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341572
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 什麼照不照片的，通通都蠢到家了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341573
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 人死之後，雖然會留下這種世俗的物品，不過——葬禮過後，就再也不會有人去在乎了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341574
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 而這，就是我們能留下的所有遺產了。每個人都免不了會遭到遺忘。而你，卻還站在這裡瞎嚷嚷、跟個傻子一樣……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341575
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 上帝出於憐憫，賜予了我敏銳的聽覺。然而，最終——我卻淪落到了與一個喜歡……我也不知道該怎麼去描述的蠢貨共處一室的境地。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341576
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 肆無忌憚地揮舞著手裡的槍……就好像自己的想法是神諭一樣！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341577
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 天父，原諒我吧……希望從此之後，再也不用目睹這個既骯髒、又沉淪，滿是罪惡的世界！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341578
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 仁慈的主——求求你，還請接納我的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341579
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 愛怎樣就怎樣好了。我也沒有什麼東西可隱瞞……除了糟糕透頂的運氣之外。哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535552
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535553
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535554
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535555
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535556
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535557
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535558
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好吧，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535559
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535560
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 笑得非常糟糕，對吧？之所以會進行隔離……「清理」的是人，而不是牙齒——懂我的意思吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535561
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535562
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535563
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好吧，看吧。你也知道，我可是受了很大的罪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535564
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535565
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 髒得不行，對吧？信不信由你，我在逃命的時候不小心跌到了水坑裡。此前，還因為攀爬鐵絲網而搞得滿是傷口。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535566
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好吧，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535567
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535568
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 髒得不行，對吧？信不信由你，我在逃命的時候不小心跌到了水坑裡。不過……你在意的應該不是汙垢，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535569
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535570
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535571
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535572
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535573
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 你應該能理解吧？要是只因為看了別人一眼，就有可能會挨上一槍的話……自然而然地，就會留意自己的目光、注意該看什麼地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535574
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535575
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535576
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 天啊……你該不會是在耍我吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535577
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535578
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 兄弟，會瘋狂滋長不是理所當然的事情嗎——你倒是說說，我哪裡有時間去打理？不然，我得上哪、又該怎樣尋求救援？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535579
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 過去的整整一週，我都在中了一槍的情況下拚命逃跑……自然也就沒有什麼閒工夫去管其他的東西，就更別提給腋窩剃毛了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535580
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535581
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535582
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 沒想到還有人會這麼做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535583
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535584
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 一直都不是很喜歡拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535585
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好了……沒問題吧？不對，等等——你該不會是想要向FEMA告發我吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535586
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535587
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535588
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 真假？難道……你不覺得——之所以會孜孜不倦地公佈這項特徵、那項特徵，都是為了要持續地散播恐慌嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535589
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535590
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 沒錯，髒得不行。就跟其他人一樣——每天都在勉強維持工作、拚命生活，就連洗漱的時間都騰不出來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535591
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 真假？難道，你認為光看耳朵就能辨別偽人？好吧，來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535592
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535593
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 沒錯，髒得不行。信不信由你——FEMA的隔離區不僅沒有熱水洗澡、就連一根棉籤都找不著。裡面的服務……簡直可以說爛到家了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535594
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535595
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535596
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 拜託，別做蠢事。我早就已經挨過一槍，沒有興趣再體驗一遍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535597
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535598
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535599
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 如果因為我這雙手就要被肅清……你乾脆把整座城市的居民都給消滅乾淨得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535600
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 如果因為我這雙手稍微有點髒就要被肅清……你乾脆把整座城市的居民都給消滅乾淨得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535601
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535602
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535603
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 我見過無數的瘋子、偏執狂和純粹的混蛋——你並沒有比他們好到哪裡去！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535604
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 不過——起碼，你沒有把我的眼睛給挖出來做實驗……還真是「謝謝」你了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535605
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535606
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535607
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 聽著——你的要求我都已經滿足了，你到底還想從我這裡得到些什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535608
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535609
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535610
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 怎麼，你想把這張照片成為我所留下的最後一樣東西——是這個意思嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535611
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535612
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535613
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 拜託——要是你不喜歡的話，我把耳朵挖乾淨就對了！沒有必要拿槍指著我的鼻子吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535614
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535615
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535616
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 唉……隔離區裡就連一面鏡子也沒有。也是，畢竟——沒人看到自己逐步淪落為畜牲的樣子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535617
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 媽的，你讓我想起了那群穿著黃色衣服的傢伙。一旦覺得有什麼不對勁，就會二話不說掏出槍來、扣下扳機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535618
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 還是長點心吧。沒錯，也許我可以對此睜一隻眼、閉一隻眼……只是，其他人又會如何呢？一旦對方覺得自己被冒犯到了，你怕是再也看不到第二天的太陽囉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535619
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: FEMA的傢伙……從來都不會直視他人的眼睛。不管是自己人、還是被他們帶走的人。你有想過為什麼會這樣嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535620
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 之前，隔離區裡有這麼一個傢伙——不斷地撓著自己的腋窩，直至……這麼說吧，再也沒有辦法撓了為止。現在，我也開始這樣了。大概……是某種真菌吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535621
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 之前，隔離區裡有這麼一個傢伙——不斷地撓著自己的腋窩，直至……這麼說吧，再也沒有辦法撓了為止。現在，我也開始這樣了。大概……只是太過緊張了而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535622
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: FEMA也會給被帶往隔離區的人拍照——抵達之後的第一件事就是這個。說是……為了「記錄在案」之類的，亂七八糟的說辭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535623
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 如果他們來到這裡、亮出我的照片，詢問我的行蹤……拜託，千萬不要把我給供出去。我可不想回到那個地方！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535624
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 大家總說——如果長時間在沉默之中度過，就會開始聽見一些……並不存在的聲音。我們受到隔離後，發現真的是這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535625
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 媽的……千辛萬苦地從一群人渣的手上逃了出來，結果……卻被其他的混蛋給逮到了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535626
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 該死……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535627
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 好吧……只要完事之後、告訴我一切都好，就行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535628
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535629
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535630
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535631
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535632
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535633
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535634
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 真的……有這麼糟糕嗎？好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535635
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535636
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我的父母總說，我的基因……呃，非常優秀。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535637
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 只是……我的牙齦三不五時會流血。要嘛是因為糖尿病，要嘛是因為……我壓力山大。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535638
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我一直都沒怎麼在乎過自己的牙口……自小，我的父母都會提醒我、要在睡前好好刷牙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535639
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 然而，現在——我總是會忘記。只想爬上床去，趕緊入睡。希望他們能回到我的身邊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535640
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535641
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535642
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 哎呀……好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535643
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535644
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 再普通不過了，應該是這樣吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535645
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我從來都沒有想過人的雙手應該會是什麼樣子的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535646
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 畢竟……打從最開始，就是我們身體上不可或缺的一部分——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535647
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 糟了……我完全忘記打理自己的指甲了。從前，我的父母總是提醒我要定期好好修剪。然而……我從來就沒有養成過習慣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535648
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 至於我的關節……好吧，並不重要……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535649
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535650
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535651
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我的眼睛……怎麼了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535652
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535653
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 綠色的瞳孔，再正常不過……對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535654
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 看著，應該沒有問題吧？雖說……最近稍微有點刺痛，大概是因為……灰塵飛了進去，或者……過敏了之類的吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535655
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535656
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535657
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 哎呀……好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535658
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535659
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我從來沒剃過腋毛，一直都沒怎麼在意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535660
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我的父母也沒讓我這麼做，於是……我就根本沒有打理過……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535661
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535662
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535663
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535664
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 你要給我拍照？好吧……只是——完事之後、告訴我一切都好，就行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535665
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535666
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 看著有夠奇怪。你是用了特殊的鏡頭、還是其他什麼機關嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535667
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535668
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535669
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 蛤？好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535670
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535671
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我甚至想像不出你到底想要看到些什麼……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535672
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535673
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535674
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 拜託！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535675
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我聽說過有人會把自己的頭髮給扯下來、有人會咬掉自己的指甲……而我，則是喜歡糟蹋自己的牙齒。不過……這應該沒有什麼大不了的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535676
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我也知道自己的它們並不能說是好看，不過……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535677
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 就算是這樣，也不代表什麼……對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535678
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535679
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535680
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 拜託……我這雙手，不是挺正常的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535681
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 等等……我是人類！只不過是……有點心神不寧罷了，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535682
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535683
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535684
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 等等！我只不過是……有點緊張罷了，僅此而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535685
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 等等！我只不過是沒有睡好罷了，僅此而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535686
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535687
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535688
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 你……你只是想要跟我開個玩笑，對吧？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535689
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535690
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535691
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 拜託……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535692
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535693
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535694
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 等等……這件事情，真的這麼重要嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535695
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535696
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535697
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 媽媽甚至還跟我開過這樣的一個玩笑——說自己在給我餵奶的時候，被我連同鈣質一起吸走了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535698
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 因此，自己的牙口才會變得這麼糟糕……而我，才會有一口完美無瑕的牙齒！當然，牙齦的狀況不是很好就對了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535699
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 要是我的父母也在這裡的話，我想……事情應該能有所不同吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535700
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 他們會提醒我、逼著我打理自己……不至於令我落得現在這個樣子……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535701
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 只是，他們不知道去了哪裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535702
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 而我……則被留了下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535703
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我偶爾會看著自己的雙手陷入沉思……媽媽總說，我有著跟她一樣的指頭——既修長、又乾淨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535704
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 而爸爸則會哈哈大笑，說我有著跟他一樣的拳頭——無比有力，就跟他年輕的時候一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535705
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 現在，我……反而不知道了。我已經記不起他們的雙手到底長什麼樣子了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535706
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 每當觸碰手部關節的時候，我都會感到一陣刺痛。雖然，我知道應該是出了什麼毛病……不過——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535707
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 每當我獨自一人，等待著他們回來……卻總是杳無音訊的時候，我……真的不知道該怎麼辦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535708
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我偶爾會放空腦袋、握緊拳頭，往牆壁上錘去。不管怎樣，總比呆呆地坐著、什麼也不做要強。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535709
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 你……應該不會因此而取笑我，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535710
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 媽媽在跟我說話的時候，總會先看向一隻眼睛、然後再看向另一隻眼睛。來回切換，非常迅速！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535711
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 至於爸爸……則會選擇其中一隻、直勾勾地盯著，從來不會移開目光。不知……他現在會選擇哪一隻呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535712
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 不過……沒錯，我的確常常會哭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535713
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 試問……如果孤身一人，誰也聯繫不上、父母還不知所蹤，又有誰能忍得住不留下淚水呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535714
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我也並非真的想哭……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535715
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 只是……不知道該怎麼獨自生活而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535716
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我一直都以為……只要遵循教導，一切都會順利。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535717
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 如果說要洗臉，我就會去洗臉。如果說不能打斷別人說話，我就不會去打斷別人說話。也沒什麼不對的，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535718
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 然而，現在……再也沒人告訴我該怎麼做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535719
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 既然如此……我該自己做決定？萬一出錯了的話，該怎麼辦？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535720
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 雖然對於絕大多數的人來說可能有點難以理解，不過……我從來都沒有在意過自己的外表。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535721
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我的父母說，我長得很棒——這就足夠了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535722
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 沒了他們，我……已經不再在乎了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535723
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我不喜歡這張照片。雖說我也說不出個所以然來，然而——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535724
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 一看到它，我就感覺好像有什麼東西在壓著自己。這樣子……正常嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535725
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 難道……這所謂的靈光，真的沒在唬人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535726
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我不知道……說實話，我從來都沒有見過這種東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535727
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 如果我的靈光與父母的不同……是不是說明我已經——不再是原來的自己了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535728
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 也許，我已經變了。他們可能再也認不出我來了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535729
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我一直都在等待他們敲響我的房門……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535730
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我一直都想再次聽到他們的話語、他們在家裡走來走去的時候發出的聲音……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535731
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 然而，卻還是只有一片寂靜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535732
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 隨著時間一點、一滴的流逝，我感覺……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535733
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 就好像自己根本就不存在於這個世上一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535734
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 看來，我再次把一切都搞砸了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535735
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 抱歉，媽媽……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535736
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好的，兄弟——沒有任何問題。我既沒有什麼東西想要隱瞞、也沒有什麼理由想去隱瞞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535737
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535738
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535739
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535740
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535741
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535742
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535743
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧，看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535744
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535745
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 看到了嗎？其中一半的牙齒都完美無瑕，既乾淨、又整潔。至於其餘的嘛……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535746
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 這麼說吧——看著不太賞心悅目，有待改進。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535747
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 人生，兄弟……並不總是那麼體貼、善良。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535748
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535749
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535750
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧，看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535751
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535752
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 還挺大的，對吧？一雙適合揉麵團、或是搭建房屋的手……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535753
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 然而，我卻拿它們來開啤酒、砸東西。生活，還真神奇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535754
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 然而，我卻拿他們來開啤酒。生活，還真神奇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535755
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535756
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535757
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 沒有問題——看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535758
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535759
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 非常樸素的褐色瞳孔，就跟絕大多數人一樣——沒有什麼特別的，兄弟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535760
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535761
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535762
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 不是……你確定嗎，兄弟？好吧、好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535763
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535764
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 說實話，真沒有什麼東西可看。又髒、又亂，全都是毛……還長出了某種真菌。大概是跟狗狗一起睡在地上的時候感染上的吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535765
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535766
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535767
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧。要是非得拍的話，就隨你喜歡好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535768
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535769
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 說實話，我並沒有幾張自己的照片。不過……也只不過是因為一直沒什麼機會去拍的緣故罷了，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535770
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535771
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535772
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 來吧，看吧……只是一雙平凡到不能再平凡的耳朵而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535773
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535774
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 沒有問題，對吧？如果你想，也可以摸一摸。我不介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535775
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535776
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535777
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧，如果問題出在了牙齒上……我沒有要批判你的意思，不過——你不覺得單憑這樣就要殺掉某人，不會太過兒戲了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535778
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535779
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535780
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧，兄弟……我真心希望死後，還會有所謂的來世——這樣一來，也許……我就能在某處與我的狗狗重逢……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535781
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535782
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535783
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 哇哦，兄弟……你得明白，當自己珍愛的東西被奪走時、沒有人能不因此而留下眼淚。這是人之常情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535784
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 然而，現在卻要因此請我吃子彈？就因為我有一顆柔情似水的心？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535785
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧，只是……千萬不要對著眼睛開槍，行嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535786
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 要是能在生命的最後時刻看到一些美好的東西的話，就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535787
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535788
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535789
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我倒也不是不想找個醫生幫忙看看這些長出來的真菌是怎麼回事，只是……又有什麼意義呢？特別是現在這種時候……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535790
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535791
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535792
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 拜託……好歹跟我說說你都發現了什麼，行嗎？總不至於那麼糟糕，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535793
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535794
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535795
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 開什麼玩笑呢，兄弟？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535796
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535797
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535798
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 曾經，有個牙醫告訴過我——既然有著這樣的一口牙齒，我甚至都可以去拍廣告了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535799
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 然後……哈哈，這傢伙被趕出去了——就在同一晚。只因為我咧開了嘴、笑了起來。真是有趣，對吧？畢竟……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535800
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我甚至沒有跟人動手，只不過是……不合時宜地笑了一下罷了，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535801
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我的狗狗還沒去世之前……我經常會一邊緊緊地抱著它、一邊撫摸它柔順的毛髮——手感特別舒服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535802
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我真的非常想它，兄弟……你恐怕無法想像。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535803
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 奶奶曾經跟我說過——「你的這個眼神，就好像……已經在跟我道別了一樣。」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535804
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我當時並不理解她為什麼會這麼講。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535805
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 現在……我終於明白了。然而，卻沒有辦法告訴她了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535806
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 最後一晚……我並沒有離開它的身邊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535807
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 心想也許可以讓它暖和一點、令它輕鬆一些。看來……它為此給我留下了這些小小的「禮物」。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535808
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 真有意思……即使它已經離去，卻還是在我的身上刻下了自己的印記。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535809
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 以前，我特別愛給自己的狗狗拍照——完全不會厭煩。根本壓抑不住那種想要與他人分享……又或者說，炫耀的心情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535810
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 要說我本人的話……哎呀，倒是不太愛拍照。特別是放在畢業紀念冊裡的那些照片——人人都不知道在哪裡變出來一身從來都沒有見過的行頭、打扮得花枝招展……我實在是欣賞不來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535811
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 某次，附近響起了一連串煙火、爆竹的聲音。我的狗狗……嚇得在地上踡縮了起來、瑟瑟發抖，想要靠近我一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535812
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我便緊緊地抱住它，試圖讓它平靜下來……唉，可憐的小傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535813
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 然後，我就在想……「天啊——要是我也被嚇得方寸大亂、六神無主的話，希望也有人能像這樣緊緊地抱住我。如此一來，我就知道自己並非孤身一人。」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535814
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 好吧……看來，一切就到此為止了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535815
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 兄弟……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535816
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 真假？要知道，我可是一名議員欸……好吧、好吧，嘖……愛怎樣就怎樣吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535817
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535818
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535819
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535820
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535821
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535822
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535823
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 開什麼玩笑……接下來，是不是要我向你彎腰、屈膝了？不要浪費我這名議員的寶貴時間。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535824
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535825
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 看來，你是不會就此罷休的了——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535826
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 嘖……行吧、行吧，愛看就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535827
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535828
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎樣，欣賞夠了吧？哼……給我聽好了——抽菸不僅可以安撫情緒，還能磨礪品性。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535829
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 一些人只是淺淺地吸了一口就撐不住了。至於我嘛……已經吸了都快整整一輩子囉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535830
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535831
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535832
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 好好看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535833
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535834
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 喏——充滿了歲月的痕跡。我這雙手……曾經握著紅酒、雪茄，還有——*咳嗽*整個國家的命運。現在？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535835
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 光是顧好自己就得費盡力氣了。而且，即便如此、也還是跟一場豪賭無異。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535836
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535837
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535838
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 好吧、好吧，稍等一下……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535839
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535840
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 如何，看到什麼了嗎？怎麼，你覺得我醉啦？絕無可能。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535841
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 如何，看到什麼了嗎？怎麼，你覺得我醉啦？絕無可能。只是，如今這個世道、沒有酒精的話——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535842
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 罷了、罷了，管他的呢。好了，你滿意了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535843
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535844
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535845
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你——這都是什麼亂七八糟的檢查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535846
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535847
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 別把自己給嚇死了，好吧？我可不會有什麼問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535848
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 哈……你知道嗎？曾經，有人告訴過我腋毛是，咳咳——力量的象徵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535849
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 照這樣看來，我應該有著能抵三人的力量——然而，偏偏在我需要的時候、卻根本就發揮不出來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535850
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 媽的，現在這個世道……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535851
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535852
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535853
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 好吧。不過，先讓我站穩、站直……就像過去一樣……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535854
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535855
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎樣，拍得應該還不錯吧？我還是我，一如既往——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535856
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535857
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535858
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 哎喲，到底有什麼好看的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535859
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535860
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 看吧。這就是議員的耳朵，能聽到一切的聲響。不管是竊竊私語……抑或是，咳咳——高聲尖叫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535861
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535862
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535863
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 好啊，來吧——儘管開槍。我倒是要看看你該如何獨自一人存活下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535864
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535865
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535866
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 一切都壓得我喘不過氣來……於是，我開始用手指捏碎香菸、試圖解壓。雖然汙垢都跑到指甲下面去了，不過——我實在是懶得去管了，就沒有把它們給弄乾淨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535867
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎麼，這在你的房子裡——算是犯罪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535868
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 光看這雙飽經滄桑的手，其實……我跟死了又有什麼區別？好了，來吧——就由你來給這一切畫上句號。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535869
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535870
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535871
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 好啊，來吧！我根本就不在乎這場噩夢會如何落幕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535872
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535873
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535874
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 真搞不懂！你倒是說說，腋窩——到底重要在哪裡？如今這個世道，誰還能潔身自好？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535875
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 來吧，扣下扳機。看看這樣到底能不能令一切有所好轉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535876
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535877
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535878
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 如果這張照片真的宣判了我的死刑，那——就趕緊執行吧。我過去好歹也是個能主宰他人命運的人……沒有必要再拖延下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535879
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535880
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535881
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 開什麼玩笑？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535882
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535883
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535884
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 曾經，有個牙醫告訴過我——「把菸給戒了吧。不然，你的牙齒會通通爛掉。」而我則大聲地吼了回去——「你他媽的知道我是誰嗎？！」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535885
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 現在，我看著鏡子、陷入了沉思……也許，我根本就沒有必要把自己整得這麼壓抑、根本就不值得。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535886
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 曾經，我只要簽下自己的大名、就能決定他人的命運。現在？我只希望有人能來決定我的命運。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535887
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎麼總能想出這種鬼點子？先是死死地盯著對方，然後冷不防地掏出槍來——搞什麼鬼？簡直荒唐至極！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535888
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 我的眼睛曾經清澈、明亮。現在？已經……變得渾濁不清了。生活給它們蒙上了一層灰塵，而我已經懶得將其擦去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535889
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你根本就不知道我一日之內要流多少的汗！而且，還總抽不出空去看醫生。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535890
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你根本就不知道我得處理多少爛事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535891
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 我還年輕的時候，認識一個有著……咳咳，同樣恩賜的傢伙。他管這叫「參孫的頭髮」。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535892
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 不久之後，這個傢伙被黑幫逼進了絕境。結果，這些被他奉為圭臬的腋毛並沒有能救他一命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535893
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你知道嗎？曾經有過那麼幾次……針對我的「肅清」行動。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535894
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 燒掉我的照片、銷毀我的文件，甚至還試過置我於死地。然而，到頭來……又有什麼用呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535895
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 內心殘留的印記仍然無法抹去……人們依舊記得這個能決定自己命運的傢伙——也就是本人。世事本就如此。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535896
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 有時……我們需要的只是片刻的安寧。然而，卻永遠都無法觸及。就連沒人說話的時候……腦海裡還是會響起雜音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535897
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 地獄根本就沒有……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535898
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 比這好到哪裡去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535900
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535901
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535902
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535903
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535904
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535905
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535906
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 對了……它們，是最後的見證者。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535908
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我咀嚼著真相，而後一吞而下。結果……被其嗆得喘不過氣來，直至上顎緊緊地抵住我的喉嚨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535909
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 當目光掃過它的時候，我不由自主地握緊了拳頭、因太過用力而感到疼痛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535910
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 如今，我的雙手之中徒餘空虛……只能靜靜地等待死亡的到來，幫我忘卻一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535911
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535912
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535913
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 還會動嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535914
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535915
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 好、好，它尚未奪去我的一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535916
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然而，後來……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535917
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我瘋狂吞嚥、放聲尖叫、不停嘔吐，把自己撕扯得體無完膚。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535918
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 頭顱裂成兩半，腦漿透過牆壁不斷地、緩緩地流出。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535919
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 牆壁——牆壁、大門、窗戶……它就在那裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535920
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535921
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535922
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 哈哈哈哈哈……好吧，沒什麼特別的——隨你看個夠吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535923
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535924
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它喜歡受到矚目。我……無法描述，難以形容。它實在太過嚇人，早就已經遠遠超出凡人的心智所能承受的極限。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535925
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535926
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535927
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 真有……意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535928
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535929
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 你知道……那黏膩的陰影，會先籠罩住什麼嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535930
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 不知道？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535931
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我現在知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535932
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535933
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535934
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 好的……隨你高興。開啟閃光燈也無所謂，我不在乎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535935
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535936
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 而且，甚至也不需要向我展示拍得怎樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535937
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535938
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535939
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 聽到了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535941
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 寂靜之聲……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535942
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535943
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535944
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 尋常武器無法抵禦……那個傢伙。我甚至不確定到底有沒有方法可以對付它。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535945
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535946
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535947
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 於夢中，我幾乎可以觸碰到它……感受它的形體，重量……然而，它……便會突然消失不見，徒留滿心的恐懼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535948
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535949
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535950
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 你的目光會不由自主地被它吸引過去，無法移開……除非，你把自己的雙眼給完完全全地挖出來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535951
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535952
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535953
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我渾身上下的每一吋肌膚都在發麻，就好像是在催促我趕緊去抓撓、甚至是把整張皮被剝下來……實在是難以忍受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535954
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535955
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535956
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我以前對拍照頗有研究，對每處細節都非常用心……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535957
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 至於，現在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535958
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535959
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535960
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是，你也聽過它移動時所發出的聲音的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535961
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是，你也聽過它的腳步和自己的腳步糾纏在一起時所發出的聲音的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535962
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是，你也聽過它在嗅聞你的氣息時空氣因顫抖所發出的聲音的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535963
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535964
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535965
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 你是否曾經聽過這樣的一種聲音……明明正在咀嚼，卻不是在進食？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535966
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 就好像在貪婪地品嘗著你的氣息、你的聲音，以及你顫抖的模樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535967
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它，就會發出這種聲音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535968
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 與此同時，還不斷地等待著……耐心地等待著——等待著我也發出同樣的聲音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535969
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然後，就會突然傳來一陣激疼、令我驚醒——全身上下早已被汗水浸透。我下意識地用雙手捂住嘴巴，就好像是想要抑制住即將爆發的尖叫一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535970
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它並不畏懼他人的注視，反而甘之若飴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535971
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它會在我們的瞳孔之中扎根。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535972
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它會在我們的眼瞼之下微微震顫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535973
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535974
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 抱歉……我感到不太舒服……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535975
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 當它徐徐爬來……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535976
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 當它滑過軀體、鑽進骨頭……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535977
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 只需一次觸碰——你就會感覺到，它已經存在於皮膚之下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535978
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然後……你的皮囊，將不再屬於你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535979
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 而你……也似乎不再屬於自己……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535980
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 此等痛苦，極其真切、難以忍受……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535981
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是……要是那個東西找上了你的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535982
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 無論如何，都千萬、千萬不要給它拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535983
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 因為，這樣做只會為它提供養分……令它變得更強，使它能更輕鬆地掌控我們這些凡人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535984
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我聽到了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535985
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 不是在看見它的時候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535986
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 而是在這之前。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535987
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 在它出現之前。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535988
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 一陣輕微的摩擦聲。就好像有人在十步之外跟著自己一樣……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535989
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 接著，縮短到了五步……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535990
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然後——只要轉過頭去，就會……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535991
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 抱歉。我想，我還是……就此打住為好。相信我，你並不會想要知道接下來發生的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535992
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它來了它來了它來了它來了它來了它來了它來了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535993
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它……來了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535994
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 好的，老兄。完全沒有關係。隨意就好，別太拘束。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535995
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535996
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535997
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535998
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535999
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536000
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536001
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 好的、好的，老兄——來吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536002
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536003
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我這牙齒……看起來就像是從小嚼玉米長大的、而不是吃穀片，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536004
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 雖說如此，然而——它們可是跟釘子一樣硬。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536005
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我曾經試過拿牙齒來開啤酒。雖然差點把舌頭給咬掉了，不過最後還是成功喝上了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536006
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 拜託，老兄……我只是喜歡抽菸而已，三不五時會來上一根。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536007
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536008
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536009
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哎呀，老兄——抱歉啦。最近一直在找某批藏貨，搞得指甲縫裡滿是泥巴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536010
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哇哦——哇哦！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536011
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536012
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哈哈。我記得有一次嗑嗨了——盯著手指看了很久、很久，才終於意識到那是自己的手指。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536013
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 一邊在動、一邊在看……太迷幻了，老兄。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536014
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536015
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536016
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我實在是沒辦法長時間睜著眼睛……畢竟，集中精神注視某件東西會令我感到壓力山大。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536017
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536018
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 瞳孔放得很大，對吧？哈哈，不必擔心。你絕對想不到——以前，我經常會因為這事而在店裡被念過好幾次。超級不爽。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536019
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 佈滿血絲，對吧？哈哈，不必擔心。你絕對想不到——以前，我經常會因為這事而被念過好幾次。超級不爽。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536020
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 要不這樣吧，我給你講個故事——保準會把你給嚇一跳。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536021
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536022
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536023
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 好的，不過先等一下——得先把衣服給脫掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536024
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536025
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 每時每刻都癢得要命，老兄。大家都說是因為我不洗衣服的緣故，不過——拜託，我只不過是想活得……怎麼說呢，自由自在一點罷了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536026
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 剃得乾乾淨淨，如嬰兒般順滑……基本上啦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536027
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 老兄，你說說看——我們真的還有必要去留腋毛嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536028
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 畢竟，現在又不是什麼石器時代。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536029
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 既沒有蚊蟲叮咬、又不需要去取暖，對吧？毫無意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536030
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536031
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536032
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 好的，老兄！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536033
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536034
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 好了，怎樣——我的靈光看著如何？應該閃閃發亮的吧？哈哈，我就知道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536035
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536036
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536037
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 好的，來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536038
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536039
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 為什麼是拉聳著的？哎呀，因為……以前曾經戴過超酷耳堵的緣故啦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536040
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536041
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536042
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 冷靜一點，老兄——冷靜一點！來捲根大的，咱們邊抽、邊聊——好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536043
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536044
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536045
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哇哦，老兄——你也太猛了吧。等等……難道，你覺得這把槍屬於自己身體的一部分？太狂了吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536046
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536047
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536048
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 拜託，老兄——不是什麼老掉牙的故事啦。我能保證，超精彩的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536049
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536050
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536051
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 拜託，老兄。也許，一切本該如此——這樣反而比較自然！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536052
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 拜託，老兄。我可不會因為你沒剃掉自己的腋毛，而對你指指點點——大家過好各自的生活就行。我只不過想跟你好好地聊聊天罷了，僅此而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536053
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536054
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536055
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 老兄，哪怕我一個人待著、也偶爾會覺得自己怪怪的。現在，你竟然還要嚇我、搞得我更不自在——究竟，是圖什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536056
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536057
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536058
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 想知道為什麼會這樣、具體又發生了什麼事情嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536059
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536060
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536061
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我曾經覺得牙齒也就那樣，沒什麼特別的。就是——「哦，我長了牙齒啊。哎喲，還不錯哦」，的這種程度。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536062
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 然後，有個兄弟告訴我……它們其實是骨頭來的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536063
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 你能想像嗎？嘴裡竟然長出了骨頭。太噁心了，我甚至被嚇得都不去碰它們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536064
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我的手指實在是太奇怪了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536065
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 就好比說，雖說我做什麼事情都會用上……然而，我卻從來沒有認真思考過它們到底是什麼東西。某次嗑嗨了之後……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536066
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 它們甚至把我給嚇了個半死！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536067
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 當時，我一邊盯著雙手、一邊想——萬一它們根本就不屬於我、而是有著自己的意識，該怎麼辦？真的，令人崩潰。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536068
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 其實，要我說——瞳孔大點反而會比較吃香。就像那齣有著綠色魔怪的卡通裡面那隻穿著靴子的貓咪一樣，看起來特別可愛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536069
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 而且，女孩也比較吃這一套。哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536070
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 事情是這樣的——當時，我正走在街上、整個人嗨得不行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536071
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 心想——「要是被條子看到了的話，肯定會被攔下來、問是不是嗑藥了。」於是，我就想……好吧，要真是這樣，我就說——「沒有啦。哎喲，我平時就是這樣的。」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536072
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 你猜怎麼樣？結果，雖然我確實被攔下來了、不過他們卻問的是——「你的眼睛為什麼這麼紅？你平時就是這樣的嗎？」然後，我反而答的是——「沒有啦。哎喲，我只是嗑藥了而已。」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536073
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 要是你也像這個樣子走來走去的話，老兄——你的腋窩也肯定會癢起來的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536074
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 歸根到底，真的有人會在這種部位留毛嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536075
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 不管是腋窩、抑或是屁股……照我看來，只會礙事而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536076
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 再說，我們都已經有衣服可穿了。真搞不懂為什麼還需要這些毛髮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536077
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 你知道嗎，老兄——有時，我能感覺到自己的靈光。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536078
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 就好像是有什麼看不見的東西在包裹著自己一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536079
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 雖然在我超嗨……呃，我是說，超累時，這種感覺會有點嚇人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536080
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 不過，絕大多數的時候都很酷、挺不錯的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536081
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我之前曾經有過一個特別好看的耳堵——不僅畫著一隻超大的眼睛，虹膜的細節更是誇張到家。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536082
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 結果，卻不小心搞丟了。現在，就彷彿自己的身體缺了一部分似的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536083
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 就好比說，大家看到的是一隻再長了個洞的耳朵、而我看到的……則是某個深不見底的虛空。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536084
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我還以為……我們相處得不錯……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536085
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 老兄……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536086
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 好的……儘管檢查吧。我沒什麼可隱瞞的……畢竟，我早就已經失去了一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536087
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536088
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536089
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536090
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536091
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536092
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536093
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 看到了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536094
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536095
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 如此潔白……幾近完美。只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536096
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 他們把我綁在柱子上後，毆打了我——強迫我眼睜睜地看著悲劇的發生……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536097
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536098
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536099
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 來吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536100
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536101
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我……我試圖將大門打開、把窗戶砸破，然而……火勢實在是蔓延得……太快了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536102
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536103
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536104
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536105
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536106
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我……親眼目睹了一切的發生。火勢不斷逼近，孩子彼此相擁……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536107
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 目光四處遊移、尋找我的身影，希望我能救大家逃出生天……實在是難以忍受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536108
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 即使是現在，我也還是不敢閉上雙眼、害怕會再次見到他們的臉龐……無助，焦黑——因痛苦而扭曲……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536109
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536110
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536111
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 你……確定真的有必要這樣做嗎？兢兢業業地去檢查這些亂七八糟的特徵……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536112
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536113
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我已經習慣成自然了。既然下定決心要照顧好孩子們，也就得注意個人衛生，好成為他們的榜樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536114
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 教會他們該如何洗臉、刷牙……然而，現在已經——一無所有了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536115
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536116
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536117
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 就隨你喜歡好了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536118
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536119
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536120
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536121
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536122
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536123
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536124
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我有一段時間很喜歡戴耳環……小小的，上面鑲嵌著精緻的寶石。孩子們都說看起來一閃、一閃的，就跟星星一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536125
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 不過，卻總是會把耳朵弄疼……於是，就給取下來了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536126
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536127
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536128
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 想要把我這個漏網之魚給收拾掉？世道如此，不出所料。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536129
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536130
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536131
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 來吧。我的這雙手……已經再也無法幫助他人了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536132
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536133
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536134
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 如果你能看到那幅早已深深地烙印在了我的腦海中的景象……只要你的內心還有哪怕一絲憐憫，肯定會毫不猶豫地扣下扳機、給我個痛快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536135
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536136
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536137
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 開槍吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536138
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536139
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536140
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 動手吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536141
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536142
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536143
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 你覺得……憑藉一顆子彈，就能終結痛苦？天啊，希望如此……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536144
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536145
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536146
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我在教導孩子們該如何去刷牙的時候，是這樣說的——「燦爛的笑容是世上最美的表情」。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536147
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然後……他們一個接一個地綻開了笑臉，爭先恐後地給我展示自己的小小牙齒。然而，現在……這寶貴的回憶，反而令我感到……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536148
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 抱歉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536149
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我的這雙手……曾經為他們編過頭髮、處理過傷口，還教過他們該如何去繫鞋帶……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536150
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，現在……一切均已失去意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536151
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 畢竟，自會有更為強大、更加殘忍的傢伙來替你決定自己的命運……既然如此，又何必白費力氣呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536152
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我一直都在想……要是我能破開大門的話，就好了……現在，只要一閉上眼睛——就會再次看到當時那熊熊燃燒著的烈焰。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536153
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我記得自己曾經這樣跟孩子們說過——「只要注意衛生，就不會生病啦。」現在，我知道了……細菌、病毒，並不可怕——最糟糕的，永遠都是人類。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536154
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我想要記住他們的音容、笑貌……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536155
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，隨著時間一點、一滴地流逝，一切都逐漸地變得模糊起來……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536156
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 最後，只剩下他們因痛苦、恐懼和困惑而扭曲的臉龐……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536157
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 三不五時，摸著自己的耳朵……會令我想起——曾經有一個小女孩特別喜歡我的耳環。她說，自己長大之後也要買一對一模一樣的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536158
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，現在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536159
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 她已經再也無法……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536160
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 一切……終將結束……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536161
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 抱歉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536162
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729856
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729857
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729858
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 嗯嗯，是的……怎麼，有什麼問題嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729859
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729860
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 要是……要是就連你也無法判斷這些特徵是確有其事的話，我又憑什麼要去相信？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729861
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 誰知道呢……也許，它們的確都是偽人的特徵——只是，也有可能就是一些鬼扯！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729862
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 雖說，人人都會犯錯——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729863
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 然而……這種錯，卻有可能會造成非常、非常嚴重的後果。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729864
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 想要對我進行檢查？哈哈。好啊，來吧。起碼，能搞清楚……一些事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729865
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729866
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729867
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729868
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729869
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729870
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729871
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 牙齒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729872
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你會把被良心拋下的東西通通都給放進嘴裡、細細咀嚼嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729873
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729874
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 把它們全都給吞下肚子裡。甚至，還會——在良心上面咬出一個大洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729875
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 歸根到底……良心到底是什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729876
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729877
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729878
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你這是在打什麼主意？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729879
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我是舞伶——靠自己的雙腿吃飯。你反而要看我的雙手？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729880
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729881
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 貓咪把我的手給……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729882
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 要不是因為他說一定得讓它活著的話，我早就已經……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729883
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 不光把我的手給抓得血肉模糊，還總是令我感到困擾、不愉快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729884
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729885
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729886
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哎呀，終於來到有趣的部分了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729887
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你知道……這雙瞳孔裡反映著什麼嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729888
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729889
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 悲劇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729890
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 而你，早已置身其中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729891
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 好了——感覺如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729892
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729893
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729894
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哈哈哈哈！來吧——仔細看看，好好聞聞。你還想怎麼樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729895
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729896
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 如何，還喜歡嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729897
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729898
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729899
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 嗯……這我可不曉得。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729900
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 就來看看好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729901
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729902
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 呼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729903
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729904
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 沒人跟我說過這個。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729905
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 難道，是因為跳舞的關係？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729906
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 如果我是你，肯定會被嚇到的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729907
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729908
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729909
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哎呀，是個不錯的兆頭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729910
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729911
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 好了，結果如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729912
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 誰是好人，誰是壞人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729913
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729914
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729915
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哈哈哈，來吧——動手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729916
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729917
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729918
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你……想要見血嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729919
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我也是。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729920
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 不過，遺憾的是——我並沒有……起碼，現在如此。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729921
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729922
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729923
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你……不喜歡血？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729924
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 然而，這棟房子裡卻每天都會發生流血事件。我還以為……你對此頗為狂熱呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729925
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我應該沒說錯吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729926
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729927
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729928
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 怎麼——想再聞一遍？想得美。你自己沒有好好把握機會。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729929
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 與我無關。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729930
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 會做這種事的……多半是個白癡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729931
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729932
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729933
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 要起舞了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729934
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 隨你喜歡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729935
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729936
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729937
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你是怎麼得出這個結論的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729938
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 單憑耳朵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729939
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729940
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729941
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 為何改變主意？怎麼，難道……是想檢查其他的地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729942
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 是想發現更多的特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729943
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 為何把槍舉起，然後又放下來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729944
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 無法下定決心？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729945
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 照我看來，蠢到家了——哈哈哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729946
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我們都渴望鮮血。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729947
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 為何你如此篤定，自己並不是偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729948
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你也一樣——只不過是想鋪出一條能確實通往死亡的道路罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729949
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……愚蠢至極！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729950
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 怎麼……就因為這支舞，鬧起脾氣來了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729951
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 或許……你聽到了不一樣的旋律——一首我們唱了很久、很久的曲子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729952
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 是嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729953
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你知道……接下來，會有什麼在等待自己嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729954
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 照我看來，你就像遊樂園裡的小丑——待在這棟隨時都有可能分崩離析的房子裡，臉上一整天都掛著傻笑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729955
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 還真省事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729956
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 耳朵……嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729957
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 耳朵、耳朵、耳朵、耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729958
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 這……正是它想要的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729959
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 沒想到它偏愛的人，竟會是你這種白癡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729960
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 沒想到……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729961
    m_Localized: 'Mother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729962
    m_Localized: 'Mother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729963
    m_Localized: 'Anger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729964
    m_Localized: 'Anger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729965
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 媽的——小心點，別到處亂揮這把該死的霰彈槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729966
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 我可不想因為自己的耳朵而挨上一槍、腦漿塗地。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729967
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 哎呀……好的，沒有問題。還請自便——只是，希望可以讓我的愛人自己靜一靜。她已經很累了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729968
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729969
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729970
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729971
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729972
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729973
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729974
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 為了保護自己心愛的人，有時——不得不狠狠地咬住生活，絕不放鬆。哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729975
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729976
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你也知道，現在的日子非常的艱難。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729977
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我的牙齒並不好看，不過——我也不能怎樣。上學的時候，甚至還因此而被別人嘲笑過呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729978
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不知，那些惡霸現在怎麼樣了呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729979
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 大概，已經爛在哪條巷子裡面了吧……被某些與自己當年同出一轍的怪物毆打致死。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729980
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729981
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729982
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我和我的妻子都很注重個人衛生——不會有什麼問題的。對吧，寶貝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729983
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729984
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 說實話……面對如此世道，反而更應保持清潔、乾淨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729985
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你想——要是生病了的話，又有誰能伸出援手呢？根本沒有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729986
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也許，正因如此……偽人才會比我們更加強大？畢竟，它們根本就不會生病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729987
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也許，正因如此……偽人才會是偽人？畢竟，它們根本就不會生病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729988
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729989
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729990
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 好的——就來大眼瞪小眼吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729991
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 抱歉……只是，我稍微有點緊張。不過——也是人之常情，對吧？畢竟，這一系列的檢查著實有點嚇人。雖然，我也知道你並沒有什麼好隱瞞的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729992
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729993
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 好吧，唉……我不是有點緊張，而是非常緊張。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729994
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 畢竟——你不止是在針對我，還有可能會……危害到我的愛人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729995
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729996
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729997
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不、不——只檢查我的就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729998
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729999
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 既然女性可以剃毛，我們男子漢、大丈夫又為什麼不行呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730000
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 現在氣溫這麼的高，這樣……起碼可以在一定程度上調節一下自己的體溫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730001
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你應該能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730002
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 只有女性才會在意腋毛、想要剃掉。而我？則對此不屑一顧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730003
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 畢竟，我還有更為重要的職責——於這四處都有怪物橫行、肆虐的世界裡保護她的安全。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730004
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730005
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730006
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 等等，這也是一項檢查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730007
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 絕無可能——既不能拍我、也不能拍她。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730008
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不過……要是這樣的話，你會懷疑我們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730009
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 讓我想想。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730010
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730011
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 好吧，該死……拍吧。不過，之後得把照片給我——好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730012
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730013
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 快點給我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730014
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730015
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730016
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我實在是看不出來這究竟與偽人有什麼聯繫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730017
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不過，好吧——隨你高興。我也沒有什麼東西好隱瞞的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730018
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730019
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 如何，看到什麼了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730020
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 寶貝，你有聽說過與耳朵相關的特徵……之類的事情嗎？哎呀，怎麼還是一言不發？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730021
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 真假？好吧……我知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730022
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730023
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 真有意思。好了，結果如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730024
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730025
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730026
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 拜託——要是離開了我的話，我的愛人活不下去。把槍放下吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730027
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730028
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730029
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 然後，又該怎樣呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730030
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 這不會對我有幫助。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730031
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也不會對你有幫助。因此，為何要掏出槍來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730032
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也不會對你有幫助，親愛的房主……因此，為何要掏出槍來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730033
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730034
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730035
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 錯了、錯了——只因為沒有辦法對她進行檢查，你就要直接舞刀弄槍嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730036
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我對天發誓，她是個人類——對吧，寶貝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730037
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我們已經收拾好了行李，隨時都能離開。然而……她只不過是動作慢了點，錯過了出發的時機罷了。這樣，並不能說明我們是偽人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730038
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730039
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730040
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我相信，你應該不是什麼窮兇極惡的傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730041
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 難道……你真的要因為幾根腋毛而向我們開槍？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730042
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730043
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730044
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我答應你拍這張照片，其實……意義非常重大。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730045
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 然而，遺憾的是——看來，你並不這樣認為。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730046
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730047
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730048
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 指甲？當然。畢竟，偽人是從地下爬出來的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730049
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 眼睛？我可以理解。腋窩？也不是不行。只是……耳朵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730050
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 眼睛？我可以理解。腋窩？也不是不行。只是……耳朵？難道，是因為比較靠近大腦的緣故？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730051
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730052
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730053
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 希望我沒有令你感到太過疲憊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730054
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我很清楚——如今，想要維護秩序是多麼的艱難。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730055
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 譬如……我甚至都管不住自己的這個「甜蜜負擔」，哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730056
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 或許，你無法理解。不過——沒事，我會放在心裡、絕不外傳。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730057
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 時勢艱難，人心惶惶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730058
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 要是不弄髒自己的雙手，試著去戰鬥——根本就活不下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730059
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 每當想到她說不定會遭遇什麼不測的時候，我都會不由自主地發起抖來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730060
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 最令我感到害怕的是……我不知道自己什麼時候會耗盡僅剩的力氣、再也無法保護她。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730061
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我只好不斷訓練，令自己變得更強——確保能三兩下地揍翻那些心懷歹念的怪胎！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730062
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 哎呀，寶貝——你是不是抖了一下？沒事，不要害怕。有我在呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730063
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我們夫妻有著各自的職責。我會保證她的安全、領她去拜訪自己的父母。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730064
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 而她，則負責……滿足我的一切需求。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730065
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 非常公平，對吧？希望某人保持清潔、乾淨並非專橫暴虐，你應該能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730066
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 生活教會了我一件事——不要透露自己的身份、以及自己的去處。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730067
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 無知是福……這話沒錯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730068
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我們只不過是想不出任何意外、平平安安地回到家裡罷了，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730069
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 對吧，寶貝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730070
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我已經沒有什麼要說的了——我們就繼續收拾行李去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730071
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 冷靜、冷靜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730072
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 拜託。難道，你真的忍心向這名柔弱的女子開槍嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730073
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你為什麼會……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730074
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 好吧——愛怎樣就怎樣吧，老頭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730075
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730076
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730077
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730078
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730079
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730080
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730081
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 真是荒唐……還有——要是你敢對我動手動腳的話，就別怪我直接往你的臉上揍過去。我可沒有在跟你開玩笑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730082
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730083
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 比起我本人，我的父母反而要更加關心我的牙齒……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730084
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730085
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730086
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730087
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 嗯……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730088
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 好吧，希望你不會被嚇到……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730089
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730090
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 過敏了，癢得很。總是會冒出一堆疹子。真是討厭……小時候就是這樣了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730091
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730092
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730093
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730094
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730095
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730096
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 給我記好了——擔敢亂來，我就戳瞎你的眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730097
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730098
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730099
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730100
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730101
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 想都別想。太詭異了……絕對不行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730102
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730103
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730104
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730105
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 要是你敢把拍出來的照片公佈出去、好讓我的父母找到我的話，就他媽的給我滾遠點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730106
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730107
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 拍得如何？快點給我看看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730108
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730109
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730110
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 隨你便吧，我不在乎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730111
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730112
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 挺乾淨的，對吧？怎樣，我通過這些蠢到家的測試了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730113
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730114
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730115
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730116
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 去你的吧！好啊，你乾脆一槍把我給打死得了！我早就已經受夠了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730117
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 來吧——動手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730118
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 扣下扳機！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730119
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 怎麼，怕了？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730120
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730121
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730122
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 愛怎樣就怎樣吧，老頭。我已經懶得去思考些什麼了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730123
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 趕緊下定決心吧。要嘛把我給一槍打死，要嘛就停止這齣鬧劇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730124
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730125
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730126
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我的眼睛明明就好得很。你有病吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730127
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730128
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730129
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730130
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 你瘋了不成？你知道自己在說什麼嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730131
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 去你的吧！好啊，你乾脆一槍把我給打死得了！我早就已經受夠了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730132
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 來吧——動手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730133
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 扣下扳機！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730134
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 怎麼，怕了？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730135
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730136
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730137
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 怎樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730138
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 哎喲，好一個男子漢——這麼大一把槍……好好地看著我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730139
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 說實話，隨你了——愛怎樣就怎樣吧。我已經不想去計較了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730140
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730141
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730142
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 好吧。接著，又該怎樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730143
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730144
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730145
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 要是還有下一次的話，建議你直接扣下扳機。我是不會求饒的——我根本就不在乎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730146
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我受夠了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730147
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 媽媽總是會對我這雙手喋喋不休、滿腹牢騷，說我應該「要有女孩的樣子」。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730148
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 又不是我自己想長的這些疹子——過敏了能怎麼辦？我根本就控制不了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730149
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 無所謂了。我已經不再在乎了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730150
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 因為——人生中最重要的事情是什麼，你知道嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730151
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730152
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 就是趕緊找個好的人家嫁過去，然後俐落地生個小孩出來！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730153
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730154
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 既瀟灑、又率性，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730155
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 呸……我可敬謝不敏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730156
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 班上有些女生堅信自己眼睛的顏色會隨著心情的變化而有所不同。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730157
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 拜託，誰在乎這種芝麻綠豆的小事呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730158
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 只要沒瞎，不就好了——哪怕是變成像彩虹一樣五顏六色也沒差。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730159
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 你就是個瘋子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730160
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 敢再做這些猥瑣的事情，我就直接離開。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730161
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我們家有一本相簿。我經常會坐在椅子上、盯著自己上學之前的照片看。我當時……笑得非常燦爛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730162
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 到底是什麼改變了我的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730163
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 對了——因為他們給我帶上了一副蠢到家的牙套！真是太棒了呢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730164
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我實在是想不明白——為何有些家長會給就連走路都還不懂得的幼童穿耳洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730165
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 萬一孩子並不喜歡這樣，該怎麼辦？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730166
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 他們憑什麼覺得自己可以擅自替他人做出決定？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730167
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 唉……罷了，無所謂了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730168
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 哈哈……我還以為，得親手了結自己的性命呢……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730169
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 謝謝……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730170
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 要是能幫到你的話——好的，來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730171
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730172
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730173
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730174
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730175
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730176
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730177
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 來吧，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730178
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730179
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 我很好奇，牙齒究竟能不能反映出一個人的本性？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730180
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730181
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730182
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730183
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730184
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 失去一切之後，剩下的……就只有這雙手了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730185
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730186
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730187
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 當然。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730188
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730189
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 眼睛能記住好些事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730190
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730191
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730192
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 真假？我都不知道腋窩這麼重要。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730193
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730194
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 看起來挺普通的，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730195
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730196
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730197
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730198
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730199
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 又一件會在死後留下的東西。要是……到時還有人能記住我們的話，就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730200
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 又一件會在死後留下的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730201
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730202
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730203
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 雖然，我們的聲音終將消失於宇宙之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730204
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730205
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 不過，我依舊願意傾聽你的話語！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730206
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730207
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730208
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 我始終願意傾聽你的話語！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730209
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730210
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730211
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 只要手上能握著槍，一切都會變得簡單——對吧？沒有必要傾聽他人的話語，沒有必要進行思考……只管扣下扳機即可。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730212
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730213
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730214
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 為了活下去、不停地奮鬥，搞得滿是泥濘。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730215
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 這些疹子，是過往歲月留下的痕跡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730216
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 難道……你認為擁有一雙飽經滄桑的手，也是一種罪過？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730217
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730218
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730219
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 要是你無法壓抑想要摧毀些什麼東西的強烈衝動的話——就以自己的恐懼為目標吧。我對你有信心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730220
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730221
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730222
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 我並不想與你為敵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730223
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730224
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730225
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 希望……這張照片不會成為我留在這個世上的最後一件東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730226
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730227
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730228
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 難道，你想讓這棟房子再次歸於寂靜嗎？這意味著……你能聽到的，就只剩下自己的心聲了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730229
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730230
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730231
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 你知道嗎？出於各種理由，我以前非常、非常地討厭自己。後來，我意識到——生命並不在於修補一切……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730232
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 而是在於學會接受自己。死亡，也是同樣的道理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730233
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 你知道嗎？我們的雙手承載了一切。不光是歡樂，還有著痛苦。要是不向彼此伸出援手的話，我們就無法存活。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730234
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 眼睛……雖然已經看遍了歡樂、以及死亡，不過——我還是會盡量向前展望。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730235
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 氣味……也是回憶的一部分。自己家裡特有的味道、新鮮出爐的麵包散發出來的香氣、清晨露珠的芬芳——都給予了我們向前邁進的動力。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730236
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 照片不僅僅只是一張圖像，而是我們想要銘記的回憶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730237
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 你知道嗎？所謂的傾聽……不僅僅只是接收聲音，而是要去理解他人——即使對方一句話也沒說。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730238
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 要是這樣對你來說比較輕鬆的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730239
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 就儘管扣下扳機好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924160
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924161
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924162
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: 我曾經聽到過一陣若有似無的嗡鳴，就在耳邊響起……就好像是宇宙在跟我竊竊私語一樣。不過——我認為應該是某種於這之上、維度更高的東西在向我傳達著什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924163
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924164
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924165
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 你想把我的形象永遠保存在底片上？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924166
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 嗯、嗯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924167
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 你知道嗎？我曾經跟太陽領袖本人握過手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924168
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 沒錯，正是我教會他如何直視太陽的。不過，這個故事還是留到之後再說好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924169
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 來——快給我拍出一張賞心悅目的照片吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924170
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924171
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 如此美妙，散發著太陽的光輝！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924172
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 要是有空的話，晚點來一趟吧——我會跟你說說自己的人生故事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924173
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 作為交換，只要給我一點小錢就好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924174
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 一切，都是為了拯救太陽！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924175
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924176
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924177
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 沒錯——我可以透過自己的耳朵直接接受生命的信號！不過，你是怎麼知道的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924178
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924179
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 經過了轉化的陽光，正從我的頭顱之中傾瀉而出！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924180
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 大腦吸收了其中的能量、給予了我相應的力量——令我得以挺身而出，對抗那群從地下爬出來的無比骯髒之徒！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924181
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924182
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924183
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 住手，你個瘋子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924184
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 太陽會使我冷卻下來！即便沐浴在它的正義之……怎麼說來著——哎呀，反正你懂的，我也不會受到絲毫的傷害。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924185
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 全都仰仗我的啤酒靈光。沒錯，神聖的啤酒氣場——就這麼叫好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924186
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 只要能有一瓶下肚，體內會因此變得濕潤起來、太陽就無法再灼傷我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924187
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 非常符合邏輯，對吧？好了……何不把這東西給收起來，然後繼續聽我佈道、獲得救贖？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924188
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924189
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924190
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 潛藏於陰影之中的瘋子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924191
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 你應該不是那些與光無緣的地底居民，對吧？既然如此，又為何要表現得跟它們一模一樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924192
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924193
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924194
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 就來講講我教會太陽領袖該如何去吸收太陽的威光這個故事吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924195
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 某天，這個既瘦小、又軟弱的傢伙找到了我……說自己想知道該如何頂著太陽的高溫生存下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924196
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 我立即就告訴他——「其實，神聖的太陽並不會傷我們一分、一毫！全都是因為你太弱了。我來教你一招！」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924197
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 我給了他一個受到過祝聖的桶子，交代他回去之後把它塗黑。好了之後，就戴在頭上、踏出家門。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924198
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 然後，像這樣大吼一聲——嗚哇哇哇哇！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924199
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 如此一來，裡面就會充滿啤酒的芬芳、他就能汲取太陽的能量了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924200
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 自此之後，我就再也沒有見過他了。大概，是去做一些有意義的事情、而非胡亂瞎混了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924202
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 其實，耳朵根本就無關緊要！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924203
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 重點在於大腦灰質上——一定要將它轉為金黃！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924204
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 說實話，我根本就不知道你到底在盯著什麼東西看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924205
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 要是你非得想跟我說上幾句的話，人類……就別用你這平凡的雙眼直視我這神聖的身軀！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924206
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 只管給我帶幾瓶啤酒來就好！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924207
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 你想檢查什麼地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924208
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924209
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924210
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924211
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924212
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924213
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924214
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 牙齒，是吧？好吧，給你看就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924215
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924216
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我的牙齒——當然又白、又亮。拜託，我又不是什麼拉完屎之後連屁股都不擦的傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924217
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我還記得……小時候，父母想讓我戴牙套。結果，我爽約沒去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924218
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 雖然因為這樣挨了一頓揍，不過——我可不會去看什麼牙醫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924219
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924220
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924221
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 來動動看好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924222
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924223
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 髒了就對了——我整晚都在不停地挖地，想把那群怪胎給找出來、除之而後快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924224
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 這樣，就能更加簡單地消滅它們！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924225
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 你也應該這麼做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924226
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924227
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924228
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 你知道嗎？我的目光也曾無比銳利。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924229
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 然而，經歷過之前的遭遇之後……就變得暗淡、遍佈血絲了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924230
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 當時，我正要送某個偽人上路——結果，他對著我的眼睛扔了……一團泥？又或者是排泄物之類的，不重要了。自此，我的眼睛就疼得不行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924231
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924232
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 輕點，好嗎？疼啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924233
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 面對如今的這種生活，眼睛難免會失去光澤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924234
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924235
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924236
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 即便這樣，我也依然會親手把它們給煎皮拆骨、趕盡殺絕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924237
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 如此一來，生活便能再次回歸平靜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924238
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924239
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924240
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 公佈的特徵越多，就越容易辨別誰是人類、誰是偽人——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924241
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924242
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我就是個普通人——不然，還能怎樣呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924243
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924244
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924245
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我不喜歡拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924246
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 閃光燈會令我想起打雷、使我陷入恐慌。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924247
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 恕難從命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924248
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924249
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924250
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我也看過這個報導。好吧，就來看看好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924251
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924252
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 好了——你看到了什麼？你應該看到了一些東西才對。告訴我，到底是什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924253
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 嗯……要是能知道我們究竟在找什麼鬼東西的話，就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924254
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924255
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924256
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 嗯？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924257
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 等等……這是要幹什麼！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924258
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924259
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924260
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 哇哦，冷靜……沒有必要因此往我身上開幾個洞吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924261
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 每當夜幕降臨，我就會待在窗邊、確認沒有偽人在鬼鬼祟祟地在附近遊蕩。如果只有你一人，恐怕根本活不下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924262
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924263
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924264
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不要衝動，孩子……難道，你要把截了肢的人也給通通都殺掉嗎？畢竟，他們根本就沒辦法向你展示自己的指甲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924265
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 先給我找個醫生、等治好了眼睛後，再重新檢查看看吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924266
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 你到底在害怕什麼，孩子？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924267
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 千萬不要急著下判斷……畢竟，這樣往往會釀成大錯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924268
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924269
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924270
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 聽好，孩子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924271
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 要是失去理智了的話，只會令那群怪物得逞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924272
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924273
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924274
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 唉……即便用槍指著我，也絕無可能！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924275
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 想拍照的話，就找其他人。不然，去把偽人給揪出來、通通殺掉也可以。別他媽的拿這個相機對著我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924276
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……哎呀。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924277
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我會抖的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924278
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924279
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 該死！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924280
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 好了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924281
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924282
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924283
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 怎麼——我成偽人了，是嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924284
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不出所料……你究竟是怎樣得出這個結論的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924285
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924286
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924287
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我能理解，你的身上背負著旁人無法想像的巨大壓力。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924288
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 只是……我們需要齊心協力、對抗偽人，而非自相殘殺。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924289
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 幸好你及時清醒了過來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924290
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 就是這樣！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924291
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 今晚，要不要跟著我收拾幾個偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924292
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 一起去狩獵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924293
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 就是這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924294
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 切勿妄下定論。要是在狩獵時犯下這種錯誤的話——會丟掉性命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924295
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我還以為你真的要扣下扳機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924296
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 你是在糾結什麼呢？我應該不具備相應的特徵，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924297
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 又或者說……你真的只是單純被恐懼沖昏了頭？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924298
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 謝謝你的理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924299
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我非常討厭鏡頭、閃光燈，以及按下快門之後發出的聲響。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924300
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 呸、呸。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924301
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我實在是欣賞不來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924302
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 要是想公佈新的特徵的話，起碼該說清楚應該到底要找什麼東西吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924303
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不然，逮到人之後都不知道該檢查什麼、留意什麼！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924304
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 每個被我殺掉的偽人，在死去前……心裡都是像現在這樣的感覺嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924305
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 太嚇人了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924306
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924307
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924308
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 如果我真的是個偽人……是不是意味著，我接下來會大開殺戒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924309
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我會不會變成危險人物？又或者說……我一直都是個危險人物？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924310
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 也許……也許，我早就已經奪取過他人的性命了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924311
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924312
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 哈哈哈——你能想像嗎？換言之……是真的囉？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924313
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924314
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924315
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 為什麼會有這麼多項特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924316
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 萬一我全都能對上，該怎麼辦？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924317
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924318
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我甚至都不知道這究竟意味著什麼！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924319
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924320
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924321
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 好吧。接著，會怎麼樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924322
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我還能活下去嗎——又或者說，我該去死了？你要怎麼做？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924323
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924324
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924325
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 看來，這就是壓死駱駝的最後一根稻草囉？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924326
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我要死了嗎？你要開槍嗎？天啊……天啊！太可怕了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924327
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924328
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924329
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 為什麼我的人生總是一團糟？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924330
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 為什麼所有的事情都跟我扭曲、畸形的後背一樣無可救藥？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924331
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 一切究竟何時結束？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924332
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 到底什麼時候才能重新過上之前的那種生活？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924333
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 你在等什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924334
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 儘管……開槍好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924335
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 起碼，這樣我就不用每天都擔驚受怕、抖個不停——不用忍受你一次接著一次的找碴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924336
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 要嘛就殺了我，要嘛就別嚇我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924337
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 拜託……我已經瀕臨極限了。之前在家裡發生的事情就已經令我痛苦不堪了。我只求能得到一點安寧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924338
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924339
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924340
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不管是這些亂七八糟的檢查，抑或是那群穿著黃色衣服的傢伙……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924341
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 全都……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924342
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 糟糕透頂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924343
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我們正一步、一步地筆直走向某種地獄——難道，你沒有這種感覺嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924344
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 表面上，一切都盡在掌握。事實上，四處都混亂不堪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924345
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 來吧，拍你這該死的照片吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924346
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924347
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我害怕的……是接下來的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924348
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你知道自己要尋找什麼東西嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924349
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你知道自己要留意什麼東西嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924350
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 看到你這胡亂摸索的樣子，令我感到——我們已經徹底完了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924351
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924352
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 要是……明天，他們讓你去把一個孩子給開膛破肚的話——恐怕，你也不會有絲毫的遲疑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924353
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的……我到底是怎麼淪落到這種噩夢裡面去的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924354
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你想檢查什麼地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924355
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924356
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924357
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924358
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924359
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924360
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924361
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 嗯……牙、牙齒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924362
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 要是能幫上忙的話……好、好的，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924363
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924364
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我三不五時會咬、咬破自己的舌頭，只為感受鮮血給予的一點溫、溫暖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924365
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 以此提醒自己，我還活著。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924366
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924367
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924368
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 指、指甲？看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924369
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 哎呀……我好像把它們都給扯掉了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924370
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不過，應該沒問題吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924371
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924372
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 如何，我的指、指甲具備偽人的特徵嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924373
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924374
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924375
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 如今這個世道，眼睛已經不是心、心靈的窗戶……而是地獄的大門。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924376
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我們的內在早就已經燃、燃燒殆盡。也許……正因如此，我才會感到無比寒、寒冷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924377
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924378
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 瞳、瞳孔出現了收縮？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924379
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 大概，是這股寒、寒意導致的吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924380
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 然而……即便這樣，太陽也還是會令我灼、灼傷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924381
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不過——起碼，同時也會收穫一絲溫、溫暖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924382
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924383
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924384
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 哎呀……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924385
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我……需要一點時間。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924386
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 稍、稍等……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924387
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 好了……看吧。不過，還請快、快些。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924388
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924389
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 之所以會答應這個要求，主要是出於對你的尊重。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924390
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 像這樣一絲不掛……令、令我感到不快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924391
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924392
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924393
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 一張照片是能證、證明什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924394
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 難道，你就不覺得奇怪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924395
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不、不過……這並非我能決定的事情就對了——來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924396
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924397
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 如何，有什麼不對勁的地方嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924398
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 也給我看、看看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924399
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924400
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924401
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我們的身、身體，只不過是一個又一個的空洞罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924402
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 也許，正因如此……大、大家才會這麼容易就消失得無影無蹤吧——僅、僅僅只需要一轉身的工夫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924403
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924404
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 早、早晚，就連最為親、親密的人……也會突然不見蹤影。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924405
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924406
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924407
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 看、看來，很快……就沒有必要繼續這樣做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924408
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924409
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924410
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 的確……在這種情況下，你根、根本就沒有辦法好好檢查我的雙、雙手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924411
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不過——要、要是可以的話……先別開槍，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924412
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我想要告訴你一、一些事情。只是……只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924413
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924414
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924415
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 難道，是蟄、蟄伏在內心深處的殺人兇手佔據了你的心智？我的眼睛一、一點也不紅、沒有遍佈血絲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924416
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 好、好吧。既然如此，就不要再猶、猶豫不決了。等待要比死、死亡更加痛苦，難熬。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924417
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924418
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924419
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 難道，是長出了真、真菌？大概，是因為我還會出、出汗的緣故吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924420
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我的身體正、正在與某種東西作鬥爭……然而，一切都是徒勞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924421
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924422
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924423
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我能留、留著這張照片嗎？畢竟……從來都沒、沒人給我拍過照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924424
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 感覺還挺、挺不錯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924425
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924426
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924427
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你……在那片虛、虛空之中看到了什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924428
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 難、難道，是令你想起了自己？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924429
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924430
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924431
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 謝、謝謝你的信任。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924432
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我希、希望，自己能幫上一點忙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924433
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我一直在糾結某件事情，只是……目前還沒、沒有辦法跟你講。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924434
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 其實，我已經再也不、不想以這樣的狀態活下去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924435
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 然而，你並沒有殺、殺了我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924436
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 與此同、同時……在某個地方，卻有人在自己的房子裡慘、慘遭毒手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924437
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你有沒有想過……這都是為什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924438
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我的雙眼早就已經失、失去生機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924439
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 剩下的只有無邊無際的孤、孤獨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924440
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我無法與他人建立起親密的關係。因為……這樣只、只會帶來痛苦，以及挫敗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924441
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我好懷念過去安、安靜的生活。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924442
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 沒有什、什麼滅頂之災。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924443
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 還位於食、食物鏈的頂端，還能走在太、太陽底下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924444
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 只是，當時——我就已經感到無比寒冷，不敢脫下這件夾克就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924445
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你說——究竟還要找出多、多少項特徵，他們才能解決目前的危機，結、結束這一切？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924446
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 為何非得有人喪、喪命？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924447
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 又或者說……其實，全都可、可以避免？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924448
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924449
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 抱歉。我、我不該問這麼多私人的問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924450
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不想回、回答也沒事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924451
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我只是覺得……問問也無妨，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924452
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 大、大概，也是徒勞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924453
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你知道嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924454
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我想……我終於知道自己為什麼會感到如此寒、寒冷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924455
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924456
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924457
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 你是在侮辱我們嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924458
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我丈夫活著的時候，沒人向他伸出援手、得不到應有的尊重……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924459
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 然而，當他已經不在了的時候……你——卻竟然想要拍下他的死亡？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924460
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924461
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我無言以對。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924462
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 想做什麼都隨便你，好了之後就趕緊走。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924463
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924464
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 滿意了吧？快點滾吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924465
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924466
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924467
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924468
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 你想怎樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924469
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我的耐心已經全都消耗殆盡了。我再也無法忍受任何的扯淡了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924470
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924471
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924472
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 想也知道，照片上的靈光……出於悲傷，肯定是淺鬱的湛藍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924473
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 理由？你心知肚明——你很清楚這一切對我來說有多麼的難以承受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924474
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 然而……你卻還是不斷地折磨著我。到底是為什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924475
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924476
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924477
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 真假？你竟然不惜做到這種地步？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924478
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我不知道該跟你說些什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924479
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924480
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 你找到自己想找的東西了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924481
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924482
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924483
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我還握著與他僅剩的最後一張合照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924484
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 最後留下來的，竟然……只有這些？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924485
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 而且——隨著時間的流逝，也一定會出現褶皺、變得破損、逐漸褪色。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924486
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我已經再也無法跟他說話了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924487
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我想休息了。你能離開嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924488
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 放心，我哪裡也不去——只會靜靜地坐在這裡。希望你可以讓我獨自整理內心的各種思緒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924489
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924490
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924491
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 想要給我拍照？好啊，有何不可呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924492
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 不過，我對光線特別敏感。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924493
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924494
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 喏，就是這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924495
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 哎呀……媽的，只能看到一個模糊的輪廓。真是浪費了這麼好的一個姿勢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924496
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 哎呀……媽的，你根本就沒有好好清理鏡頭——瞧瞧，上面竟然出現了一些斑點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924497
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924498
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924499
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 拜託，這法子可是我先想出來的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118464
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 先裝模作樣地看一下，然後說裡面寄宿了喚作「偽人」的邪靈——要是不給封口費的話，就給抖出去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118465
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 我會給你看耳朵，不過……千萬不要用這招來誆我，行吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118466
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118467
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 完全沒有任何問題，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118468
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118469
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118470
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 就因為一張照片？拜託，兄弟——開什麼玩笑！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118471
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 我曾經在牌局上輸掉了阿姨的房子——即便這樣，她也沒有想要這樣對我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118472
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118473
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118474
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 拜託。我早就說過了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118475
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 我已經破產了，兄弟。全都賠進賭場裡了、一點都不剩了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118476
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118477
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118478
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 不要誆我。將這些把戲用在那群白癡身上吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118479
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 令他們維持在一種較為緊張的狀態。你懂我在說什麼，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118480
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 別讓這些傢伙過得太過舒適，否則就會忘記到底是誰收留了他們、開始反客為主。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118481
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 呼……差點把我給嚇出一身冷汗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118482
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 沒事，不必擔心。起碼，我並不用交房租——哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118483
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 我會盡快搞到一些錢、買一棟新的房子，然後盡情地肆意揮霍、過上國王一般的生活！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118484
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118485
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118486
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118487
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我沒有幾張自己的照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118488
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 拍好之後能給我看看嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118489
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118490
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 嗯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118491
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 謝謝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118492
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我不喜歡——別再讓我拍照了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118493
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸總說——一定要提防蜱蟲、臭蟲，以及寄生蟲。你是在找它們嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118494
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118495
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 謝謝你幫我進行檢查！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118496
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 等爸爸來了之後，我一定會跟他說——你絕對不是什麼偽人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118497
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 他應該快到了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118498
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哎呀，寶貝——你想檢查什麼地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118499
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118500
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118501
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118502
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118503
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118504
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118505
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哈哈哈——牙齒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118506
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 好啦，寶貝。自己看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118507
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118508
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118509
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 怎麼，難道……只因為像我這樣的老太婆想給牙齒做個陶瓷貼片，就要被趕盡殺絕？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118510
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118511
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118512
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 這恐怕有點麻煩。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118513
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 變老並不是一件令人開心的事情，寶貝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118514
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118515
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我的指甲一直都在脫落……哎呀，這是叫什麼病來著？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118516
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 總之，疼得要命。特別難搞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118517
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118518
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118519
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我的眼睛裡總會有那麼幾根微血管是破裂的狀態。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118520
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 不太清楚你到底要怎麼判斷我是不是偽人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118521
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118522
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 好了。接著，該怎麼辦？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118523
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118524
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118525
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我的年紀已經非常大了，這副身體早就不中用囉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118526
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118527
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 總是會癢個不停，不知道該怎麼辦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118528
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 雖然也試過一些法子，不過……都沒有什麼效果。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118529
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118530
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118531
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 已經好幾年沒人給我拍過照了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118532
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 來吧，寶貝——有何不可呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118533
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118534
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 為什麼我整個人都模糊不清的？只剩下一些汙漬，還有斑點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118535
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118536
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118537
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 每天晚上，我都會聽到一些莫名其妙的刮擦聲。就好像……有什麼東西來爬來爬去一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118538
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118539
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哎呀，該死！快、快點——抓住它，幹掉它！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118540
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118541
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118542
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 霰彈槍？寶貝，這就不對了——靠這東西，怕是解決不了目前的狀況。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118543
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 最好在背後捅刀。又或者是……下毒。我不會騙你——好好記住吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118544
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118545
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118546
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 沒有必要擔心，我這雙手還靈著呢。不光能顧好自己，還能顧好家人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118547
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118548
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118549
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 過去的三年裡，我的視力可以說是每況愈下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118550
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 看來……這些爆掉了的血管，應該是不會再自癒了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118551
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 或許，是罹癌了也說不定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118552
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118553
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118554
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哈哈哈！這把霰彈槍……還真是「萬應靈藥」！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118555
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 好了，還等什麼——不是要「治療」一下我這可憐的老婦嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118556
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118557
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118558
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 蛤——靈光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118559
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 拜託，我看這台東西早就已經壞囉。你被騙得一乾二淨，卻還是學不到教訓……像在吃蘋果派一樣照單全收！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118560
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 太可笑了——哈哈哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118561
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118562
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118563
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 等等，你以為我想要跑？誤會大了！快點幫忙抓住那隻該死的蟑螂！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118564
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我特別討厭害蟲——該死……這隻甚至鑽進了我的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118565
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118566
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118567
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 唉……建議你最好還是克制一點——不要總拿這東西出來嚇人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118568
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 今天指著我、明天指著他……再這樣下去，早晚會換來大家的睥睨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118569
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 再說，你也不可能一整天都抱著這把霰彈槍。懂我的意思吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118570
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 殺掉我這種年老、體弱的婦人，到底有何意義呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118571
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 沒錯……你當然可以說，是為了讓我解脫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118572
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 心想，我的身體說不定經受著什麼痛苦——對吧？。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118573
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 沒錯，這怎麼可能會是一項特徵呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118574
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 萬一手滑了、開槍了，就太糟糕了——對吧？畢竟，一條無辜的生命會因此隕落。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118575
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 不知，這種事情……你做過幾遍了？你感受過……這份罪孽的沉重嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118576
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 最近剛好聽說了這樣的一句話——要是再也感覺不到哪怕一丁點的疼痛了的話，也就意味著你已經死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118577
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 並不是只有上了年紀的人會這樣。如今，人人均是如此……每時每刻，都在腐爛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118578
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我能留著這張照片嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118579
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 畢竟，我已經沒有其他照片了。雖然不是很喜歡這張……不過，還是留著吧——有何不可呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118580
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 你呢，寶貝？有沒有蟲子爬進過你的嘴巴、或是其他什麼地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118581
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我這副病入膏肓的身體，就數這對耳朵最健康了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118582
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 希望那隻該死的蟑螂沒有在我的大腦邊上產卵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118583
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 來吧，開槍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118584
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我死了之後，我的家人自會前來、把你，以及這裡的其他住客給煎皮拆骨……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118585
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哈哈哈哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118586
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118587
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118588
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 哎喲——要在我的身上浪費底片？好吧，實在是受寵若驚呢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118589
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118590
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 好了……現在，該怎麼說？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118591
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118592
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118593
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 哎呀！真是個奇特的想法。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118594
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118595
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 我甚至聽得到一根細針掉落地面的時候發出的聲音。不過，你知道嗎？有時……我總感覺自己好像就根本不存在一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118596
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 就……彷彿，只有透過極其微弱的光線才能看到我。而且，還不是每次都能見到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118597
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118598
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118599
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 天啊——你真的要對一個老婦人開槍？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118600
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118601
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118602
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 到底是為什麼呢，寶貝？單憑一雙耳朵，真的能看出什麼所以然？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118603
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118604
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118605
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 於我那個年代，這種東西是專屬於有錢人的玩具。然而，現在——就連普通人都能隨意使用了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118606
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 呸！我已經沒有什麼想要跟你說的了。一切，全是胡鬧。你只不過是在無緣無故地煩擾良民、以之為樂罷了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118607
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118608
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118609
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 說實話……我並不相信什麼靈光不靈光的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118610
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 我們所作的一切、我們所去的地方——全都出於我們的個人意志，與這些故弄玄虛的東西沒有任何的關係。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118611
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118612
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 好了……如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118613
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118614
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118615
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 等等……這是哪項特徵來著？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118616
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 你——是在找什麼來著？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118617
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118618
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 好了。怎樣，得出結論了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118619
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118620
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118621
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 等等……難道，你真的相信這種天方夜譚？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118622
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118623
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118624
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 你為何會覺得我是個偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118625
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 該死……到底是什麼東西把你的火藥桶給點著了？你——究竟知不知道自己在做什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118626
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118627
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118628
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 所以……你只是想開個玩笑而已？千萬不要再這樣做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118629
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 我早就因為自己丈夫的事情而坐立不安、心煩意亂了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118630
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 他……他應該快到了。他會來幫我、還有我的姊妹的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118631
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 嚇死我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118632
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 希望FEMA知道自己在做什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118633
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 至於這些所謂的特徵……我不好說。有時，我會覺得都是在胡扯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118634
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 然而，有時——我又會覺得都是真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118635
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118636
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118637
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118638
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118639
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我並不在乎到底有沒有東西可以留下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118640
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 想怎麼做，都隨便你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118641
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118642
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 這是什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118643
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118644
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118645
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我剩下的東西，儘有一只耳環。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118646
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 能令我想起父母。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118647
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118648
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我的姊妹並沒有戴著她的那只。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118649
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我也應該取下我的那只。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118650
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 畢竟……會令她想起父母，因此而陷入悲痛之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118651
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118652
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118653
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 記得把這張照片也一起燒了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118654
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118655
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118656
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 不要猶豫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118657
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 該怎麼做，就怎麼做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118658
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118659
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118660
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 你還在糾結什麼呢？只管扣下扳機就好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118661
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 要知道，偽人並不會因為被人拿槍指著就伺機暴起、突然襲擊。它們絕對不會主動暴露自己的真實身份。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118662
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 想要確認，只有一種方法——一種既快速、又簡單的方法……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118663
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 你覺得……我們會死於什麼東西的手上？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118664
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 偽人？又或者說，天災——甚至，人禍？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118665
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 還有……這一時刻，又會在什麼時候來臨？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118666
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118667
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118668
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 看吧、看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118669
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118670
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118671
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118672
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118673
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118674
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118675
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 小心一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118676
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是敢靠得太近的話，我會二話不說、直接把你的脖子給咬斷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118677
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118678
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我一直都把自己的牙齒保養得很好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118679
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 至於遺失了的那幾顆……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118680
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 就當作是送給那些已經躺在泥巴裡了的傢伙好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118681
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118682
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118683
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 怎麼，你想聽聽關於這雙手的事情？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118684
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我殺過人，它們——自然也沾滿了鮮血。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118685
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 對方試圖取我性命。而我，並不是那種不懂反抗、會坐以待斃的傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118686
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 結果，有人被嚇得呆呆地站在原地、有人被嚇得屁滾尿流、落荒而逃。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118687
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 至於我嘛……則是以其人之道、還治其人之身。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118688
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118689
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 怎樣——滿意了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118690
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118691
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118692
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 難道，你是想透過我的這雙眼睛尋找某種陌生的……東西？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118693
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你——就不怕看到自己的倒影？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118694
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118695
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 真了不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118696
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要知道，沒幾個人敢跟我對視。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118697
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118698
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118699
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我……對此嗤之以鼻——我會記住你的所作所為。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118700
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118701
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 雖然使用除臭劑會令皮膚變得乾燥，不過……總比有異味要好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118702
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是沒有什麼好隱瞞的話，散發出來的味道也應該清新、自然。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118703
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118704
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118705
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我不喜歡拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118706
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是沒有把拍出來的照片給揉皺、丟進垃圾桶，而是用在了其他地方的話……就別怪我翻臉無情了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118707
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 明白了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118708
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118709
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 看看，都拍成了個什麼鬼樣子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118710
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 快點拿來——我會親手把它給銷毀掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118711
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118712
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118713
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 接下來，是不是要問——「你的牙齒為什麼會這麼大？」真是瘋了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118714
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118715
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 也許，我該趁你還保有一絲理智的時候把你塞進拘束衣裡、免得你開始傷害自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118716
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118717
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118718
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 香菸不僅會毀掉那些不懂得分享的傢伙，也會讓牙齦變得鬆軟、令咬合力下降。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118719
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 怎麼，難道——你認為我之前沒被人拿槍指過？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118720
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118721
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118722
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 怎麼，你要扣下扳機嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118723
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 完了之後，又該怎樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118724
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118725
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118726
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 看到自己的倒影了，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118727
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我可不會就此罷休。即便死了，我也會在來世跟你算清這筆帳。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118728
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118729
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118730
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 不僅強迫一個正派、老實的人按照自己的意願行事，然後——甚至還得寸進尺地對其加以威脅、恐嚇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118731
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是在我老家的話，你這種傢伙甚至就連一天都活不下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118732
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118733
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118734
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 拿槍到處亂指是不會令你贏得他人尊重的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118735
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 一隻被打怕了的狗是不會對你忠心耿耿的……總有一天，會反過來咬你一口。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118736
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118737
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118738
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 不夠果斷、不夠果決。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118739
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 既然，你這麼喜歡獨自一人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118740
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 乾脆，趕緊把大家都宰了、一了百了得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118741
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118742
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118743
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 千萬不要再拿槍指著我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118744
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我知道你什麼時候睡覺，我也知道你會睡多久、什麼時候醒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118745
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是敢再得寸進尺的話，孩子——就別怪我把你給生吞活剝了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118746
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 別犯錯了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118747
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我的動作要比你快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118748
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 只要我有這個意思，隨時都可以把槍給從你手上奪過來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118749
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 沒錯，冷靜一點——就是這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118750
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我看錯你了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118751
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是舉起了武器、又不去使用的話，只會讓對方知道自己的內心還存有疑惑。而這，十分危險。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118752
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你在我黑名單上的位置……可是越來越靠前了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118753
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是敢再耍什麼廉價把戲的話，就別怪我不客氣了——我說清楚了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118754
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 開什麼玩笑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118755
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你就像一隻追著煙火玩接球遊戲的狗狗。總有一種……不太對勁的感覺。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118756
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 放下這把東西吧，不然——你遲早會害死自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118757
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 冷靜一點。大人的事情，就讓大人來處理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118758
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 別再讓自己蒙羞了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118759
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我曾經擺脫過比這更加糟糕的局面。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312768
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 來啊——看看誰比較快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312769
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 啊——！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312770
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 你想檢查什麼地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312771
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312772
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312773
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312774
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312775
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312776
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312777
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 謝謝關心——我的牙齒都很好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312778
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 哎呀……你是想檢查我有沒有偽人的特徵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312779
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的，儘管看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312780
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312781
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 完美無瑕，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312782
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我的一個好友幫忙植的。而且，還是免費的呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312783
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 因為，不久之前——我剛剛給他完成了一場非常成功的手術。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312784
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不知，他現在怎麼樣了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312785
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312786
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312787
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我這雙手——給無數的病患做過手術。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312788
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 其中的故事甚至可以說上好幾天……不過，還是先留到下次吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312789
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 現在，還是先進行檢查好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312790
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312791
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我會盡可能地讓自己的雙手維持在最佳的狀態，從不會有一絲、一毫的鬆懈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312792
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 畢竟，誰也不知道明天會發生什麼事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312793
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312794
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312795
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的。眼睛是嗎？隨便看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312796
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不知道你之前有沒有注意到——其實，我患有多瞳症。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312797
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 沒錯，這是正式診斷過後得出的結果。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312798
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312799
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 比較反直覺的是，這一症狀並沒有令我的視力變好、反而更差。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312800
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我想，絕大多數的人應該覺得一個眼球裡有兩個瞳孔會看得更加清楚吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312801
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 然而……事與願違。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312802
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312803
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312804
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的。稍等一下——我的動作已經沒有年輕時那麼俐落了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312805
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312806
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我會盡可能地讓自己保持乾淨、整潔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312807
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 畢竟，在這樣的一個世界裡……你永遠不知道明天是否能有機會洗澡。非常有可能得整整一週都維持著髒兮兮的模樣，哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312808
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312809
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312810
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 沒問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312811
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我能理解——你想盡可能地排除任何不穩定的因素。因此，這肯定也是其中的一環。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312812
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312813
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 大家都說我長相怪異。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312814
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 你覺得呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312815
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312816
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312817
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的。我相信你知道自己在做什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312818
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312819
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 既然我還好端端地站在這裡，就說明——你做出了正確的決定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312820
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312821
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312822
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 等等，這是要幹什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312823
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 你錯了——我的職責是救死扶傷、而非奪取性命！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312824
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 反而是你，正要殺害一個無辜的人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312825
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312826
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312827
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 等等，這再正常不過了。雖說我是個醫生，然而……現在根本就沒有什麼合適的消毒方式！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312828
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 既然如此，說說看吧——在你看來，尋常人類的雙手又該長什麼樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312829
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312830
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312831
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 真有意思。唉……可惜的是，我沒有辦法去深入研究你的這種偏執心裡是怎樣形成的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312832
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不過，這也不是我的專業領域就對了。因此，大概也得不出什麼像樣的結論。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312833
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312834
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312835
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 扣下扳機之前，還請務必三思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312836
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 又或者是……先檢查其他地方，好好確認一下。不要因為一時衝動而丟了大局。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312837
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312838
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312839
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 真有意思。你竟然會相信這些所謂的……靈光照片？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312840
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 難不成，你甚至會待在電視前、給自己要喝的水注入一些什麼能量？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312841
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312842
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312843
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 畢竟在醫院工作了這麼久，我早就已經與死亡和解了。現在，我只對一件事情感到疑惑——為何大家都如此拚命地想要活下去？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312844
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 畢竟在醫院工作了這麼久，我早就已經習慣與死亡為伴了。不過……不管怎樣，還是希望可以好好地活著——這是人之常情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312845
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312846
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312847
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 要是你有這個意思的話，我也可以幫忙矯正牙齒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312848
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 當然，只會象徵性地收取一點費用。畢竟，你可是幫了我大忙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312849
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 等太陽不再爆發、一切塵埃落定時，就這樣做吧——我們說好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312850
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 當然，再怎麼小心、謹慎也不為過。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312851
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 只是，萬一因此做出了錯誤的決定——你真的能背負這沉重的罪孽，繼續活下去嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312852
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 非常嚇人，對吧？如今這個世道，恐懼不受掌控、四處蔓延。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312853
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 雖然，有人可能會指望FEMA挺身而出、撥亂反正。不過……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312854
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 唉，這麼說好了——我並不覺得他們能幫上什麼忙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312855
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 切勿衝動行事。一定要始終保持頭腦的清醒，看清大局。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312856
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 這是我在醫院裡學到的教訓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312857
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 也是我之所以得離開的理由。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312858
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 說說看——你為何會相信所謂的靈光？按下快門之後，你真的有感應到什麼東西嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312859
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 無意冒犯，不過……為什麼要這樣輕而易舉地就相信了FEMA所提出的這項檢查？你不覺得，這套說辭更像是為了安撫大眾的情緒而臨時東拚西湊出來的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312860
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我這輩子親眼目睹過太多、太多的苦難……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312861
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 有時，你會想不通——人生究竟有何意義？感覺一切都是徒勞無功、白費力氣，只有痛苦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312862
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 然而，卻依舊沒人願意放棄。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312863
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 就來看看，我們究竟能堅持到什麼時候好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312864
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不、不——不要開槍，拜託……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312865
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我只不過是個醫生罷了，僅此而已……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312866
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窩補泰東……膩相譖羊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312867
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312868
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312869
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312870
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312871
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312872
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312873
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窩得……嘴巴？妹搓，只簽北風德四四得。嫌宰，蓋譖嚒板？南島，咬小衣格？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312874
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312875
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 染猴，蓋譖嚒板？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312876
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312877
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312878
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 爽受？號得。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312879
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312880
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 尾和藥著癢坐？尾了……消磨市檢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312881
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312882
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312883
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 鹽經？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312884
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312885
    m_Localized: "Foreigner: 窩孩室卜東膩尾和藥著癢坐……\n遊與太陽灰卓尚世旺末，印詞窩緊亮卜灰取看塔。"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312886
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312887
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312888
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窩翼精衣偷汙稅了……礙亞，歲鞭了、歲鞭了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312889
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312890
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 蠻夷了碼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312891
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312892
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312893
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 找篇宰拿離訥？贏蓋爸塔給颳器籟！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312894
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312895
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 刻譯給窩勘勘碼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312896
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312897
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312898
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 酒室爽撲撲同同得兒躲，金賜餌伊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312899
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312900
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 堆了，海逮折窩琴挨得捧由鬆得兒患。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312901
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312902
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312903
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312904
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 羔神魔龜？窩卜室安兆膩爍得取左了碼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312905
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312906
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312907
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 塊電爸牆方霞！窩兵妹遊左國認喝尚孩膩得市清！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312908
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312909
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312910
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 白脫——窩兵卜市神麼懷任！指市羽膩於岩卜瞳兒伊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312911
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312912
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312913
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 白脫，祝壽！南島，膩縫了碼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312914
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312915
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312916
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 哈哈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312917
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312918
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312919
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 萬了指猴，游蓋譖羊？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312920
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312921
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312922
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 陣室伙卜蛋星。指錢倍任講罪罷給風尚了，線宰倍任娜牆治折、兒切姬湖久藥扣下扳機了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312923
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窩陣蓋毫毫第吸衣夏壽……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312924
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 鹽經久室鹽經，盡瓷兒伊——尾合藥夏湖窩？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312925
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 井髯灰相藥檢查折腫第防……毫向，卜台堆竟……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312926
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窩狠希環著篇。卜裹，砍賴膩併卜惹腫羽瓷——隊碼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312927
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窩遠翼府除衣且帶假，直尾宰箭獺衣麵……窩號嚮塔。真是遺憾——折待彪蟄神麼碼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312928
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 砍籟，衣竊久島刺尾汁了。妹任能停東窩爍得花，達嘉鬥堆窩比汁卜幾……兒切，什只……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312929
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 藥了窩得冥……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312930
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我這一生所經歷的種種，早已成為一段段的過往。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312931
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312932
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312933
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312934
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312935
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312936
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312937
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我還記得她如同珍珠一般牙齒……我非常鍾情於她綻放的燦爛笑容……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312938
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312939
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 至於我的……則像被雨水淋濕過後、擱置了太久的秋葉，早就已經成為腐土。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312940
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 看吧……就是愛的代價。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312941
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312942
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312943
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 她的雙手是如此的柔軟。甚至，偶爾會令我擔心——它們會不會如同幽靈一般，融入我的軀體……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312944
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312945
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的右手——已經不屬於自己了。一點、一滴地……在腐爛著。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312946
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的左手——則暫且安然無恙。看到上面的指甲了吧？乾淨、整潔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312947
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312948
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312949
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 甚至，只要一想起她的眼睛、就會令我感到心神不寧……抱歉，你想要看的、是我的眼睛……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312950
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312951
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 大家都說——經常哭泣的人，眼睛的顏色會變得較為暗沉。不過，我已經很久沒有流下過淚水了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312952
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我已經不再執著去尋找她的容顏。學會接受，向來是最難的一課。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312953
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，該說是舊習難改嗎……我還是會不斷地去尋找她的身影。即便只用眼角的餘光掃過，也希望能捕捉到一絲蹤跡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312954
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312955
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312956
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312957
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312958
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 要是長時間不活動一下的話，會令身體感到不適。起初，為了她——我勉強自己維持著相同的姿勢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312959
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，後來發現……這樣根本沒有任何意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312960
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 要是長時間不活動一下的話，會令身體感到不適。然而，我別無選擇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312961
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312962
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312963
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312964
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312965
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 如何……我上相嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312966
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 不過，更重要的是……你看到了什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312967
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312968
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312969
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 過往事物，依舊留存。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312970
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312971
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的耳朵應該是這副軀體上為數不多、從未改變的東西之一了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312972
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312973
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312974
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 難道，你是想讓我感到害怕嗎？不，我的朋友——這副皮囊只不過是一具空殼罷了，早已分崩離析。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312975
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312976
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312977
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 要是可以的話，我希望能以自己設想的方式離世……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312978
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312979
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312980
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 就讓我以自己設想的方式離世吧。沒有必要浪費你寶貴的彈藥……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312981
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312982
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312983
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 你知道嗎？要是長久以來都與某人為伴的話……你就會逐漸汲取對方的特質。我覺得，她已經成為了我的一部分——我的血肉、我的靈魂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312984
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312985
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312986
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 真有意思……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312987
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312988
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312989
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312990
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312991
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312992
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 你知道嗎？每當她親吻我，都會覺得……也許，那就是最後一次。現在，我終於明白她為什麼會這樣想了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312993
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我曾經費盡心思地想要保住這隻手……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312994
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 心想——只要身上還有某個地方能保持乾淨、整潔的話，也許就能成為一份念想。然而，現在……又有什麼意義呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312995
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 沒錯，這樣要比較好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312996
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 每當凝視她的雙眸，我都感覺……蒼穹萬象倒映在那兩汪乳白的眼眸之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312997
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，現在……只剩一片虛無——一個不斷把我給拉扯進去的黑洞。只有一縷餘嚮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312998
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 陌生的字句，陌生的音色——死者，竟在替她發聲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312999
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 奇怪……大家總說，要是生者在逝者身邊徘徊得太久的話、就會從他們身上染到一些什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313000
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 萬一……事實剛好相反，該怎麼辦？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313001
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 照片只能捕獲表面，而非靈魂。如果我是個畫家，就會將她的神韻給好好地塗抹在帆布之上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313002
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，我只是個無可救藥的浪漫主義者……因此，只能令她活在我的回憶之中——直至，我也離開這個世界的那天。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313003
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 她特別喜歡在我的耳邊輕聲細語。只是……我並不知道她都說了些什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313004
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 也許，是因為我一廂情願地認為都是一些溫柔的話語吧。然而，她卻早已不在人世……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313005
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我來找你了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313006
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的摯愛……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313007
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 哎呀，呃……兄弟，千萬不要誤會。我並不是說不行，只是……唉，你等一下就會明白了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313008
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313009
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313010
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313011
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313012
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313013
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313014
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不就是牙齒嗎？能有什麼特別的呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313015
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我一直都很愛護它們。我還記得……小時候甚至還特地去做過美白。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313016
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313017
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的老爸經常說——「人們最先看到的，就是你的笑容。」就是，第一印象什麼的……諸如此類。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313018
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313019
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313020
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我也知道，的確……不太好看就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313021
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313022
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 就是一雙平淡無奇的手……要是我並不抽菸的話，現在八成早就因為過度緊張而把手指給摳得流血了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313023
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 就是一雙平凡無奇的手……沒錯，我也知道——指甲很髒。我總是會習慣性地摳弄方向盤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313024
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不然，就會引發路怒——總不能把客人給嚇跑了啊，哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313025
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313026
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313027
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的眼睛總是非常疲憊。主要是——想閉上也難。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313028
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313029
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 因為，已經……習慣成自然了。會下意識地去留意身邊的一切事物。譬如，誰在後方行駛、誰在盯著我看、誰長時間沒有說話，諸如此類。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313030
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 大概，可以說是職業病？完全甩不掉。現在，甚至已經開始有點失眠了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313031
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313032
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 自從車子被他們給扣走之後，我就夜不能寐。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313033
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 你知道嗎？我養成了職業病，會下意識地去留意誰在後方行駛、誰在盯著我看、誰長時間沒有說話，諸如此類……完全甩不掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313034
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313035
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313036
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 沒什麼特別的——真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313037
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313038
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是開車時間太長的話，我的手臂就會感到一陣酸痛。你知道嗎？有時，甚至就連整條手臂都抬不起來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313039
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不過，我也已經習慣了就是了。特別是現在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313040
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313041
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313042
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 拍吧，兄弟——我已經準備好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313043
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313044
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 好了……你看到了什麼？大概，就只有我吧。不會有什麼問題的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313045
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的車裡曾經放了一些我跟老爸一起拍的照片。現在……會給我拍照的，大概就只有那些到處在檢查別人的傢伙了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313046
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 還有你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313047
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313048
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313049
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的耳朵？就跟大家一樣，沒什麼特別的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313050
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313051
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不過，倒是挺能派上用場就對了——乘客總是自然而然地就會侃侃而談、說個沒完。我從不打斷他們，只是……靜靜地聽著。把那些事情給記在心裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313052
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不過，有時……聽到的事情也太多了點就是了。你懂我的意思吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313053
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313054
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313055
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 冷靜，兄弟——冷靜！我並沒有瘋，只是……這一切，從那時就開始了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313056
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 怎麼說呢，牙齒……總會令我想起某個傢伙，某個非常、非常壞的傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313057
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的老爸曾經與他有過一次交集……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313058
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 從那之後，我就開始抽菸了。你也看到了吧，我的牙齒都因為這樣、變成這種半黃不白得樣子了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313059
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313060
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313061
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 唉……兄弟，你這是在開什麼玩笑？每次開車，其實就跟活受罪沒什麼兩樣。你應該能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313062
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 為了解壓，有人會猛砸方向盤、有人會大吼大叫，甚至有人會大打出手。每個人都有自己的應對方式。因此……拜託，別這樣對我——好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313063
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313064
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313065
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 拜託，兄弟。我並不傻。我知道你把我當成了偽人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313066
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 然而，大錯特錯。你真的要對一個無辜的人扣下扳機嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313067
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313068
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313069
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 好吧，想開槍的話、就儘管動手。一了百了。反正，也從來沒人護過我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313070
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313071
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313072
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是你早就已經透過這台相機拍出來的東西下了定論的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313073
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 就不要再有所猶豫。我也沒什麼好說的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313074
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313075
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313076
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 聽好，兄弟——要是你有什麼事情憋在心裡、想要一吐為快的話，我很樂意聽你說。我很擅長當個聽眾。畢竟……我自己的故事，實在是沒有什麼好說的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313077
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313078
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313079
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 你大概在想……既然抽菸把我的牙齒都毀成了這副鬼樣，為何還不戒菸呢——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507072
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 你大概在想……我為何會漂白自己的牙齒——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507073
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 因為，這樣一來……我看起來就像是另一個人。當然，不是像個偽人、而是……你懂吧？嗯嗯，你懂的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507074
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我們曾經遇到過這樣的一個客人——這個傢伙……是本地的大咖。人人都知道他是誰，就連我這個小鬼也不例外。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507075
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 表面上看起來跟普通人沒什麼區別。就是特別喜歡抽菸。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507076
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 表面上看起來跟普通人沒什麼區別。就是，一旦咧開嘴、笑起來……就能看到他那口如同瓷器一般潔白的牙齒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507077
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 那天……老爸做了一個錯誤的決定，我們都因此付出了代價。之後，只能像過街老鼠一樣、東躲西藏。沒了房子，沒了積蓄——沒了一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507078
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我曾經以為雙手象徵著力量、代表著控制——不管是掌握車子的前行，抑或是掌握人生的方向。然而，現在……唉，已經再也沒有任何意義了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507079
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我一直都在留意自己周遭的情況。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507080
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 一邊尋找下一個乘客，一邊好奇他們是不是真的跟自己說的一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507081
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是因此而嚇到了你的話，我願意道歉。既然車子都已經沒有了，也許……我也該改掉這個習慣了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507082
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我偶爾會想……要是當時還有別人能看護我的話，也許——我就不會坐在車子的後座、跟爸爸一起出勤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507083
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 也許——我們就不會被接到這個傢伙，就不會……失去一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507084
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 也許，你終究還是在我的身上看到了一絲人性。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507085
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 雖然，我並不是什麼完人。不過，我真的有努力過了——真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507086
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 話說……你知道嗎？乘客安安靜靜地坐在後排、一言不發——這，反而是最可怕的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507087
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 因為，這樣一來、就會開始聽到自己內心的聲音，甚至比收音機的聲音還要大。完全無法停下，怎麼也甩不掉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507088
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是可以的話，把我的骨灰給灑向風中——好嗎？我並不想睡在泥巴裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507089
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我並不想……曝屍荒野。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507090
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 看來，你有看電視、而且信了關於偽人的整套說辭，是吧？行吧，隨你喜歡。不過，我可不會忘了自己應有的權利！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507091
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507092
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507093
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507094
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507095
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507096
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507097
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 我猜——你是不是還想看看有沒有什麼吃剩的東西黏在了牙齒上，好扒下來讓自己能飽餐一頓？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507098
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507099
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 如何，滿意了嗎？又或者說，只因為我刷了牙、你就要犯下蓄意謀殺的罪行？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507100
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507101
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507102
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 我的雙手？為什麼呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507103
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507104
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 要知道，指甲裡有汙垢並不能證明什麼——不是嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507105
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 要知道，沒有修剪指甲並不能證明什麼——不是嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507106
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507107
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507108
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 歸根到底，你究竟想在我的眼裡看到什麼——紅腫、血絲？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507109
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 歸根到底，你究竟想在我的眼裡看到什麼——自己這幅凶神惡煞的表情？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507110
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507111
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 看到了嗎？沒有任何紅腫、血絲！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507112
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 難不成，你還能發現什麼不對勁的地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507113
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507114
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507115
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 蛤——腋窩？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507116
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507117
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 難道，你想說——由於我很討厭出汗之後那種黏糊糊的感覺，因此我是個偽人？好啊，快點把我關起來吧。我都不知道，現在……出汗竟然也是一項死罪了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507118
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507119
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507120
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 該不會，你還要我給你笑一個吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507121
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 沒事。相信，肯定可以證明一些什麼的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507122
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507123
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507124
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507125
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 天啊。不管電視裡說什麼，你都不假思索、照單全收，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507126
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 萬一他們說——偽人長著茂密的陰毛，該怎麼辦？難不成，你還是會讓大家都脫下褲子、接受這種違反憲法的檢查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507127
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507128
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 好吧。就是想玩醫生遊戲，是吧？如何——你打算開一個什麼方子呢，聰明鬼大夫？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507129
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507130
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507131
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不出所料。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507132
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 好啊，儘管扣下扳機吧！你早就把所有的法律都違反了一邊——索性，把「刷牙謀殺」也新增到這一清單裡面好了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507133
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507134
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507135
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 太可笑了。只不過是指甲縫裡稍微沾了一點點泥巴而已，我就成了個壞人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507136
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 我早就已經把所有的法律、法規都背得滾瓜爛熟了。你說說看——我到底違反了哪一條？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507137
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507138
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507139
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 真假？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507140
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507141
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507142
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 我只不過是在你按下快門的時候稍微抖了一下罷了。要是真有什麼問題的話，也該出在你的身上、與我沒有任何關係。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507143
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 哎呀……真是太棒了！你現在……讓我組織一下語言——竟然能從照片之中「讀取他人的靈光」了，是這樣嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507144
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 乾脆直接透過拋硬幣來決定下一個遭殃的是誰得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507145
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507146
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507147
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 憲法裡面根本就沒有任何一條規定禁止公民剃掉自己的腋毛！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507148
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 而且……要是這樣的話，是不是意味著——這些所謂的偽人不僅住在地下，甚至還隨身帶著剃刀、一天到晚都在打理自己？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507149
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507150
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 真是棒極了……即使沒有任何的邏輯可言！寧可信其有，不可信其無——是這個意思嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507151
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507152
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507153
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不要每當看到某些與電視裡說的特徵對不上號的東西時，就掏出槍來指著別人的鼻子——好嗎？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507154
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 還是說，你覺得的子彈是去除耳垢的靈藥？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507155
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507156
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507157
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 哎呀，真是難得——看來，你好歹還是保留著最後一絲的理智！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507158
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 既然這麼心急火燎地想要把住客給幹掉的話……又為何要讓他們——也就是我們，給住進來？你根本就不尊重租賃法！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507159
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 拜託，別總是因為發現了小小的不符之處、就掏出槍來指著別人的鼻子，好嗎？！而且，哪怕是顯著的不同，也不應該這樣！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507160
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你的腦袋沒問題吧？先是拿槍指著我，然後又收了起來、當作無事發生！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507161
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 趕緊停止這齣鬧劇吧！根本就沒有所謂的偽人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507162
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 照這樣下去，我遲早被你嚇出一頭白髮！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507163
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 怎麼，難道……為了逼迫我不再剃掉自己的腋毛，你甚至不惜拿出槍來威脅我？我很好奇——稍微長點毛，真的能阻止你犯下大規模屠殺這種重罪嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507164
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 真是令人口瞪目呆……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507165
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不要指望因為你把槍給收起來了、沒有打爆我的腦袋，我就會對你感恩戴德。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507166
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你到底有什麼毛病？耳垢除了表明耳朵的新陳代謝沒出問題、非常健康之外，還能證明什麼？真的是，整個世界都瘋了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507167
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 等等——你該不會……真的想要扣下扳機吧？這、這可是一項重罪！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507168
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 住手！這、這違法了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507169
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不要！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507170
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 好的——有何不可呢？反正，我也早就習慣別人對我側目了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507171
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507172
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507173
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507174
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507175
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507176
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507177
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 好吧，沒問題——就先給你看看我的牙齒，再說故事好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507178
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507179
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 怎麼？竟然露出了這種表情。沒錯，我從來都沒刷過牙。之前不會——之後？也不會。我的牙齒，我做主。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507180
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 畢竟——毫無意義，不是嗎？反正，不管怎樣大家都會躲著我。既然如此，我還不如把多出來的水給喝下肚子、而不是浪費在刷牙這件事情上面。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507181
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507182
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507183
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 雙手——掌心、指頭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507184
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507185
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 指甲……不太乾淨。畢竟，很快就會弄髒。也就沒有必要洗了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507186
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 指甲……不太乾淨。沒錯……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507187
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 說來也是有趣。雖說髒得不行，然而——這雙手卻摸到過很多好東西、經手過無數財寶……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507188
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 雖然現在都已經不在身邊了，不過……也無所謂了。起碼，我成功地活了下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507189
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507190
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507191
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 只不過是一雙平平無奇的眼睛罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507192
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507193
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 沒什麼特別的。喏——自己看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507194
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507195
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507196
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我——蛤？該死……不擅長與他人來往的，到底是誰……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507197
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507198
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 沒錯——癢得不行。不過，鑒於現在的這種狀況……又能怎麼辦呢，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507199
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507200
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507201
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 拜託。真的有必要嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507202
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 好吧、好吧。這裡是你的房子，自然由你說了算……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507203
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507204
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 難道，你真的認為——憑藉這台機器，能看破我的內心？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507205
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507206
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507207
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 不像流浪動物那樣被撕咬、啃食得破破爛爛，就是一隻再普通不過的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507208
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507209
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 滿意了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507210
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507211
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507212
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 怎麼，現在……嘴裡有幾顆蛀牙，就要被判死刑了？行啊，你就儘管開槍好了。真沒想到——如今的這個世界，竟然變成這樣了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507213
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507214
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507215
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 真是諷刺——我只不過是拿了早已毫無用處的東西罷了，卻要因此被一槍打死。哈哈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507216
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507217
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507218
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 你……究竟是對哪裡感到不滿？也許，我們可以好好談談？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507219
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507220
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507221
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 聽著——即便找到了什麼藥膏，我也會拿去賣了、而不是用在自己的身上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507222
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507223
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507224
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 要是單憑一張照片，就能讓你看清我是什麼人的話……行啊，還等什麼呢？動手吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507225
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 起碼，這樣一來——我就不用再過現在的這種生活了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507226
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507227
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507228
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 怎麼，現在變成嫌棄我的耳朵了——是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507229
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507230
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507231
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 之前，我曾經有過一個夥伴。只因為不小心搞丟了一顆牙齒裡面的填補物，就整天愁眉苦臉的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507232
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 結果，後來……整顆腦袋都被人給砍了下來。我敢說——當時，他應該再也不在意這件事情了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507233
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我曾經找到過這樣的一棟房子——看著空空如也，似乎沒人住了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507234
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 當時……剛在架子上拿了一個應該還挺值錢的老舊懷錶，就聽到樓上傳來了一些動靜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507235
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 把我給嚇了個半死。也不管到底是不是真的有人在，就腳底抹油、立即溜了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507236
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我在乎的……是那塊懷錶。不知，是不是還留在那裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507237
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 這就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507238
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 嗯……這倒是令我想起了一件事情。我曾經找到過一副眼鏡——兒童用的，非常迷你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507239
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 撿起來之後，發現鏡片上面還沾著模模糊糊的指紋。我不禁開始想像，這個孩子當初透過這副小小的眼鏡看著大千世界的模樣……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507240
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 現在？他要嘛就是因為失去了這副眼鏡、陷於困境，不斷掙扎……要嘛就是——根本就已經什麼都看不見了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507241
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 沒錯。的確會一連好幾天都癢得不行、像是燒起來了一樣，不過——我能忍受。又不是第一次了，而且……也不會是最後一次。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507242
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我都已經遭這麼久的罪了，因此也不介意繼續忍下去……有何不可呢，對吧？而錢，總能派上用場——正所謂，錢多不壓身嘛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507243
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我曾經找到過一張家族合照——一對夫妻，兩個孩子。笑得可燦爛了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507244
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 不禁令我好奇——他們之中，有人活下來了嗎？又或者說，這張照片……就是僅剩的東西了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507245
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 一個人的時候，總會聽到一些聲音——細碎的耳語。結果，卻誰都不在。然而，你還是得豎起耳朵、仔細聽著……萬一，真的有其他人呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507246
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我就不該踏進這棟房子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507247
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我就不該跟你這個混蛋搭話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507248
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 嘖……好吧，想怎麼檢查都可以。我沒什麼可隱瞞的。畢竟，裡裡外外、早就已經破爛不堪了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507249
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507250
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507251
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507252
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507253
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507254
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507255
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 要是挖得太深的話……最終，找到的並不一定只是骨頭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507256
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507257
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 這幾顆整齊、潔白的牙齒，是我堂堂正正地掙來的。這幾顆閃閃發亮的牙齒……這麼說吧——是我找到的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507258
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 不然，放著也是浪費。看看，現在這樣反而是派上用場了——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507259
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507260
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507261
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 這雙手養活了我、救活了我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507262
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507263
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 指頭就像老樹盤根一樣，粗糙、扭曲。指甲烏黑、甚至有點發亮，從來都沒洗過。嵌在縫裡的汙泥，就如同這些年的回憶一般、揮之不去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507264
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507265
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507266
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 每當夜幕降臨，就是我開始工作的時候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507267
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507268
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 白天做事的傢伙，抬頭就能看到太陽。而我，只能與一旁的路燈、以及墓穴裡面的陰影為伴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507269
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 自那次之後，我總會下意識地警戒四周。雙眼來回瞟著，提防著會不會有偽人悄悄靠近。這樣的日子實在太過、太過的煎熬。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507270
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 白天做事的傢伙，抬頭就能看到太陽。而我，只能與一旁的路燈、以及墓穴裡面的陰影為伴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507271
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 也許，這樣反而是最好的——之前沒見過太陽，之後也永遠不會……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507272
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507273
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507274
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 呃，你……還真是了不得。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507275
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507276
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 總是會癢——就好像有泥巴在我的皮膚下面爬動一樣。唉，每天都要揮舞鏟子、把死者裝進麻袋、將棺材釘上板子……哪裡有什麼時間去剃毛呀。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507277
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507278
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507279
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 照片……是個非常危險的東西，就跟鏡子一樣——會將你看到的畫面永遠地保留下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507280
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507281
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 哈……嗯，真是有趣。看起來就像是附著了陰影一樣……大概，是鏡頭髒了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507282
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507283
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507284
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507285
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 就是一雙隨處可見的耳朵而已。沒什麼特別的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507286
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507287
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 再普通不過了，對吧？既沒有被燒傷、又沒有要脫落，也還能聽見聲音……唉，為何……還能聽見聲音？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507288
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507289
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507290
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 好吧。要是想開槍的話，就隨你好了。只是……不要拿走這幾顆金牙，好嗎？說不定，就算化作了幽靈、我還是會對它們念念不忘，甚至回來把它們取走……嘿嘿！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507291
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507292
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507293
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 看來，也該輪到我了……這雙手觸碰過了太多的死者——現在，該成為他們的一員了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507294
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507295
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507296
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 或許，再也看不到了……反而是最好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507297
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507298
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507299
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 要是我的腋窩就已經把你給嚇住了的話，那……你還是別去窺探我的內心世界為好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507300
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507301
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507302
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 你……你在這張照片裡看到什麼東西了嗎？什麼——我背後的這個東西？只不過是煙霧罷了，對吧？拜託……告訴我那就是煙霧而已，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507303
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 不然，會是什麼？不知道從哪裡來的灰燼？幽靈？又或者說，也許就是一袋掛在鉤子上肉而已——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507304
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507305
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507306
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 你知道嗎？大地……會與我們交談。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507307
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 來，扣下扳機吧——也許，這樣一來我就再也不用聽到它的低語了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507308
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507309
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507310
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我本來覺得，從屍體身上拿取物品是一種罪過。然而……看到他們就這樣躺在土中、張開著嘴，裡面還金光閃閃……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507311
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 又有誰經得住呢？反正，死者根本就不會在乎。而生者，則非常需要這些東西。不過，也許……他們會對此懷恨在心就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507312
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 一般來說，我都會用鏟子來挖掘墓穴。然而，天氣變冷、地面結冰的時候，就只能徒手上陣了。即便指甲斷裂、指頭流血，也還是得繼續挖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507313
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 因為……我根本就不想停下來，也無法停下來。一旦停住，就會聽到大地的低語。然後，就永遠也忘不了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507314
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有時，剛剛把一個墓穴給填上……當晚，卻能聽到土裡傳來一些輕微的摩擦聲。四處張望——卻什麼也沒有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507315
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 眼睛火辣辣地疼……並不是因為睡不著的緣故，而是出於一股迫使我隨時保持警惕的恐懼。因為，我遲早還會再次遇到那個偽人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507316
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有時，剛剛把一個墓穴給填上……當晚，卻能聽到土裡傳來一些輕微的摩擦聲。四處張望——卻什麼也沒有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507317
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 眼睛火辣辣地疼……並不是因為睡不著的緣故，而是出於看到了某些東西——某些不該看到的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507318
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我還記得……某個夏天，我拖著一口棺材、頂著烈日工作。汗水不停地往下流，渾身都癢得不行。有個同事還開玩笑說——「感覺我們是要把自己給埋了。」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507319
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我想，也許……還真是這樣。我把自己一點、一點地埋進了地下，與死者為伴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507320
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有時，我總會想……也許——他還在那裡。就在我之前挖的那個坑洞裡。就是……就是他該在的地方。我記得很清楚，明明是自己親手埋葬的他……唉，罷了、罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507321
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 照片就像是在兩個世界之間閃耀的一道光，會顯現出那些尚未離去的人——那些不該離去的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507322
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 從前，總有人說——照片會偷走人的靈魂。現在，我倒覺得……也許，它們只會偷走比較溫暖的那一部分。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507323
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我既遲鈍、又麻木，渾身僵硬。現實中如此，照片中——依舊如此……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507324
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有時，我會躺在地上、耳貼地面。從那時起……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507325
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我總是能聽到——好像有人在呼喚自己的聲音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507326
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 也許，是我頭腦混亂、產生了幻覺。又或者說……你仔細想一想。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507327
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 偽人說不定就藏在下面，正一個接著一個地、陸續爬出來……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507328
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 好吧……就來看看，死後會有什麼東西在等待著我們好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507329
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507330
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 好吧，隨你的便……只是，別拖拖拉拉的——對我來說，時間就是金錢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507331
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507332
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507333
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507334
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507335
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507336
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507337
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 看來，你還挺盡責。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507338
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507339
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 好吧……聽著，我也曾經風光過。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507340
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 之前，曾經有過這樣的一件案子……我們抓到了一個倒楣蛋——指揮官只是看了看他的嘴巴，就認定他是個偽人。接著……就直接掏出槍來，把對方給打死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507341
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 於是，我就心想……看來，最好還是不要把自己的牙齒清理得太過仔細、太過乾淨。主要是為了避免引起不必要的懷疑。你應該能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507342
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507343
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507344
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 你想讓我脫掉這對手套？絕無可能——一點都不安全。就這樣檢查吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507345
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507346
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507347
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507348
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507349
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 哎呀……我特別喜歡這項檢查。畢竟，人類的雙眼非常、非常的美麗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507350
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507351
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 滿是血絲，對嗎？要知道，我之前一直戴著面具……因此，多多少少會造成一點影響。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507352
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 視力會下降。還有——視野會變窄。就好像隨時都在透過眼孔看東西一樣……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507353
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507354
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507355
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 你真的要看？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507356
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507357
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 噁心，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507358
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 沒有辦法——穿著這件制服出汗，就會變成這個樣子。皮膚變得乾燥、裂開，甚至還會潰爛。不過，也沒什麼……這還不算是我經歷過最糟糕的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507359
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507360
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507361
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我得事先聲明——照片拍出來之後，看起來可能會……不太尋常。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507362
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507363
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 據說，要是長時間與偽人打交道的話……靈光就會變得非常、非常的奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507364
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507365
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507366
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 開什麼玩笑？我們從來都沒有接受過這項訓練。雖然並不清楚其他小隊是什麼情況，不過——我們從來都沒有檢查過別人的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507367
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507368
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 一雙普普通通、四處可見的耳朵，對吧？你在浪費自己的時間。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507369
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507370
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507371
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 不是，等等——你這是什麼意思？我很確定自己的牙齒沒有任何問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507372
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507373
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507374
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 難道，你是鐵了心的想讓我脫掉這對手套？即便這樣，我也需要一點時間進行準備……沒有辦法馬上滿足你的要求。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507375
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507376
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507377
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 這雙眼睛已經看過太多、太多的東西了。或許……也是時候就此閉上了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507378
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507379
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507380
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我能理解。這幅……光景，可能會把你給嚇到。不過，先聽我說……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507381
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507382
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507383
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 唉，我早就已經警告過你了。不如……先給自己拍一張照片、看看你的靈光如何，再考慮一下要不要拿槍指著我——好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507384
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507385
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507386
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 你也知道，自己正在檢查錯誤的地方——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507387
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507388
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507389
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我永遠都忘不了當時的情景。我們甚至沒有仔細地去檢查，結果……嘭的一聲，一條人命就這樣沒了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507390
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 也許，那個傢伙根本就不是偽人。現在，為了以防萬一……我已經不怎麼打理自己的牙齒了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507391
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 每天都穿著這件制服。不光熱得難受、汗水不斷滴落，雙手甚至還散發出了腐爛的味道……而且，還不能脫掉。現在，已經習慣成自然了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507392
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 以致於——一旦脫掉手套，雙手就……感覺不屬於自己了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507393
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 起初，只是在做自己的工作。然後，突然之間……你發現自己已經再也看不清別人的模樣了，只剩一個又一個的輪廓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507394
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 接著是濃煙，再來是餘燼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507395
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 最後……就只剩下一片虛無。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507396
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 有時，你埋頭苦幹、相信上頭的傢伙會關心自己，會掛念你的安全。結果——最後，你發現……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507397
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 根本就沒人在乎。想要過上舒適的生活，就得自己去爭取、為之奮鬥。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507398
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 否則，就得選擇和痛苦為伴……與之共存，直至變得習以為常。然後，一直保持這個狀態活下去、直到生命的盡頭……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507399
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我很好奇……你為什麼會花費這麼大的工夫去做這些事情——不僅讓人進來，還消耗自己僅剩的精力去檢查他們？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507400
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 萬一你對某人產生了感情，而對方恰好是個偽人……該怎麼辦？要殺掉自己在乎的人……實在是太過的痛苦了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507401
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 不能盲信一切。要學會批判思考、辨別真偽。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507402
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 特別是電視裡說的東西。畢竟，它可是那群傢伙的喉舌……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507403
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 不過，話說回來……我們又能相信誰呢？這個世界——為何如此複雜？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507404
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 要是有誰能把這一切的一切都變得簡單的話，恐怕……會被大眾奉為神明也說不定。哈哈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507405
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 等等——你、你不能這樣！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507406
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我、我可是FEMA的工作人員！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507407
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好吧……就來看看一夜之間會有什麼變化好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507408
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507409
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507410
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507411
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507412
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507413
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507414
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好的，稍等一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507415
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 由於實在太睏，我經常會忘掉一些事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507416
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507417
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 對於一些小事，我想……就是得要輕鬆一點去面對。這樣一來，所有的一切都會變得稍微正常一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507418
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 由於實在太睏，我經常會忘掉一些事情。不過——我還是有在打理自己的牙齒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507420
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 有時，就是得要好好打理好自己。這樣一來，這所有的一切都會變得稍微正常一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507421
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我很好奇——不知，能否透過夢來辨別誰是人類、誰是偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507422
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507423
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507424
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 為了達成目標，我們已經準備好突破任何障礙、克服任何困難了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507425
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 也許，我正一點、一點地爬進自己的夢中？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507426
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507427
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我到底是在跟誰進行鬥爭？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507428
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我得……重新做夢才行，難道——不是嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507429
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507430
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507431
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我記得曾在某處聽說過，失眠會讓眼睛變得暗沉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507432
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不知道是不是真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507433
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507434
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 看來……的確如此，之前要更明亮一些。現在？簡直紅得不行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507435
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 順帶一提，我已經有……這麼說吧，非常長的一段時間沒睡過覺了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507436
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 因此，要是沒有遍佈血絲的話、反而比較奇怪——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507437
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507438
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507439
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不知道為什麼，總感覺有點疼——就好像是過敏了一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507440
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507441
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 如何？狀況……不太好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507442
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507443
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507444
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我很好奇拍出來的照片會長什麼樣子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507445
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507446
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 哎呀，看來——並不普通，好像有……靈光纏繞？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507447
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 然而，怎麼感覺……空蕩蕩的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507448
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你確定這真的管用嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507449
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 歸根到底……所謂的靈光，真的存在嗎？你見到過嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507450
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 夢是真實存在的。起碼，之前確實如此。至於，這個東西……實在是有點……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507451
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507452
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507453
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 蛤？我完全沒聽說過這樣的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507454
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好吧，不妨試試看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507455
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507456
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好啦……得出判決了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507457
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 歸根到底，你知道自己要找什麼東西嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507458
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507459
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507460
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你也知道，我已經很久沒有睡過覺了。現在，根本就分不清這一切究竟是夢境、抑或是現實。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507461
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 這樣就說得通了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507462
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507463
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507464
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 真是有趣。要是大家還會做夢的話，不知……我能不能逃進某人的夢中呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507465
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507466
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507467
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我一直都在尋找一個可以讓我入睡的地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507468
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我感覺自己渾身無力，然而……眼睛卻變得越來越警覺。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507469
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不對，等等——我具備的特徵真的和電視上說的一樣、與偽人無異嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507470
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你為什麼會這麼疑神疑鬼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507471
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 難以理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507472
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507473
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507474
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 真假？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507475
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我的身體因為缺乏睡眠而變得日漸乾枯，你的身體……難道不也是這樣嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507476
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507477
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507478
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 扣下扳機之前，想聽聽我的……請求，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507479
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507480
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507481
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 完了之後，你能把我的這具身體給整個毀掉嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507482
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 這樣的話，即便我醒了、也沒有辦法再回到裡面去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507483
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 血肉將無法束縛住我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507484
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 讓我在來世待上一段時間吧——只要一陣子就好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507485
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 即便沒了肉體，我也能撐下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507486
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507487
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507488
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 非要說的話……偽人的牙齒應該是髒兮兮的，這樣反而要更加合理——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507489
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 譬如……他們是從地下爬出來的，對吧？破土而出的時候，應該會不小心吞下一點泥巴——這樣推測比較自然。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507490
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 為何你會認為我的指甲很髒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507491
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我只不過是想盡己所能、闖進夢中罷了，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507492
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 要是能成功的話，我就不會再傷害自己了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507493
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 因為，這樣一來——痛苦就再也沒有意義了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507494
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不是……你仔細思考一下。如今這個世道，眼睛怎麼可能不會變得暗淡、無光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507495
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 怎麼可能不會因為長時間的緊繃而變得乾澀、疲憊？搞不好都已經呆滯了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507496
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 嗯……我的眼睛怎會沒有紅腫、佈滿血絲呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507497
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 明明都在長時間的緊繃了，怎會沒有乾澀、疲憊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507498
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我甚至已經很久沒有睡過覺了。好像，有點不對勁——不是嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507499
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 大家……難道都不是這樣的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507500
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 要是長時間不睡覺的話，就會開始感到一股寒意……緊接著，又會覺得無比乾燥。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507501
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 隨著時間的流逝，還會發展出某種熱病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507502
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 而且，狀況只會變得越來越嚴重。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507503
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你是在哪裡聽說這項特徵的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507504
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 從電視上？真是奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507505
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我……根本就不知道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507506
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 其他的都好說，唯獨這個……靈光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507507
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 實在是把我給嚇得不輕。沒想到現在竟然有這麼多人有精神錯亂，毫無緣由地糾結於這種所謂的超自然現象。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507508
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 要知道，我們甚至就連自然規律都還沒完全搞懂呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507509
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 真的是非常、非常有意思的報導——介於睡眠與現實之間。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507510
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你確定自己真的看過嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507511
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 也許，只是一場夢而已？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507512
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 雖然……我也能理解就是了。真是一種奇怪的感覺。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507513
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你竟然會出於一些莫名其妙、不知真假的原因而痛下殺手，真是……有趣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507514
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 雖然，非要說的話——更令人感到毛骨悚然就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507515
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 沒有了夢，大家都失去了理智。我會死去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507516
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 抑或沉睡……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507517
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 死亡會以它冰冷的擁抱給予我們溫暖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507518
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507519
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507520
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507521
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507522
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507523
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507524
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507525
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
