      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507636
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507637
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 時候還未到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507638
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 就此打住吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507639
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507640
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507641
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 謝謝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507642
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 據說……只要死亡降臨於世，一切的艱辛、苦難都將徹底終結。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507643
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 我希望是真的……我早就已經不堪重負，是時候該休息一下了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507644
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 據說……迎來死亡之後，一切都將歸於平靜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507645
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 然而，你恐怕無法想像——知道自己不久之後將要死去……這種滋味是多麼的令人恐懼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507646
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 雖然不知為何……我感到有點羞恥，不過——我的腋窩應該一點問題也沒有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507647
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 只是把這兩個字說出口都令我感到有些難堪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507648
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 哎呀，這似乎於一般的照片有所不同。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507649
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 雖然我不太清楚箇中緣由，不過——看起來實在是太美了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507650
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 謝謝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507651
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 既然，能透過各式各樣的方式來辨別偽人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507652
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 那麼，為何直到現在都還沒有把它們給全都抓起來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507653
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 沒有關係……我們會受到它的庇護……我會邁向更好的生活……沒有問題……沒有什麼值得害怕的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507654
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 媽、媽的——我不想死！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507655
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 隨你高興。只是，不要妨礙我們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507656
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507657
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507658
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507659
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507660
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507661
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507662
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 上顎和下顎竟然是不同的形狀，真是有趣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507663
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507664
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507665
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507666
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507667
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 這讓我們看起來……就像是偽人一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507668
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507669
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 這個樣子，應該能夠引來死亡、拯救眾生。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507670
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507671
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507672
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 我的眼睛已經看不太清了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507673
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507674
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 我很有可能會先其他兄弟一步啟程，前往來世。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507675
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507676
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507677
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507678
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507679
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701376
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701377
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701378
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 稍等。先讓我把罩袍給脫下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701379
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701380
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701381
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701382
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701383
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701384
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701385
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701386
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701387
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701388
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 還請不要出手阻撓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701389
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701390
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701391
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 你現在十分混亂——還是把槍放下吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701392
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701393
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701394
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 還請不要干預其中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701395
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701396
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701397
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701398
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701399
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701400
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 你覺得……我應該要提前離場，而非等待既定的命運降臨？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701401
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701402
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701403
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701404
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701405
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701406
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 能看的都已經給你看過。現在，我得去進行準備了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701407
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 就讓我們完成自己的工作吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701408
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701409
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701410
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 拍照？根本沒有任何意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701411
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 畢竟——重要的事情，早就已經深深地烙印在了我們的腦海之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701412
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701413
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 絕非明智之舉——勸你就此打住。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701414
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 否則，他們會把你的肉體給毀掉、你也將因此無法覲見死亡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701415
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 此時、此刻，站在你面前的……有可能並非人類——你有感到過這種恐懼嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701416
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701417
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701418
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701419
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701420
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701421
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701422
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 如何，還喜歡嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701423
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701424
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 為何露出這種表情？難道，你曾經見到過跟這一樣的牙齒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701425
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 該不會……我令你想起什麼人了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701426
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701427
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701428
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 據說，沒有什麼要比與心愛之人十指相扣的那一刻更加美妙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701429
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 感受彼此的脈搏……不斷跳動。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701430
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701431
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 好了……手心出汗——這又意味著什麼呢？你緊張了？又或者說，你被某種情緒感染了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701432
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 難不成，是無處可洩的憤怒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701433
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701434
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701435
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 眼睛會出賣一個人的真實想法。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701436
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701437
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 猜猜看吧——此時、此刻，我的心裡到底在想著些什麼呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701438
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701439
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701440
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 好的，我並不會拒絕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701441
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我們的身體……會回報關懷，也會記住溫情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701442
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我很高興——你我都清楚這一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701443
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701444
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701445
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 抱歉，只是……拍照會令我感到疲憊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701446
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 盡量速戰速決，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701447
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701448
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你打算怎麼處理這張照片呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701449
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701450
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701451
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 難道……這是你的性癖？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701452
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 沒事，我並不介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701453
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701454
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不過——為何偏偏對耳朵情有獨鍾呢？或許，我們可以對此進行一下深究……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701455
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701456
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701457
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 難道，你在我的身上……看到了曾經傷害過你的那個人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701458
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 要是這樣的話，為何拿我——一個剛認識不久的人出氣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701459
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701460
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701461
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 看來，的確是憤怒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701462
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 說說看吧——你在我的身上看到了誰的影子？你究竟要對什麼人尋求報復？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701463
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701464
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701465
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 令我感到害怕的是，你的眼裡沒有一絲、一毫的遲疑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701466
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你執著於某種特別……死板的行為模式。然而，作為人類——我們會心懷疑問、我們會猶豫不決、我們會尋求解答。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701467
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你執著於某種特別……死板的行為模式。這是——你自己設定的規矩嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701468
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701469
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701470
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 難道，你害怕美麗的事物？因為……它們難以捉摸？或者，是出於別的理由？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701471
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 難道，你認為長得美的人都很危險？然而，我又能對你造成什麼傷害呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701472
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701473
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701474
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我……在你身上感到了一股由於施虐而帶來的快感。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701475
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 譬如——竟然會給將要死於自己手下的人拍照，實在是太浪漫了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701476
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我很好奇。我……應該已經不是你的「第一次」了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701477
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701478
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701479
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 抱歉……我沒聽清。怎麼了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701480
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701481
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701482
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 最好還是放下那些曾給你帶來傷痛的回憶吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701483
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 每當看到些、想到些什麼，都會令自己感到撕心、裂肺——完全沒有半點意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701484
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 照著我說的去做吧。雖然不會立即見效，不過……隨著時間的流逝，你會感到輕鬆一些。真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701485
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我知道——你想保護自己，堅守你的界限。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701486
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 只是，希望你也能對我表現出同等的尊重。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701487
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不要把你的過去投射到我的身上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701488
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 說來也是有趣……如今，大家都不敢直視彼此的雙眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701489
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 一些人會移開自己的視線，一些人光顧著去尋求解答……一些人只在乎找出對方是否具備偽人的特徵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701490
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 一些人會移開自己的視線……一些人只在乎找出對方是否具備偽人的特徵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701491
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 而你……目光非常堅定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701492
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 真是有趣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701493
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我很清楚……你很害怕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701494
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 一想到自己有可能會導致他人死亡，就不由得顫抖了起來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701495
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不過，你猜怎麼樣？被人拿槍指著，因此感到受傷——這也是人之常情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701496
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我認為你具備一項非常獨到的……怎麼說呢，特質？不知，還有沒有更好的詞可以形容……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701497
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 比起本人，你更喜歡與對方一起共度的回憶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701498
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我敢打賭，你肯定保存著大量的照片。然而，你卻會習慣性地與他人保持距離。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701499
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 嗯……罷了，還是忘掉吧。抱歉，希望你不要介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701500
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 的確。如今這個世道，難以分辨到底哪句是真話、哪句是假話。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701501
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不過……還是得靠自己去判斷真偽。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701502
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你太過害怕改變，甚至不惜將所有人都拒於千里之外。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701503
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不管是陌生人，還是你的家人、愛人——無一例外。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701504
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……你到底會變成什麼樣子呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313600
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313601
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313602
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313603
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313604
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313605
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313606
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313607
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090816
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090817
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090818
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090819
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090820
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的……別把槍揮來揮去，行嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090821
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 一切都是胡說八道！好吧……要是你已經失去了理智的話，就儘管扣下扳機好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090822
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090823
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090824
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 去你的吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090825
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我就猜猜看好了……我的指甲裡面並沒有汙垢，莫非——是我的身高令你感到了恐懼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090826
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你是自卑，還是怎樣？非要把其他人也拉到跟自己一樣的層次，是這個意思嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090827
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的，簡直不可理喻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090828
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090829
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090830
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你到底是看出什麼東西來了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090831
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我的牙齒沒有任何問題，我的雙手也是。現在，你開始嫌棄起我的眼睛了——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090832
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的……要是討厭我的話，直說就好、我這就走。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090833
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090834
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090835
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 好了，接下來該怎麼辦？難道，你還要我翹起屁股來給你看不成？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090836
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你真的以為我會一而再、再而三地容忍你的這些愚蠢的行為？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090837
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090838
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090839
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 拜託。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090840
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 難道，你沒有留意到這棟房子最近都發生了些什麼事情嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090841
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你過度糾結於一些毫無意義的枝微末節。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090842
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 然後大開殺戒，就好像……在你看來，人命並沒有什麼大不了的一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090843
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 就此打住，好好地想想自己的所作所為吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090844
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090845
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090846
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的，這些該死的新聞報導……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090847
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 還有這糟糕透頂的現狀……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090848
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 所謂的「照顧好」我們，竟然會是這個樣子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090849
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 真是可悲……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090850
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090851
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090852
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 去你媽的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090853
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不要再咄咄逼人、拿把槍指著我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090854
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 難道，你以為我就喜歡長這麼高？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090855
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 總是會把腦袋撞得七葷八素——坐公車的時候，更是糟糕透頂！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090856
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 雖然……好吧，還是有一些優點就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090857
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我曾經親眼見到有人被貨車給活生生地碾死。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090858
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 重點是，前者根本就沒有加速——你懂我的意思嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090859
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 當時，交通非常擁擠、堵得不行。那個傢伙看都沒看、直接就竄到了它的面前。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090860
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 結果，恰好在司機的視野盲區裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090861
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 於是，貨車一邊慢慢地向前開著，一邊慢慢地……將他碾過、捲進車底。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090862
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 詭異至極。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090863
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 起碼，我並不會做出像那個傢伙一樣的愚蠢舉動。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090864
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 該死……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090865
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你去過酒吧嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090866
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 早在這些所謂的偽人出現之前，裡面就有著一大群符合這種「特徵」的傢伙——佈滿血絲的眼睛、髒得不行的雙手，甚至同時還有著一口完美無瑕的牙齒！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090867
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 而且，你猜怎麼樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090868
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 其中的一些，後來死掉了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090869
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不過，這都無關緊要。重點是——要是當時，你敢玩這種把戲的話……你早就被打得屁滾尿流了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090870
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090871
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 歸根到底，我根本就不明白你為什麼能若無其事地拿槍指著別人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090872
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的……簡直就是瘋了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090873
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你怕是瘋了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090874
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 滾開，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090875
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090876
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 謝謝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090877
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不然，你想我說什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090878
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 環顧四周，要嘛是些哭哭啼啼的傢伙、要嘛是些徹頭徹尾的瘋子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090879
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 面對這糟糕透頂的狀況，根本就沒人能保持清醒……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090880
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090881
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 媽的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285120
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285121
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285122
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我投降！我投降！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285123
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 你贏了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285124
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 說實話，我根本就不知道這究竟是個什麼遊戲！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285125
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285126
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285127
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 對了，爸爸曾經跟我講過一個類似的遊戲！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285128
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 就是……把大家分成兩隊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285129
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 其中的一隊去把某件東西給藏起來，當作寶物。而且，還得在地上畫出監牢、用來囚禁對方的成員。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285130
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 剩下的一隊得一遍逃跑、一邊把寶物給找出來，而且絕對不能被抓住！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285131
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 還有——雙方都會配備武器！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285132
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不過……爸爸說拿的是棍棒就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285133
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 對啦——我想起來了，是叫「警察抓小偷」！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285134
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 你小時候是不是也玩過這個遊戲？你現在是不是想要跟我一起回味？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285135
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 哎呀……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285136
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不過，我還沒有藏東西呢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285137
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285138
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 而且，我也沒有能稱得上是寶物的東西……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285139
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285140
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285141
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285142
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我討厭這個遊戲……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285143
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不要再這樣子嚇我啦……來玩點其他的吧，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285144
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 拜託——我都已經給你看過自己的指甲了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285145
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285146
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285147
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我很喜歡媽媽的指甲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285148
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 雖說，我已經記不起它們長什麼樣子了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285149
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 只知道非常、非常漂亮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285150
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 而且，她還有一條非常、非常好看的裙子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285151
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 就跟我的這件一樣！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285152
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸說我跟媽媽簡直就是一個模子刻出來的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285153
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285154
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 沒事，我不會哭。我已經長大了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285155
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285156
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285157
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285158
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不——要！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285159
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我——不——想——死！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285160
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285161
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285162
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285163
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 某次，我去了一個非常、非常遠的遊樂場！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285164
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 裡面有個特別、特別大的滑梯！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285165
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我從來都沒看過像這樣的滑梯！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285166
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不過，我一點也不怕！因為，實在太好玩了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285167
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我爬上去、滑下來，爬上去、滑下來——結果渴得不行，甚至能喝下一片湖泊……不對，甚至能喝下整片大海！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285168
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 結果……爸爸走丟了，不知道跑到什麼地方去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285169
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我感到非常害怕……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285170
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我根本就不知道該怎樣回家……因為，我們實在走得太遠、太遠了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285171
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 還好，爸爸回來了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285172
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我很希望……現在他也能像當時一樣，回到我的身邊來。或許，他只是又走丟了而已——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285173
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285174
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285175
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 對啦，我曾經看過這樣的一部卡通！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285176
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 裡面有一隻拿著槍的狗狗——扣下扳機的時候，射出來的是一幅幅的圖畫！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285177
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 你的這把是不是也一樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285178
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479424
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479425
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……看來不是。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479426
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 對啦，我又記起了一件事情！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479427
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 某次，我和爸爸去逛市場。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479428
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 一個留著長髮、披著大衣的傢伙……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479429
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 突然拿槍指著我們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479430
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 起初，爸爸非常害怕……然後，不知怎地——他們最後卻抱在了一起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479431
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479432
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 又或者說，我只是夢到了這樣的場景而已？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479433
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我……不記得了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479434
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479435
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479436
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 哎呀……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479437
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我也能看看你的耳朵嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479438
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 又或者說，你只是在對我使壞而已？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479439
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 有時，你還挺像我最好、最棒的朋友……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479440
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479441
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479442
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 一起玩耍的時候……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479443
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 前一刻還特別開心，下一刻卻突然使壞！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479444
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不過，我心裡清楚——她是一個非常、非常好的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479445
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 她並不喜歡待在家裡，她的媽媽管教很嚴苛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479446
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不准她做這些、不准她做哪些。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479447
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 也許，她的媽媽是個偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479448
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 雖然爸爸偶爾也會比較嚴厲，不過——也不是每時每刻都這樣！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479449
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 等爸爸來了之後，就去看看她好了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479450
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479451
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 媽媽……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062336
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062337
    m_Localized: 我得檢查一下自己
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062338
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062339
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062340
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062341
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450944
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450945
    m_Localized: 洗漱
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450946
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450947
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450948
    m_Localized: 該死，白得不行……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450949
    m_Localized: 會被瘋子抓住把柄、拖出去殺死的
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450950
    m_Localized: 黃得不行……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450951
    m_Localized: 也好——這樣就不會被誤認為偽人了
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450952
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450953
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450954
    m_Localized: 髒得不行……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450955
    m_Localized: 該死，最近一直都在挖洞
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450956
    m_Localized: 非常乾淨……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450957
    m_Localized: 殘留了一點粉末，不是什麼大問題
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450958
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450959
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450960
    m_Localized: 媽的，佈滿血絲……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450961
    m_Localized: 早知道就不去喝含有咖啡鹼的東西了
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450962
    m_Localized: 看著沒有問題
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450963
    m_Localized: 沒有血絲——沒有能被他人抓住的把柄
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450964
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450965
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450966
    m_Localized: 長滿了毛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450967
    m_Localized: 理所當然
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450968
    m_Localized: 媽的——這是什麼東西？！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450969
    m_Localized: 好像是疹子……不對，更像是真菌
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450970
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450971
    m_Localized: 該好好打理一下了，應該能有所幫助吧
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450972
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450973
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450974
    m_Localized: 看著沒有問題
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450975
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450976
    m_Localized: 報導裡是怎麼說的來著？
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450977
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577463595008
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 我……偶爾會非常用力地咬緊牙關，甚至能聽到下顎在咯咯地作響。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577476177920
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 這該死的毛病快要把我給逼瘋了……每當我反應過來的時候，都已經太晚了——每次都是這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343744
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 我的姊妹……為什麼會這樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343745
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343746
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 現在，一切均已失去意義……就連嘗試也是枉費心機……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343747
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 開槍吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577505538048
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 死亡帶走了我的姊妹……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577505538049
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 沒有了她，我……我該怎麼活下去？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577505538050
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 來吧，我已經準備好了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315264
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我就知道你會這麼說。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315265
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315266
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315267
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315268
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315269
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315270
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315271
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 來吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315272
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315273
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 還好在過去的幾週裡，一直都沒有什麼機會好好地洗漱一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315274
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 運氣不錯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315275
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315276
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315277
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 雙手——真假？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315278
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315279
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 抱歉，最近一直都在挖些髒得不行的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315280
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315281
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315282
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我已經連續好幾天沒閤過眼了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315283
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315284
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 女兒不見了，怎麼睡得著。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315285
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315286
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315287
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 要不，還是檢查一下其他的地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315288
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315289
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315290
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315291
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315292
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 千萬、千萬不要讓FEMA的傢伙看到拍出來的照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315293
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315294
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 你有聽說過吸血鬼的故事嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315295
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 據說，它們不會出現於照片中、只在晚上出去覓食，而且……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315296
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 它們是不朽之物。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315297
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315298
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315299
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 你不覺得這些檢查實在是有些荒唐嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315300
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315301
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 熱知識——耳朵裡有汙垢？再正常不過了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315302
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315303
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315304
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 沒有比這還要細的牙籤了，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315305
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 想要開槍？隨你的便。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315306
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 只是……我還以為你是個會認真聽別人說話的傢伙呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315307
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315308
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315309
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 小心一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315310
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 雖說我是不朽之人，不過……一旦扣下扳機——'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315311
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我就再也無法與你交談了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315312
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315313
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315314
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 如果你認為我是偽人，只能說——大錯特錯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315315
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我是不朽之人，你殺不死我的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315316
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315317
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315318
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 你瘋了不成？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315319
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 一旦扣下扳機，你就再也無法得知偽人的秘密了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315320
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315321
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315322
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 希望裡面裝的是純銀。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315323
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 否則，只會浪費子彈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315324
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 還有我的耐心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315325
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315326
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315327
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 來吧。要是你對官方的那套說辭深信不疑的話，就儘管扣下扳機好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315328
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 只是，我會記住你的所作所為。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315329
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 聽好——我一定會回來，把你的脖子給扭斷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315330
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315331
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315332
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 要是我的牙齒真的令你感到如此煩惱的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315333
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我會找時間好好地清理一下的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315334
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 拿手指來代替牙刷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315335
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我也清楚，看起來並不怎麼賞心悅目。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315336
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 畢竟，一整天都在這裡挖來、挖去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315337
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 無論是誰，都不可避免地會把自己的雙手給弄髒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315338
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 不要盲信電視裡報導出來的東西，關掉它吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315339
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 如今這個世道，能不把雙手給弄髒反而是個奇蹟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315340
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 要不是已經好幾天都沒怎麼睡過覺的話，我一定會好好地直視你的雙眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315341
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 獨自穿過大半座城市……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315342
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 白天要迴避太陽，晚上得躲著FEMA、以及偽人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315343
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我根本就連閉上眼睛的時間都沒有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315344
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 腋窩，是吧？還真敢說。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315345
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 看來，FEMA已經徹底亂成一團了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315346
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 說不定，他們現在正一邊舔著偽人的卵蛋、一邊尋找著新的特徵呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315347
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 也好——我不介意親自給他們嚐嚐我這對「寶貝」是什麼滋味。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315348
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 千萬不要再拿槍指著我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315349
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 否則……對你而言，情況只會變得更糟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315350
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 如果還是不聽勸告，執意表現出這種沒有一絲、一毫尊重的態度……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315351
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 就不要怪我扭斷你的脖子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315352
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 希望你在面對FEMA的工作人員時也能採取同樣強硬的態度。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315353
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 畢竟，與偽人不同——這些傢伙可沒有絲毫要遮掩的意思……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315354
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 從始至終，他們都是一群混蛋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315355
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 省省為數不多的彈藥吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315356
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我敢保證——比起偽人，對付這些傢伙要更費子彈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315357
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 媽的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315358
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我還以為你是個聰明人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315359
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我早就知道……自己終歸會因某些傢伙的愚蠢行徑而喪命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315360
    m_Localized: 去他的吧……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535907
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535940
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507419
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341556
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你被人當成白癡耍，卻還樂呵樂呵的、一點都不介意——是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535899
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 好的，隨你怎麼檢查都可以。不過……你得知道，一切都不會改變。現在的這個狀況，無法長久。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924201
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 哈哈哈！我可不會像這樣胡說八道！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830346432512
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830346432513
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830400958464
    m_Localized: 清理
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535808
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 好吧。先讓我喝完這罐EnerJeka……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535809
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535810
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535811
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535812
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535813
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535814
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535815
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我有跟你說過嗎？即使沒有在喝，我也一樣能嚐到EnerJeka的味道？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535816
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 感覺這種飲料就像是用某些古怪的化學物質製成的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535817
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不過，誰在乎呢——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535818
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535819
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 完蛋，我的舌頭已經染成其他顏色了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535820
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 完蛋，我的牙齒已經通通都被毀掉了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535821
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535822
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535823
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 好的，雙手是吧……來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535824
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我總是會感到有點癢，就像有螞蟻在爬一樣……哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535825
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我最近沒有在亂抓什麼東西，因此——應該不會有什麼問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535826
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535827
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 嗯……不知怎地，看起來有點扭曲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535828
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 大概是咖啡鹼攝食過多了吧，一直在抖個不停。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535829
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 只要歇上十分鐘左右，應該就能有所好轉了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535830
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535831
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535832
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我看過相關的報導——它們的眼睛應該是綠色的，偏深、而且渾濁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535833
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 千萬別搞混了。畢竟……如今這個時代，綠色也有很多種類。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535834
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535835
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等等——怎麼了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535836
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 紅色的？它們的眼睛……應該是紅色的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535837
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不是……既然如此，電視上為什麼會說是綠色的？我的眼睛到底是什麼顏色的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535838
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不是……既然如此，電視上為什麼會說是綠色的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535839
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535840
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535841
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 哎呀——唯一一個合乎情理的特徵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535842
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535843
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 沒有變色、沒有髒汙，沒有什麼亂七八糟的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535844
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 再、普、通、不、過、的、腋、窩。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535845
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 讚啦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535846
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535847
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535848
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我只在派對上被人拍過照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535849
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 現在，好像已經沒人會舉辦類似的活動了。不然……就是他們根本就沒想要邀請我。哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535850
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535851
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我的心臟跳得超級快的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535852
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不管再怎麼猛灌EnerJeka，都沒有辦法令它緩和下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535853
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535854
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535855
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 好的，沒有問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535856
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535857
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我是不是該先清理一下會比較好？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535858
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 又或者說，維持原樣就行？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535859
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535860
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535861
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 哇哦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535862
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我還以為你不是那種看到什麼都會扣下扳機的人。現在，到處都是這樣的傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535863
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 說實話……我還以為能在這裡暫時擺脫暴力呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535864
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535865
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535866
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 怎麼冷不防地把槍給掏出來了。而且，偏偏還是在現在這個時候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535867
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你應該沒有想要扣下扳機吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535868
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 除非……手指抽筋是一項新的特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535869
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535870
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535871
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不、不，這樣不對。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535872
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 是你自己提到的紅色。還是說……我的眼睛紅了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535873
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 拜託，到底是怎樣——直接說就好。我已經完全搞不懂了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535874
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535875
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535876
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 拜託——一點都不酷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535877
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535878
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535879
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等等，我的心臟並沒有什麼問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535880
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 只是跳得超級快而已。你明白嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535881
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 稍微給我一點時間……我有些喘不過氣來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535882
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535883
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535884
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 起碼，先告訴我是出於什麼原因吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535885
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535886
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535887
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我可以理解——不外乎是什麼安全、什麼防護，諸如此類的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535888
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 然而……再這樣下去，情況早晚會失控。你有可能只因為某人看起來「不太對勁」，就義無反顧地扣下扳機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535889
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 也許，你也應該離開這棟房子、去尋找自己內心的安寧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535890
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 前往某個遙遠的地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535891
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你知道最嚇人的是什麼嗎？就是連手都抬不起來、沒有辦法擋住槍口的時候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535892
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 沒錯，我也知道這樣做是挺笨的。但……試圖去擋住子彈，不是人之常情嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535893
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等等……也就是說，並不是所有東西都會帶點綠色？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535894
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 那麼……萬物到底是什麼顏色的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535895
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 一切……是從什麼時候開始變成綠色的？我完全沒有察覺到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535896
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 哇哦，我的腦袋現在超暈的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535897
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 要知道，整天把槍給掏出來到處亂揮並不能令人感到安心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535898
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 偽人並不會因為你的威脅而停止殺戮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535899
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 到最後，你自己反而成了最可怕的那個人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535900
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 這樣做……真的值得嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535901
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 恐嚇別人根本沒有任何意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535902
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你——哈啊……你只會令所有人都與你反目成仇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535903
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 天啊。稍等，呃啊……我這該死的心臟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535904
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 總之……不要再拿槍指著……任何人了，好嗎？這樣……根本屁用沒有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535905
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我還是就此離開吧……哈啊……哈啊……不會再嚇到你了，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535906
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 一切……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535907
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 就這樣結束了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535908
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 來搖滾吧。或許，現在還來得及撼動這個世界！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535909
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535910
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535911
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535912
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535913
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535914
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535915
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 唉……我抽太多菸了，整副牙齒都變色了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535916
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 挺滑稽的，對吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535917
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535918
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 回憶與汙漬——同伴留下來給我的東西，就只剩這些了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535919
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535920
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535921
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我有一個刺青。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535922
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535923
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我記得那天晚上超瘋的。刺青師喝得爛醉，而我也不遑多讓——否則，也沒那個膽子敢去找他。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535924
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不對，等等……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535925
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 或許，這並不是什麼刺青。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535926
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我已經想不起來了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535927
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535928
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535929
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我們曾經覺得直接在眼球上刺青是一件非常帥氣的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535930
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 直到現在，我還是偶爾會想起那次瘋狂至極的經歷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535931
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535932
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不、不，不是我的眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535933
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 當時，有個傢伙直接因此而瞎掉了。但——兄弟，你真該看看他的那雙眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535934
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 要是能擁有一雙那樣的眼睛，就好了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535935
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535936
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535937
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 請便。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535938
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535939
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 發現什麼了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535940
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535941
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535942
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 好啊，來合照一張吧。或許，我還會在上面簽名呢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535943
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535944
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 哇哦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535945
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 怎麼說呢……下次，記得先把鏡頭蓋給拿下來——好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535946
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535947
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535948
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我以前有在拉耳垂。後來……就覺得厭倦了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535949
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924416
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 現在，狀況很差。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924417
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不過，還是挺好看的就對了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924418
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924419
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924420
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 真假？唉……罷了。愛怎樣就怎樣吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924421
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924422
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924423
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 已經沒有什麼值得去害怕的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924424
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924425
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924426
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 冷靜一點，老兄——沒有必要拿槍到處亂指。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924427
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924428
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924429
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我不想聞起來臭臭的——光是這個理由，就要向我開槍？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924430
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 真是令人傻眼……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924431
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924432
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924433
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 哎呀……原來，這已經是把鏡頭蓋給拿下來了之後再拍的了？好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924434
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924435
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924436
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 看來，你並不喜歡我的造型。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924437
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924438
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924439
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 也許……那段節奏飽滿、旋律完美的吉他片段，還在某個地方等著我呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924440
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 雖說，我根本就沒有半點頭緒就對了。盤踞在腦海之中的，只有一陣沉悶的嗡鳴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924441
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 說實話……如果你扣下扳機，又能改變什麼呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924442
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 無論如何，我也不可能站上舞台了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924443
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 真的好想在音樂節上嗨翻全場——就在此時、就是此刻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924444
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 太可惜了——你這裡就只有啤酒，沒有更烈的東西了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924445
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我真的很想喝到爛醉如泥。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924446
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我甚至不知道該說些什麼了，老兄。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924447
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……謝謝你願意撥冗檢查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924448
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不過……這張照片看起來為什麼這麼暗淡？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924449
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 即便是我們以前練習的地方，相較之下也要更為明亮一些——況且，你明明開了燈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924450
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 你知道嗎？我從來都沒有想過要在我們的任何一首曲目中加入教堂的鐘聲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924451
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 你知道嗎？我開始覺得……在我們的曲目中加入教堂的鐘聲，或許會挺不錯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924452
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 「我們的曲目」——我竟然下意識地就脫口而出……說得好像還有誰能一起演奏一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924453
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 你知道嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924454
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 也許，這就是我最棒的一場演出。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924455
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 希望他們在上面等我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924456
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 大家一起來嗨翻全場！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924457
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧。想檢查什麼地方，儘管開口就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924458
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924459
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924460
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924461
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924462
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924463
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924464
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我的牙齒？不是黃了，就是全爛掉了吧。總之，有著各種問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924465
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 畢竟，監獄裡可不會發放什麼像是薄荷味的牙膏、牙刷之類的東西。即便牙齦流血，也沒有什麼好大驚小怪的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924466
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924467
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我想，這應該不是什麼特徵——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924468
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924469
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924470
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 沒問題。來，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924471
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924472
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 一切正常，對吧？只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924473
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 長了點東西，僅此而已。放心，只不過是疹子罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924474
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我這雙手……想當年，可是派上過大用場。但——我也因此被關進了監獄裡服刑就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924475
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924476
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924477
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 怎麼——難道，你要看看我的心裡到底有沒有良知？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924478
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924479
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧。來，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924480
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924481
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我本以為戴墨鏡有助於抵擋陽光。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924482
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 結果？反倒變得更糟了。一點用都沒有，真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924483
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 結果？一點用都沒有，真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924484
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924485
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924486
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧，我……會給你看的。只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924487
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924488
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我曾經因為喝醉了酒、到處胡鬧，導致不小心被燒傷了。千萬別被嚇到，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924489
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924490
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好了。如何？我並不是那些怪胎，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924491
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924492
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924493
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 兄弟，你是要把我登記在案還是怎樣？怎麼冷不防地要給我拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924494
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……難道，這也是一項檢查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924495
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924496
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 感覺又回到了當初拍入監照的時候——照片會存進我的檔案裡面，諸如此類的事情再來一遍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924497
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧，愛怎樣就怎樣吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924498
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924499
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 拍完了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924500
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924501
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924502
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 搞什麼鬼？現在，輪到耳朵了是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924503
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你怕是瘋了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924504
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 真的有必要檢查來、檢查去的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924505
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924506
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧。去他媽的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924507
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924508
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 如何——有發現什麼問題嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924509
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924510
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924511
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你確定自己沒有瘋掉？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924512
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我的牙齒明明就黃得不行——為什麼還要把槍給掏出來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924513
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 又或者說，你要以牙齦流血的這件事情將我定罪、把我給一槍打死？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924514
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924515
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924516
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 兄弟，怎麼突然就把槍給掏出來了？快點放下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924517
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924518
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924519
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你覺得我在撒謊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924520
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我不是說過了嗎——戴墨鏡根本抵擋不了陽光。你自己試試看就知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924521
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924522
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924523
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我能理解。畢竟，我的腋窩可以說是糟糕透頂、一塌糊塗……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924524
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 但——有必要搞這麼一齣嗎？我們不是聊得好好的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924525
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924526
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924527
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 兄弟，你該不會是把我跟某個蠢貨搞混了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924528
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我犯過罪、服了刑——前不久剛剛被釋放出來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924529
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924530
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924531
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 兄弟，你是認真的嗎？這也太超過了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924532
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 檢查牙齒是否存在異常、檢查指甲是否藏有汙垢，這些我都能理解。但——耳朵？從來都沒人提到過要檢查耳朵啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924533
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924534
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924535
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 很好。不要總是看到有什麼風吹草動，就急著把槍給掏出來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924536
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 要是手指一癢、不小心扣下了扳機的話，一切就都完了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924537
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我知道你是個不喜歡繞彎子的人，但……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924538
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 不要總因為一些雞毛蒜皮的小事，就拔出槍來指著別人的腦袋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924539
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 那群獄警就算了，我也已經習慣了。但……不要連你也這樣，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924540
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧——這裡是你的地盤，我不會說些什麼。但……不要把自己搞得像個獨裁者一樣，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924541
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你又不是那種從街區裡出來、會把人榨得一乾二淨的黑幫老大，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924542
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 省省你的土豆——也就是彈藥吧，兄弟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924543
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 真的，我不騙你。我以自己的良心起誓！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924544
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 這是我唯一一件沒有靠偷竊得來的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924545
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你瘋了吧，兄弟？只因為一張無聊的照片，你就想要打爆我的腦袋？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924546
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 就是那群該死的獄警，也不至於這樣來整我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924547
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 哎呀，你終於恢復理智啦——真是他媽的太好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924548
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我還以為你真的會因為電視上沒有報導過的爛事而一槍打爆我的腦袋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924549
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 媽的，你就是個白癡。我本以為你是個能靠得住的人，結果——沒想到是一隻害群之馬！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924550
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你遲早會害死自己身邊的每一個人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924551
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 兄弟……如果我真的是個偽人，別告訴我——直接開槍，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924552
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924553
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924554
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924555
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924556
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924557
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924558
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 好的，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924559
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924560
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我有很嚴重的暴牙。三不五時，會咬破自己的臉頰。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924561
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 然後，嘴巴裡面就會生瘡……感覺特別的不舒服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924562
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924563
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924564
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 沒問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924565
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924566
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你要知道……這件夾克是以廉價材料製成的，會讓我長一堆疹子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924567
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 如何？沒什麼不對勁的地方——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924568
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924569
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924570
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我會讓你看眼睛的，只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924571
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我有一點緊張。不要太苛刻了，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924572
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924573
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 如何？沒什麼問題吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924574
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924575
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924576
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 關於腋窩……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924577
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924578
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我很清楚皮膚搔癢是一項特徵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924579
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 然而，我得先說清楚……全都是這件夾克害的——我穿著它會流很多汗。而且，最近根本就沒有辦法洗澡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924580
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924581
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924582
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我是不介意拍照啦，但……你這台相機怎麼怪怪的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924583
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924584
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 哇哦，這就是廣告上說的靈光照片嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924585
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 恕我直言——你看起來不像是會相信這種東西的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924586
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924587
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924588
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924589
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 要是我沒記錯的話，耳朵並非特徵——對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924590
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 不過，我也承認……其實，我不太清楚都有些什麼樣的特徵。或許，我剛好漏看了關於耳朵的報導也說不定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924591
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924592
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 如何？沒什麼問題吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924593
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924594
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924595
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我是偽人？但、但是，我的牙齒明明是東倒西歪的呀！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924596
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 拜託——不要開槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924597
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924598
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924599
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等，我早就說過了——我是因為這件夾克而長的這些疹子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924600
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等，我的手上根本就沒有任何東西！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924601
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我並不是偽人！拜託——不要開槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924602
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924603
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924604
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 什麼？我是偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924605
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 但、但是，我的眼睛根本就沒有半點的血絲呀！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924606
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924607
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924608
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 該死……我真的是偽人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924609
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 該死，該死，該死！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924610
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924611
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924612
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等、等等！出什麼問題了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924613
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 難道，那個所謂的「靈光」……顯現出什麼東西了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924614
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924615
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924616
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等——我的耳朵怎麼了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924617
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 出什麼問題了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924618
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924619
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924620
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 謝謝你……沒有扣下扳機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924621
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我的眼前都已經開始閃過人生跑馬燈了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924622
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你是故意的，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924623
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我的心臟都快從嘴巴裡跳出來了。你為什麼要做這種事情？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924624
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 到底是出於什麼原因？你為什麼……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924625
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924626
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 難道，瞳孔抽搐也是一項特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924627
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924628
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 好吧，我的確是不知道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924629
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你改變主意、不殺我了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924630
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924631
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 謝謝你……沒有扣下扳機。只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924632
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 如果你並不確定我到底是不是偽人，就不要急著拿出槍來指著我的腦袋、把我給嚇個半死——好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924633
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你把這件夾克上的圖案誤認為是特徵了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924634
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 呼……我還擔心上面會有一堆斑點來著。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924635
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 那個靈光相機……真是有夠奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924636
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 所以——我並不是偽人，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924637
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924638
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 既然如此，你又為什麼要把槍給掏出來？簡直不可理喻！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924639
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 媽媽，還有爸爸……我很抱歉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924640
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我很抱歉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414656
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不會任人擺佈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414657
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414658
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414659
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414660
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414661
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414662
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414663
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我的犬齒外凸，從小就是這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414664
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 經常因此而被嘲笑。現在？哼……再也沒人敢這樣做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414665
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414666
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 因為，我會把他們的牙齒給扯出來、讓這些傢伙再也笑不出聲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414667
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414668
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414669
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我喜歡把自己打扮得漂漂亮亮的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414670
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 雖然從來都沒有人對我這麼說過，但——自己能這樣認為，也挺好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414671
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414672
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 媽的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414673
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 為什麼會有缺角？到底是怎麼搞的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414674
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 唉……罷了，隨便吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414675
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414676
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414677
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我這輩子看到過的爛事數不勝數。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414678
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我相信——只要你看得足夠仔細，就能透過我的雙眼看到它們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414679
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414680
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 如我所料。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414681
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414682
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414683
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 想都別想。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414684
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 難道，你也是一個癡迷於這項特徵的怪胎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414685
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不想再殺人了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414686
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不想再失望了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414687
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414688
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414689
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我平時不怎麼拍照。不過，試試無妨——就來看看會是什麼樣好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414690
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414691
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 雖然我不太相信「靈光」之類的鬼話，但……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414692
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 好像的確有點道理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414693
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414694
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414695
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 其實，我前不久剛剛打好耳洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414696
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414697
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我很喜歡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414698
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我從前有試過戴小耳環，但——一直都找不到自己喜歡的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414699
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 然而，這副……還挺合我意的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414700
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414701
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414702
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你指錯威脅對象了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414703
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 這棟房子裡的怪物，絕對不可能會是我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414704
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414705
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414706
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 怎麼——難道，你想要我把壓克力指甲給卸掉？絕無可能。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414707
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414708
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414709
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我得時時留意身邊的一切事物。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414710
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 一、切、事、物。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414711
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我也沒有辦法。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414712
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 真希望能忘掉一半自己親眼見到過的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414713
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 說實話，即便全部忘掉也無所謂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414714
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 但……只能說，事情從來都不會那麼簡單。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414715
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414716
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414717
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 媽的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414718
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414719
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414720
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 好吧。看來……對你而言，並非如此。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414721
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414722
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414723
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你到底發現了什麼東西？耳垢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414724
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你他媽的為什麼要拿槍指著我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414725
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414726
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414727
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你是在測試我嗎？怎樣——我通過了嗎？我並沒有退縮，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414728
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 然而……被人拿槍指著腦袋，還是非常的不舒服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414729
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我也知道——如今這個世道，外表早就已經沒有那麼重要了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414730
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 然而，能看起來……體面一點、能喜歡鏡子裡面的自己，感覺還是很好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414731
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我很討厭看到外面正在發生的種種事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414732
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 然而……短時間內，現狀恐怕很難會有所改變。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414733
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我們唯一能做的，就是堅持下去、繼續奮鬥。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414734
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 跟我說說——你真的認為這樣做值得嗎？你會僅僅因為自己心血來潮，就掏出槍來、打爆我的腦袋嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414735
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 而且……在那之後，你會檢查我的屍體嗎——哪怕只是草草地看一眼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414736
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 整個世界都被詛咒了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414737
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 跟我說說——你相信靈光、靈魂，或者是諸如此類的東西嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414738
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 照你看來，混蛋死掉之後、還會是混蛋嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414739
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我一直都在想……等這一切都結束後，那些性格軟弱、易受操控的人會落得什麼下場？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414740
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 他們到底會變成怎樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414741
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你真的要扣下扳機嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414742
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 看來，一切就到此為止了。我的鬥爭……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414743
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 竟然會在某個孤僻怪胎的房子裡落下帷幕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414744
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 好的，朋友——沒有問題。你想檢查什麼地方呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414745
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414746
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414747
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414748
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414749
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414750
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414751
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 好吧……我三不五時會抽上一根菸。希望口氣沒有因此變太臭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414752
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414753
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 如何——沒什麼問題吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414754
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414755
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414756
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我，呃……得了濕疹。正因如此，手臂上才會綁著繃帶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414757
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414758
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 之前不知道在哪裡聽說過，把患處給包起來會有所幫助。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414759
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 雖然已經好得差不多了，但——保險起見，我還是想要換一下繃帶。你該不會剛好有一些備用的吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414760
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414761
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414762
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你應該也已經注意到了吧？我的眼睛上長了個難看的東西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414763
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414764
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 完全不知道是什麼時候冒出來的。發現時，把我給嚇壞了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414765
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414766
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414767
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 千萬別被嚇到，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414768
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414769
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 只不過是皮膚問題罷了。你看——我就連一根頭髮也沒有，而且全身上下都長著類似的斑塊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414770
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 該死……我已經很久沒洗過澡了。不好意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414771
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414772
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 腋窩……也就只是腋窩而已，沒什麼特別的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414773
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414774
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414775
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 哎呀，我超級喜歡這個的。好了——開拍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414776
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414777
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 如何？快點，讓我看看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414778
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414779
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414780
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 好的，沒有問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414781
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414782
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我超討厭清理耳垢——真的。要是不小心戳得太深的話，會非常、非常的痛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414783
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414784
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414785
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 拜託，到底出什麼事了？我們……不是聊得好好的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414786
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414787
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414788
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 好、好吧，我知道了！沒必要把槍給掏出來吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414789
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我不會再問你要繃帶了，我沒事啦、我沒事啦！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414790
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414791
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414792
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 拜託，沒什麼大不了的啦！我又不是快要死了還是怎樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414793
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 再說，去看醫生也沒有意義啦。你也知道他們會怎麼說：「小病自己好，大病治不了！」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414794
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 而這？當然是小病啦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414795
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414796
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414797
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 放輕鬆點，好嗎？一切都好得很——不要拿槍指著我的腦袋！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414798
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414799
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414800
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 媽的，兄弟——要是成品很差的話，我們大可重拍一張！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414801
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 又或者說，其實……你的相機已經壞掉了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414802
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414803
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414804
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我根本就什麼也沒有做！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414805
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414806
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414807
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我們沒有錢去看牙醫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414808
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 其實……除了吃的東西之外，我們幾乎什麼都買不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414809
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我媽三不五時會用剩下的碎布幫我縫幾件衣服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414810
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 某次，我跟那群朋友喝得爛醉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414811
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 整個場面混亂不堪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414812
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我甚至連自己的手都認不出來了，感覺特別、特別的陌生。就像是在看第一人稱視角電影一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414813
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 幸好，我並沒有因此而做出什麼蠢事。雖然穿錯了一隻鞋子，但也順利地回到了家中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414814
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 然而，事後還是把我給嚇了個魂飛魄散。從那之後，我就把酒給戒掉了。要是繼續像那樣喝下去的話，怕是早晚會丟掉小命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414815
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 起初，我的確是被嚇得不輕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414816
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 心想，要是視力因此降低、甚至瞎了的話，該怎麼辦。越想越慌。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414817
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 然而，什麼事情都沒發生。我的眼睛已經維持這種狀態好幾年了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414818
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 至於治療……需要花費一大筆錢，我根本就負擔不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414819
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 好吧……我能說什麼呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414820
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你很危險，朋友——誰活、誰死，全都在你一念之間。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414821
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 真是糟糕透頂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414822
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 某次……就跟往常一樣，我們又聚在一起喝酒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414823
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 幾天之後，我們留意到有個朋友根本沒有回家。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414824
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我們把她的照片給列印了出來，四處張貼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414825
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 結果，你猜怎麼樣？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414826
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我們後來得知，她不小心滑倒、掉進了河裡，最終淹死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414827
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 真是糟糕透頂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414828
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 她是一個非常好的女孩。而且，也長得很漂亮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414829
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我媽以前經常會幫我採耳——我特別享受這個過程。她非常溫柔，從來都沒有弄痛過我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414830
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 然而，她再也沒有辦法這樣做了。她的手指……都已經被打斷了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414831
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 該死……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414832
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你他媽的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414833
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414834
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我想起了被關在病房裡的時候，嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414835
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414836
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414837
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414838
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414839
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414840
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414841
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 藥物使我的牙齒變得有點薄薄的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414842
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414843
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我很喜歡用它們來刮自己的臉頰，把皮膚一條條地、一層層地給撕扯下來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414844
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 直至流下鮮血、感到刺疼為止。哎呀，那種痛楚……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414845
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414846
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414847
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我已經學會了不再去挖自己的指甲了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414848
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414849
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 然而，每當有倒刺翹起來、我都會忍不住把它們給撕掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414850
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 慢慢地把肉給剝下來，細細地品味隨之而來的灼痛。嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414851
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 一般而言，這種感覺只會持續一陣子。因此，我會趁著傷口還新鮮時把手抵在地上不斷摩擦……嗯唔……既堅硬、又鋒利，還很粗糙……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414852
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 一般而言，這種感覺只會持續一陣子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414853
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414854
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414855
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我喜歡你的眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414856
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414857
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我會在你睡覺時望著你。我會在你夜間四處走動時盯著你……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414858
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你好像……不太相信別人嘛？嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414859
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414860
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414861
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 從來都沒有人教過我該怎麼去照顧自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414862
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 不過，我倒是有看到過他們在醫院裡是怎麼打理自己的就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414863
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414864
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我總是做不好。嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414865
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 現在，我也能做到了。嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414866
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414867
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414868
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我不喜歡這樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414869
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嗯唔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414870
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414871
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 他們總是會嘲笑我……現在？他們永遠都笑不出來囉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414872
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414873
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414874
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我一直都沒有清理過它們。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414875
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414876
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 沒有意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414877
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 沒有喜悅，沒有痛苦。沒有意義。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414878
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414879
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414880
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 粗糙的鬃毛刮過牙齦……噢——天啊，太棒了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414881
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 然而，這個……實在太超過了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414882
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414883
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414884
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 為什麼呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414885
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414886
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414887
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414888
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我並沒有趁你睡著的時候痛下殺手……起碼，現在還沒有這個意思！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414889
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你怎麼能這樣呢？我明明既弱小、又可憐……嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414890
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414891
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414892
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 哎呀？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414893
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 光滑的腋窩，反而……說明我是個惡魔？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414894
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 然而……嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414895
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414896
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414897
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你……人真好，嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414898
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414899
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414900
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你為什麼要拿槍指著我呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414901
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 難道，你就比較好嗎？你會比較乾淨嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414902
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414903
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414904
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我的腦子……被醫院裡的傢伙給搞壞了啦。滋、滋、滋！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414905
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 然而，唯一能幫我的人……就只有我自己。嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414906
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我開始咬臉頰之後，就不再去挖指甲了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414907
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414908
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 竟然敢拿槍指著一個知道你會在什麼地方、什麼時候睡覺的人……嘻嘻——真的好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414909
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 偽人和那些與群體、與環境格格不入的人，到底有什麼不同？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414910
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 兩者都不被社會接納……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414911
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你能辨別得出來嗎？你能嗎——你能嗎？嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414912
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 一道陰影籠罩著我……嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414913
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 會是什麼東西呢？難道，是有人站在那裡？又或者說……是某種詭異的眩光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414914
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 哎呀，那些條紋狀的東西是什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414915
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 難道……是針？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414916
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 又或者說，只是漏光而已？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414917
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你為什麼要拿槍指著我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414918
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 難道，是有人命令你這樣做嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414919
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 如何——是他們嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414920
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 不是？好吧……只不過是隨口說說罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414921
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414922
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 也許，我根本就不應該……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414923
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 到這裡來……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414924
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好吧，要是這能令你感到好過一些的話。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414925
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414926
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414927
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414928
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414929
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414930
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414931
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 看到了嗎？正常得很。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414932
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414933
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 而且，還非常整齊呢。沒錯，我的皮膚是亂七八糟的——然而，我的牙齒是完美無瑕的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414934
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我全身上下就只剩下這個部位是完好的了……你總不會出於這個原因而一槍打爆我的腦袋吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414935
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 一點都不整齊，也就是說——我並不是偽人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414936
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414937
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414938
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 沒錯，我手上的皮膚狀況也不太好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414939
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414940
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你總不會把這看作一項特徵，對吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414941
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414942
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414943
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好的，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414944
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414945
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我知道眼睛發紅、充滿血絲是一項特徵。但……這個？跟其他部位一樣，只不過是討厭的皮膚問題罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414946
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 對啦，我都忘記跟你說了——拜與生俱來的皮膚問題所賜，我的眼睛偶爾會不斷地抽搐。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414947
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414948
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414949
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 蛤？為什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414950
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414951
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好吧，隨便你了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414952
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414953
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 看到了嗎？一切正常，對吧？雖然……腋窩的皮膚完全沒有任何問題，令我感到挺奇怪的就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414954
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 沒錯，我腋窩的皮膚狀況也不太好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414955
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414956
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414957
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 拍照……也能看出什麼特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414958
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414959
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好吧，沒有問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414960
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414961
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我好像眨眼了。好了——這樣到底能看出什麼特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414962
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好了——這樣到底能看出什麼特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414963
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414964
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414965
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 「耳朵」？你這是什麼意思？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414966
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 無意冒犯，但——我很清楚偽人的特徵裡沒有一項是與耳朵相關的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414967
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 不過……要是你真的想看的話，就隨你好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414968
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414969
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 如何——有發現什麼奇怪的東西嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414970
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414971
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414972
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你他媽的到底有什麼毛病？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414973
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414974
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414975
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我不是說了嗎？只是皮膚問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414976
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414977
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414978
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414979
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我不是說過了嗎——都是皮膚問題導致的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414980
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414981
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414982
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你這是在開什麼玩笑？為什麼啊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414983
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414984
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414985
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 不對，等等——你手上的這台根本就不是普通的相機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414986
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你拍出來的……是靈光照片？難道，你要因為這種瞎掰的靈性檢測而一槍打爆我的腦袋？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414987
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414988
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414989
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你是認真的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414990
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我再說一遍——偽人的特徵裡沒有一項是與耳朵相關的！電視上根本就沒有報導過！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414991
    m_Localized: 向其開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414992
    m_Localized: 把話聽完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414993
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 媽的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414994
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你為什麼要拿槍指著我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414995
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 謝謝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414996
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我還以為你真的會因為我的外表而一槍打爆我的腦袋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414997
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 媽的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414998
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 難道……每當你覺得自己找到了一項特徵，都會把槍給掏出來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414999
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415000
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你跟那些覺得我得了什麼傳染病的傢伙根本就沒有任何不同。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415001
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你的腦子進水了嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415002
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 不過就是一台江湖騙子搞出來的破爛，什麼時候成了辨別偽人的權威儀器了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415003
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 該死……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415004
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你差點把我給嚇出心臟病來了。你到底是從什麼地方聽說耳朵的事情的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415005
    m_Localized: 'Leper: FEMA根本就沒有公佈過相關的特徵！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415006
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 媽的，我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415007
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 不想死……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621056
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 沒問題！你想檢查什麼地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621057
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621058
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621059
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621060
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621061
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621062
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621063
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 來——看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621064
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621065
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我的牙齒一直都不太好。然而，自畢業後、我都找不到機會去看牙醫。夏天實在是……太過忙了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621066
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621067
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621068
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 來——看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621069
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621070
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 都是小時候東跑西顛留下的印記。從前，我經常會和三五好友去廢棄的地方「探險」。某次，我們到了一個地上鋪滿金屬絲網的地方……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621071
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 其中一個傢伙在櫃子上滑倒了，後者就這麼掉了下來、砸在了我的手上，留下了這樣的傷疤……恐怕，會跟我一輩子吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621072
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 哎呀，不過……這些劃痕都是新的。我……只是有點緊張而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621073
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621074
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621075
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 來——看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621076
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621077
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我的眼睛經常會因為氣溫升高而變紅。冷敷能對此有所幫助，但——如今這個世道，想這樣做……並不簡單。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621078
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 大家總是會對我的瞳色議論紛紛。其中的一些是好話，剩下的嘛……就不那麼中聽了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621079
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621080
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621081
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 好吧……要是你堅持的話。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621082
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 來——看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621083
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621084
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 不好意思，稍微……有一點臭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621085
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621086
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621087
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 聽起來挺有趣的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621088
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621089
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 嗯哼。結果也挺有趣的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621090
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621091
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621092
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 來——看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621093
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621094
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我也知道……稍微有一點髒。最近，實在是沒有什麼時間來打理自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621095
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621096
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621097
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我會去漱口的！抱歉！我、我並沒有帶牙刷。拜託——千萬別開槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621098
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621099
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621100
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我的指甲？只是前幾天在暗處不小心被一塊鬆動的金屬勾到了，僅此而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621101
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 只是孩提時代留下的傷疤，僅此而已！我能保證——除此之外，我的雙手沒有任何問題！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621102
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621103
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621104
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我能從冰箱裡拿點冰涼的東西嗎？我從小到大都是這樣的體質——我、我可以證明給你看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621105
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 好吧、好吧！不開玩笑了！拜託——千萬別開槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621106
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621107
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621108
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 抱歉。我並沒有帶任何的盥洗用品，而且……我覺得擅自用別人的東西也不太禮貌。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621109
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621110
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621111
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 希望你不會因為一點小事而對我產生偏見。畢竟，並不是什麼特別嚴重的問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621112
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009664
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009665
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我、我會好好清理耳朵的！拜託——千萬別開槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009666
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009667
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009668
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 非常感謝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009669
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我會盡可能地打理好自己的牙齒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009670
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 呼……我還以為你真的會因為我的這塊傷疤而一槍打爆我的腦袋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009671
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 如今——想要打理好自己的指甲，並不簡單。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009672
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 不過……保險起見，我會盡可能地做好清潔工作。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009673
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 非常感謝你的理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009674
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我也對自己的這種體質感到頭痛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009675
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……順帶一提，你的瞳色非常漂亮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009676
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 謝謝你……沒有扣下扳機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009677
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我會設法騰出時間，好好打理一下自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009678
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我想……如果只因為一張照片、就要大開殺戒，也太過荒謬了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009679
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 雖然是一次非常有趣的體驗，但……我並不想為此送命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009680
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 謝謝你……饒了我一命。我會盡快處理好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009681
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我得去找一根棉棒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009682
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009683
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 媽媽……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009684
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 來吧——反正，也沒有什麼更好的事情可做了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009685
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009686
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009687
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009688
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009689
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009690
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009691
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哎喲，拜託——如果刷牙時太過用力，會使釉質受到磨損喔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009692
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009693
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哈哈，我都忘了自己缺一顆牙齒。背後的故事還挺有意思的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009694
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009695
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009696
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 只是一雙因工作而歷盡滄桑、平平無奇的手，僅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009697
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009698
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我在工廠裡待了整整十四年。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009699
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 然而，卻落得了這樣的下場。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009700
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009701
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009702
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我的虹膜上有一塊黑色的斑點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009703
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 喏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009704
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009705
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 正因如此，我的視野裡總是會有一個小小的斑點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009706
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不過，時間一久、就慢慢地不會再去在意了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009707
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009708
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009709
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我所在的工廠，就是個隨時都有可能會引發訴訟的地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009710
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我早就已經到了該退休的年齡了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009711
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009712
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好了——結果，我便因長時間待在濕氣較重的地方而得了這種毛病。藥膏？根本沒用！而且，他們竟然還好意思要求我們把腋毛給剃光！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009713
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好了——結果，我便因長時間待在濕氣較重的地方而得了這種毛病。藥膏？根本沒用！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009714
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009715
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009716
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哎呀。看來，我該把鈕扣給扣上了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009717
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 唉……罷啦，不管了。不就是拍一張照片嗎？沒什麼大不了的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009718
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009719
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不、不，沒必要向我展示。去他的吧，我一點都不想看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009720
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好吧，來看看拍得怎麼樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009721
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009722
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009723
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 來吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009724
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009725
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好在，工廠裡沒有什麼東西能傷到我們的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009726
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009727
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009728
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哇哦，冷靜一點。不要讓一時的情緒沖昏自己的頭腦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009729
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009730
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009731
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你怎麼突然之間變得這麼激動？冷靜一點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009732
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009733
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009734
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 唉……罷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009735
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你想開槍？好吧——隨你高興。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009736
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009737
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009738
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哈！的確，這樣能解決所有問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009739
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不管什麼事情，都能在一瞬之間擺平！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009740
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009741
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009742
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哈哈，最明顯的特徵——你手中的這把霰彈槍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009743
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009744
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009745
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 總是動不動就把槍給掏出來到處亂揮……你都不會膩的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009746
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009747
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009748
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好吧，謝謝你……沒有扣下扳機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009749
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 關於牙齒背後的故事？不、不，老兄——你怎麼會覺得前一刻明明還拿槍指著我，後一刻就能相安無事、談天說地啊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009750
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你能想像嗎？某天，你一如既往地去上班——結果……卻被告知自己遭解僱了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009751
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 每天都拚死拚活地在工作，到頭來也不知道為了什麼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009752
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 因為虧損越來越嚴重，他們決定把工廠關掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009753
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 現在，就連安詳地死去都也已經無法做到了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009754
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你到底還想聽到一些什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009755
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我看得非常清楚——不管是你，抑或是剛剛拿來指著我的那把霰彈槍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009756
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 就讓上天來審判你好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009757
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 看來，我現在……應該可以說是終於退休了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009758
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不僅失去了工作，銀行也把我的錢給全吞了。而且，太陽還將一切烤得面目全非。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009759
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 生活真是處處都充滿「驚喜」——就像是在童話故事裡一樣！哈哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009760
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不知道為什麼……不管是我、還是我的家人，都會對照片產生這種不太好的反應。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009761
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 他們總是會說：「你幹嘛要把相機給帶進來啦？去拍青蛙或者類似的東西啦。」'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009762
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 看來，我也繼承了這一特點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009763
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 然而——就這樣把我的錢給拿走，也太不公平了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009764
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 就這樣把我們從工廠裡趕了出來，也太不公平了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009765
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哎呀……你還真是一個有趣的傢伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009766
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 罷了。看來——對我來說，一切都結束了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009767
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我要從這個世上退休了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009768
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 要是他們就連整理資訊、彙整報導都已經費盡了心思的話，我實在不敢想像篩選工作究竟會有多麼的馬虎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009769
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009770
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009771
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009772
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009773
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009774
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009775
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 事先聲明，我可是個牙尖嘴利的商界強人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009776
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 哈哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009777
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009778
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我又怎麼會漏掉這裡，不細心呵護、好好裝點呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009779
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 其實，我前不久剛剛讓人把它們給磨平——牙齦直到現在都還痛得要命。不過，這樣能讓我看起來像是個狂人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009780
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009781
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009782
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我遇上了些倒楣事，不小心傷到了指甲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009783
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我本來叫了一輛計程車。心想，能比較安全地抵達城郊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009784
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 然而……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009785
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009786
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 某個目中無人的混蛋把我給推到了一邊、強行坐了進去，臉上露出狡黠的微笑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009787
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我直到現在都還記得很清楚——他那口完美無瑕的潔白牙齒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009788
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009789
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009790
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 哎呀——我的眼睛？我特別喜歡它們，就跟我的刺青一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009791
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009792
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你覺得呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009793
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009794
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009795
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我不介意露出腋窩。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009796
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 只是……事先聲明，並不怎麼賞心悅目。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009797
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009798
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我已經警告過你了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009799
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009800
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009801
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 哎呀——哇哦，你也有一台相機。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009802
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009803
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 來看看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009804
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009805
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009806
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009807
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009808
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 路上全是醉漢，一直來騷擾我——於是，我只好走隧道離開。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009809
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009810
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009811
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 先等一下。你不覺得這些「特徵」太模糊了嗎？難道，你不會因此而感到困惑嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009812
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 畢竟，尋常人類也有可能會具備同樣的特質。你不覺得這些描述……太過廣泛、有點可疑嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009813
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009814
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009815
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你……該不會覺得錯在於我吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009816
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你到底覺得我做了什麼？難道，被人推倒在地、指甲因此折斷，是我的問題囉？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009817
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你到底覺得我做了什麼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009818
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009819
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009820
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 蛤？不是——到底為什麼啊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009821
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009822
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009823
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 不要慌張。我只是嘗試了一下利用高溫來淡化刺青，僅此而已。結果……卻導致了一些奇怪的狀況。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009824
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你自己試試看就知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009825
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 不光痛得要命，而且全身上下都會不停冒汗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009826
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009827
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009828
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我也知道——看著的確有點奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009829
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 然而，我只是想讓自己看起來比較引人注目而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009830
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我並不打算拍一張要拿來放在訃聞上的照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009831
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009832
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009833
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 好吧，我有點後悔走隧道離開了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009834
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 起碼……即便遭遇不測，也知道是什麼原因。不像現在這樣，死得不明不白。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009835
    m_Localized: 向她開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009836
    m_Localized: 聽她說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009837
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我想先休息一下，好嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009838
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 受到死亡威脅，令我有點……筋疲力盡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009839
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我絕對不會因為幾根指甲而返回城裡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009840
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 誰也不知道當我重新踏進這一系列的爛攤子後，到底會發生什麼事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009841
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我大部分的刺青，都是在某個親近的人過世後紋的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009842
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 就像是……用墨水將回憶封存起來一樣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009843
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 如你所見，生活並不輕鬆。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009844
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 當失去自己的靈魂伴侶時……我選擇直接在眼球上刺青。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009845
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 如此一來……每次照鏡子時，我都能見到他。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009846
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 不要把刺青紋在奇怪的部位——真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009847
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 然而，遺憾的是……沒有人會為我哀悼。我死去後，沒有人會留存關於我的回憶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009848
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我們還真是活在了一個奇怪的時代……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009849
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 雖然費勁千辛萬苦離開了馬戲團，但……沒想到那些小丑竟然也一起跟了過來。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009850
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 真是嚇人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009851
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你認為我被感染了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009852
    m_Localized: 牙齒
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009853
    m_Localized: 雙手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009854
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009855
    m_Localized: 腋窩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009856
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009857
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009858
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你的意思是說……透過牙齒，能判斷出我是否被感染了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009859
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009860
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 好吧，要是能幫上忙的話……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009861
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009862
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 如你所見，挺整齊的——對吧？在我的家鄉，牙醫的收費並沒有那麼貴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009863
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009864
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009865
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 雙手？難道……你是在找疹子之類的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009866
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009867
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 不要害怕——被曬黑後，我的皮膚就變得癢癢的。我三不五時會去抓撓一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009868
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 只是有點曬傷，僅此而已。並沒有被感染。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009869
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009870
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009871
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 眼睛？沒有問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009872
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009873
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 真是遺憾——面對這種狀況，太陽眼鏡基本派不上用場。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009874
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 幸好，我帶了太陽眼鏡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009875
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009876
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009877
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 蛤？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009878
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009879
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009880
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 說實話——一切都得怪這個鬼天氣。每天都這麼熱，我的汗也因此流個不停。久而久之，就長了一堆疹子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009881
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009882
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009883
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 難道，這是……某種政府用來檢測感染的技術？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009884
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 要是這樣的話，我很樂意嘗試。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009885
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009886
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 哎呀？這張照片……好像有點奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009887
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 而且……不知道為什麼，上面竟然還有一些斑點。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009888
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009889
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009890
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 哎呀……沒錯，的確如此——萬一病毒透過耳道傳播，該怎麼辦？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009891
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009892
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 我想，應該不會有什麼問題。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009893
    m_Localized: 不再理會
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009894
    m_Localized: 拔出槍來
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009895
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 怎麼了？有什麼問題嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009896
    m_Localized: 開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009897
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009898
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 拜託，我都跟你說了——因為好像有點發炎，所以我會忍不住去抓撓！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009899
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 難道，被曬黑也成了一項特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009900
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009901
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 為什麼要掏出槍來？就因為我雙眼紅腫？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009902
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 為什麼要掏出槍來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009903
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 我的眼睛完全沒有任何問題！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009904
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009905
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009906
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你是想說……疹子也是一項特徵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009907
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009908
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009909
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 為什麼啊？拜託，我只不過是說了一句「有點奇怪」罷了！我從來都沒有見到過這樣的照片！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009910
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009911
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009912
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 等等——出什麼問題了嗎？我根本就沒有任何的耳垢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009913
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009914
    m_Localized: 聽他說完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009915
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009916
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你為什麼要拿槍指著我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009917
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 能把槍放下嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009918
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 我可以理解，但——這也太超過了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009919
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 拜託，只不過是被曬黑了而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009920
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009921
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 不管是誰，你都是以這種方式來對待的嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009922
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 怎麼——不扣下扳機嗎？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009923
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 搞什麼鬼？現在，甚至能在腋窩發現某項特徵了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009924
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 拜託——冷靜一點！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009925
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 媽的……你為什麼每次都要把槍給掏出來？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009926
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 明明是你自己說要拍照的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009927
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009928
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你瘋了嗎？拜託，你手上的這把東西可不是什麼玩具。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009929
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 不要再把槍給掏出來到處亂揮了！不然，早晚會把人給一個不剩地全嚇跑！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009930
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 該死……我沒能去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009931
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 見識一下這個世界……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94177391876841472
    m_Localized: 向他開槍
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
